<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="EXO" style="id">- Gofa Full Bible Latin Version Final</book>
  <para style="h">Kessa Maxaafa</para>
  <para style="toc1">Kessa Maxaafa</para>
  <para style="toc3">Kessa</para>
  <para style="toc2">Kessa</para>
  <para style="mt1">Kessa Maxaafa</para>
  <para style="imt">Gaatha Qofa</para>
  <para style="ip">Ha maxaafa suntha birshethay “Keydi buussu” woyko “Kessi” guussu. Ha maxaafay, Isra7eele asay Gibxe biitta aylletetha duussaafe waanidi keydako qoncisees. Ha maxaafay oyddu gita qofatan shaaketees.</para>
  <para style="ipi">Isra7eele asaa aylletethafe la77a kessaa</para>
  <para style="ipi">Isra7eele asay Siina zuma gakanaw bida buussaa</para>
  <para style="ipi">Xoossay ba asara caaqida caaquwanne immida dumma dumma higgeta</para>
  <para style="ipi">Geeshsha dunkaaniya keexo, iya giddon go7etiya miishetanne kahineta ma7o.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ha maxaafay, Xoossay ba asaa aylletethafe kessiya wode ay oothidaako, qassi ufaysa qaala immida dere waatidi oothidaako qoncisidi bessees.</para>
  <para style="ip">Xoossay Yayqooba sheeshi gidida Isra7eele asaa Gibxe biittafe kessiya wode enta kaalethana mela Xoossay xeegida addey Muse.</para>
  <para style="iot">Maxaafa Ayfe Qofata</para>
  <para style="io1">Isra7eele asaa aylletetha duussaa <char style="ior">(<ref loc="EXO 1:1-22">1:1-22</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Muse yeletethinne na7atetha wodiya <char style="ior">(<ref loc="EXO 2:1-25">2:1-25</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Museynne Aaroni Gibxe kawa sinthan <char style="ior">(<ref loc="EXO 3:1-6:30">3:1—6:30</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Tammu gadotanne Paasika Ba7aale <char style="ior">(<ref loc="EXO 7:1-13:22">7:1—13:22</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Isra7eele asay zo7o abba pinethi <char style="ior">(<ref loc="EXO 14:1-15:21">14:1—15:21</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Zo7o Abbaafe Siina Zuma gakanaw <char style="ior">(<ref loc="EXO 15:22-18:27">15:22—18:27</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Tammu kiitatanne hara higgeta <char style="ior">(<ref loc="EXO 19:1-24:18">19:1—24:18</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Geeshsha dunkaaniyanne iya giddon go7etiya miisheta <char style="ior">(<ref loc="EXO 25:1-27:21">25:1—27:21</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kahinetas imetida kiita, yarshonne sambaata <char style="ior">(<ref loc="EXO 28:1-31:18">28:1—31:18</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Isra7eele asay bantaw eeqa medhidosona <char style="ior">(<ref loc="EXO 32:1-35">32:1-35</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Xoossay ba caaquwa oorathidi hara higgeta immis <char style="ior">(<ref loc="EXO 33:1-35:3">33:1—35:3</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Geeshsha dunkaaniyas imetida imotanne kahineta ma7o <char style="ior">(<ref loc="EXO 35:4-36:7">35:4—36:7</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Geeshsha dunkaaniya keexida hiilanchota <char style="ior">(<ref loc="EXO 36:8-38:31">36:8—38:31</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kahineta ma7onne Geeshsha dunkaaniya eso <char style="ior">(<ref loc="EXO 39:1-40:30">39:1—40:30</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="ie"/>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="EXO 1"/>
  <para style="s1">Isra7eele Asaa Un7etetha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 1:1"/>Banta soo asaa ubba ekidi, Yayqoobara Gibxe bida Isra7eele adde nayta sunthay haysafe kaallidi xaafetidaysa; <verse eid="EXO 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 1:2"/>Entika Robeela, Simoona, Leewe, Yihuda, <verse eid="EXO 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 1:3"/>Yisakoora, Zabloona, Biniyaame, <verse eid="EXO 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 1:4"/>Daane, Niftaaleme, Gaadenne Aseera. <verse eid="EXO 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 1:5"/>Yayqooba sheeshati ubbay laapun tamma. Yoosefi kaseka Gibxen de7ees. <verse eid="EXO 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 1:6"/>Wodepe guyen Yoosefi, iya ishatinne he yeletetha ubbay hayqidosona. <verse eid="EXO 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 1:7"/>Shin Isra7eele sheeshay yeletidi Gibxe biitta kumana gakanaw taybon daridosonanne minnidosona.<verse eid="EXO 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 1:8"/>Hessafe guye, Yoosefa eronna hara kawoy Gibxe biittan kawotis. <verse eid="EXO 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 1:9"/>He kawoy ba asaa, “Heko, ha Isra7eeleti nuupe aadhidi yeletethaninne wolqan daridosona. <verse eid="EXO 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 1:10"/>Nuuni hiillatonna ixiko enti taybon kaseysafe haa darana. Qoponna oli dendiko enti nu morketara issifidi nuna olidi, biitta yeggidi baanaw danda7oosona” yaagis. <verse eid="EXO 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 1:11"/>Hessa gisho, deexo ooson enta un7ethana mela enta bolla iita kaapota wothidosona. Enti Pitoomanne Ramse geetetiya shallo wothiya katamata kawas keexidosona. <verse eid="EXO 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 1:12"/>Shin Gibxeti enta darsi un7ethinka enti haa daridi yeletidosonanne biitta gakidosona. Gibxeti Isra7eeleta ixida gisho yayyidosona. <verse eid="EXO 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 1:13"/>Entana iita ooso oosisidosona. <verse eid="EXO 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 1:14"/>Urqa yedhison, siminton xuube medhon qassi gade oosison enta de7uwa camisidosona. Qadhey bayna deexo ooso ubbaa enta oosisidosona.<verse eid="EXO 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 1:15"/>Gibxe kawoy qantha Ibraawe maccasata ulo pittiya Sipooronne Puuho geetetiya nam7u maccasatako haysada yaagis; <verse eid="EXO 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 1:16"/>“Ibraawe maccasati yeliya wode yeletida na7ay adde gidiko wodhite, shin macca gidiko paxa aggite” yaagis. <verse eid="EXO 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 1:17"/>Shin ulo piteysati Xoosse babbidi, Gibxe kawoy kiitidaysada oothibookona. Enti adde nayta paxa aggidosona. <verse eid="EXO 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 1:18"/>Hessafe guye, Gibxe kawoy he ulo pitteyisata xeegidi, “Hinte ayis haysa oothidetii? Adde nayta ayis paxa aggetii?” yaagidi enta oychis.<verse eid="EXO 1:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 1:19"/>Ulo piteysati zaaridi, “Ibraawe maccasati Gibxe maccasata mela gidokona. Enti mino gidiya gisho ulo piteysati gakanaape sinthatidi yeloosona” yaagidosona.<verse eid="EXO 1:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 1:20"/>Hessa gisho, Xoossay ulo pitteysatas keehis. Isra7eele asay kaseysafe haa darshenne minnishe bidosona. <verse eid="EXO 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 1:21"/>Qassi ulo piteysati Xoossas yayyida gisho Xoossay entaw enta soo asi immis. <verse eid="EXO 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 1:22"/>Hessafe guye, kawoy ba asaa ubbaako, “Ibraawetape yeletiya adde ubbaa Nayle Shaafan yeggite; shin macca na7i yeletiko paxa aggite” yaagidi kiittis.<verse eid="EXO 1:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="EXO 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Muse Yeletetha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 2:1"/>He wode Leewe qommo gidida issi uray Leewe maccas issiw ekis. <verse eid="EXO 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 2:2"/>He maccasiya adde na7a yelasu. Na7ay mala lo77o gideysa be7ada heedzu ageena qosasu. <verse eid="EXO 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 2:3"/>Shin iya hessafe daro qosanaw danda7onnaysa erada, maqafe daacho dadada, made melaba tiyada na7aa iyan wothasu. Yaatada Nayle Shaafa gaxan mayca giddon wothasu. <verse eid="EXO 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 2:4"/>Iya michiya iya gakiyaba be7anaw haahon eqasu.<verse eid="EXO 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 2:5"/>Gibxe kawa na7iya bolla meecetanaw Nayle Shaafa wodhasu. I macca aylleti haatha doonan yaa haa simeretoosona. Iya daacho mayca giddon demmada, ba aylliw bada ehana mela kiittasu. <verse eid="EXO 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 2:6"/>Daacho dooyada he guutha na7aa be7asu. I yeekeysa be7ada qadhetada, “Haysi Ibraaweta guutha naytape issuwa” yaagasu.<verse eid="EXO 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 2:7"/>He wode iya michiya kawa na7eko, “Ha na7aa dhanthana mela Ibraawe maccas new eho?” yaagada oychasu.<verse eid="EXO 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 2:8"/>Iya, “Ee, eha” yaagasu. Na7iya bada na7aa aayiw ehasu. <verse eid="EXO 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 2:9"/>Kawa na7iya maccasiw, “Ha na7aa efada, taw dhantha; dicha; taani new damooze qanxana” yaagasu. Maccasiya na7aa efada dhanthasu. <verse eid="EXO 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 2:10"/>Na7ay diccin, kawa na7eko ehasu; I iw na7a gidis. “Taani haathaafe iya kessa ekas” gada, iya Muse<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:10 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Muse: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ibraawetho doonan Muse guussay “Keso” guussu </char></note> gada sunthasu.<verse eid="EXO 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Musey Midiyaame Biittan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 2:11"/>Musey diccidaape guye issi gallas ba asaa be7anaw bidi, enti deexo ooso oothishin enta be7is. Gibxe asi issoy Ibraawetape issuwa ba yara wadhishin be7is. <verse eid="EXO 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 2:12"/>I yaa haa xeellin, oonika baynaysa be7idi, he Gibxe ura wodhidi shafen qosis. <verse eid="EXO 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 2:13"/>Wontetha gallas keyidi, nam7u Ibraaweti wadhetishin be7is. Qoheysako, “Neeni ne dabbuwa ayis shocay?” yaagidi oychis.<verse eid="EXO 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 2:14"/>He uray, “Nena nu bolla haareysanne daynna oothiday oonee? Neeni zine Gibxe uraa wodhidaysada, tanaka wodhanaw koyay?” yaagis. Musey he wode, “Taani oothidabay asan eretis” yaagi qopidi yayyis.<verse eid="EXO 2:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 2:15"/>Kawoy hessa si7ida wode, Muse wodhisanaw koyis. Shin Musey betidi, Midiyaame biittan de7anaw bis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 2:15">Issi gallas I haatha olla doonan uttis.<verse eid="EXO 2:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 2:16"/>He wode Midiyaame kahine issuwas laapun macca nayti de7oosona. Enti banta aawa dorsata gongen haathe duuqi ushshanaw yidosona. <verse eid="EXO 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 2:17"/>Henthanchoti yidi macca nayta goodidosona. Shin Musey enta maaddidi enta dorsata haathe ushshis.<verse eid="EXO 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 2:18"/>Enti banta aawa Yetorako yida wode, “Hachi waani ellesi yidetii?” yaagidi oychis.<verse eid="EXO 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 2:19"/>Enti zaaridi, “Gibxe asi issoy nuna henthanchotape ashshis. Haathe duuqidi dorsata ushshis” yaagidosona.<verse eid="EXO 2:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 2:20"/>I ba macca nayta, “Yaatin I awun de7ii? Hinte he ura ayis aggidi yidetii? Nuura kathi maana mela ane iya xeegite” yaagis.<verse eid="EXO 2:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 2:21"/>Musey he addiyara yan de7anaw qofa qachis. Yotori ba na7iw Sipooro Muses macho oothidi immis. <verse eid="EXO 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 2:22"/>Sipoora adde na7a yelin, Musey iya, “Taani ha biittan bete asi” gidi Gersaama gidi sunthis.<verse eid="EXO 2:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 2:23"/>Daro laythafe guye Gibxe kawoy hayqis. Shin Isra7eeleti banta aylletethan un7etidi waassidosona. Banta aylletethan enti waassida waasoy Xoossaako gakis. <verse eid="EXO 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 2:24"/>Xoossay enta waasuwa si7idi, I Abrahaamera, Yisaaqaranne Yayqoobara caaqida caaquwa hassayis. <verse eid="EXO 2:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 2:25"/>Xoossay Isra7eeleta aylletetha un7aa be7idi entana qopis.<verse eid="EXO 2:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="EXO 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Muse Xeegetethaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 3:1"/>Issi wode Musey Midiyaame biitta kahiniya, ba bolluwa Yotora dorsaanne deesha heemmees. I he wudiya laagi ekidi mela biitta gaxan Xoossa zuma geetetidi xeegetiya Koreeba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:1 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Koreeba: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Koreeba zumaas hara sunthay Siina zuma.</char></note> zuma bolla efis. <verse eid="EXO 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 3:2"/>He bessan Godaa Kiitanchoy<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:2 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Godaa Kiitanchoy: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ha bessan Godaa Kiitancho geetetiday asaas qonciya Godaa woyko Xoossaa guussu.</char></note> tushiyan eexiya tama lacuwa giddon iyaw bentis. Musey tushey taman oyketinka tamay tushiya moonnaysa be7idi, <verse eid="EXO 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 3:3"/>“Taani yaa bada, tushey ayis taman meetetonnaako he oorathabaa shiiqada be7ana” gidi qopis.<verse eid="EXO 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 3:4"/>I be7anaw shiiqidaysa Goday be7idi, tushiya giddofe, “Muse! Muse!” gidi xeegis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 3:4">Musey, “Heko, abe Godaw” gidi koyis.<verse eid="EXO 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 3:5"/>Xoossay iyako, “Haa shiiqopa. Neeni eqida biittay geeshshi gidiya gisho, ne tohuwan de7iya caammaa kessa” yaagis. <verse eid="EXO 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 3:6"/>Goday iyako, “Taani ne aawata, Abrahaame, Yisaaqanne Yayqooba Xoossaa” yaagis. Musey Xoossaa ba7anaw yayyida gisho, ba som7uwa kammis.<verse eid="EXO 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 3:7"/>Goday qassika haysada yaagis; “Taani Gibxen de7iya ta asay ay mela waayako be7as. Enti bantana un7ethidi haareysatape ashshana mela taako waassiya waasuwa si7as. Enta waayaka erayis. <verse eid="EXO 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 3:8"/>Hessa gisho, taani enta Gibxe asaa kushepe ashshanawunne he biittafe enta kessada, ha77i Kanaaneti, Hiteti, Amooreti, Parzeti, Hiwetinne Yaabuseti de7iya biitta, maathinne eessi kumida lo77o biitta ehanaw wodhas. <verse eid="EXO 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 3:9"/>Ta deriya waasoy ha77i tana gakis. Gibxe asati enta qohida qohuwa taani be7as. <verse eid="EXO 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 3:10"/>Hessa gisho, ha77i neeni ta asaa iya biittafe kessana mela Gibxe kawako taani nena kiittayis” yaagis.<verse eid="EXO 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 3:11"/>Shin Musey, “Kawako baanawunne Isra7eeleta Gibxefe kessanaw taani oonee?” yaagis.<verse eid="EXO 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 3:12"/>Xoossay zaaridi, “Taani neera gidana. Qassi taani nena kiittidaysas mallay haysa; neeni ta asaa Gibxefe kessiya wode ha zuma bolla hinte tana goyinnana” yaagis.<verse eid="EXO 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 3:13"/>Musey Xoossaako, “Gidoshin, taani Isra7eeletako bada entako, ‘Hinte aawata Xoossay tana hinteko kiittis’ yaagiko, enti tana, ‘Iya sunthay oonee?’ yaagidi oychiko, taani entaw woygada zaaro” yaagis.<verse eid="EXO 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 3:14"/>“Xoossay Museko, ‘De7eysinne daanaysi, Tana’ neeni Isra7eeletako, ‘TAANI TANA GIDIDAYSI’ tana hinteko kiittis yaaga” yaagis.<verse eid="EXO 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 3:15"/>Xoossay zaaridi, “Neeni Isra7eeleta Goday hinte aawata, Abrahaame, Yisaaqanne Yayqooba Xoossay, tana hinteko kiittis. Haysi ta merina sunthaa; yaana yeletetha ubbay ha sunthan tana xeegana.<verse eid="EXO 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 3:16"/>“Bada Isra7eele cimata shiishada, Goday hinte aawata Xoossay, Abrahaame, Yisaaqanne Yayqooba Xoossay new qoncidaysa oda. Gibxen enti waayetiya waayiya taani xomoosada be7idaysa entaw oda. <verse eid="EXO 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 3:17"/>Taani entana Gibxe waayiyape kessada maathinne eessi kumida, Kanaaneta, Hiteta, Amooreta, Parzeta, Hiwetanne Yaabuseta biitta efanaw qaala gelas.<verse eid="EXO 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 3:18"/>“Isra7eele cimati ne giyaba si7ana. Hessafe guye, neeninne Isra7eele cimati Gibxe kawako bidi, ‘Goday, Ibraaweta Xoossay, nuus qoncis. Ha77i nuuni heedzu gallasa oge mela biitta bidi, Godaas, nu Xoossaas yarshsho yarshana mela nuna yedda’ yaagite. <verse eid="EXO 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 3:19"/>Shin wolqan gidonna ixiko, Gibxe kawoy hintena yeddonnaysa taani erayis. <verse eid="EXO 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 3:20"/>Hessa gisho, taani ta wolqan dumma dumma malaatata oothada Gibxeta shocana. Hessafe guye, I hintena yeddana.<verse eid="EXO 3:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 3:21"/>“Qassi taani Gibxe asaa sinthan teemo hintew immana. Yaaniya gisho hinte keyiya wode mela kushe keyeketa. <verse eid="EXO 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 3:22"/>Ibraawe maccas ubbay ba shooron de7iya Gibxe maccasaakonne ba son de7iya Gibxe maccasaako bidi, bira alleeqo, worqanne ma7o immite gidi oychana. Hinte hessa ekidi hinte nayta mayzana. Hessada oothidi hinte Gibxe shalo ubbaa ekidi baana” yaagis.<verse eid="EXO 3:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="EXO 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Xoossay Muses Immida Wolqaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 4:1"/>Musey, “Enti tana ammanonna ixidi, woyko taani giyaba si7onna ixidi, ‘Goday new qoncibeenna’ giiko woygo?” yaagidi oychis.<verse eid="EXO 4:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 4:2"/>Goday Museko, “Ne kushiyan de7eysi aybee?” yaagidi oychis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 4:2">“Xam7a” yaagis.<verse eid="EXO 4:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 4:3"/>Goday iyako, “Ane sa7an yegga” yaagis. Musey he xam7aa sa7an yeggin, shooshi gidin, Musey iyape woxis. <verse eid="EXO 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 4:4"/>Hessafe guye, Goday, “Ne kushiya yeddada iya goyna oyka” yaagis. Musey ba kushiya yeddidi shoosha oyki denthin shooshay iya kushen simmidi, xam7a gidis. <verse eid="EXO 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 4:5"/>Goday, “Ne aawata Xoossay, Abrahaame, Yisaaqanne Yayqooba Xoossay new qoncidaysa enti ammanana mela haysa ootha” yaagis.<verse eid="EXO 4:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 4:6"/>Kaallidi Goday Museko, “Ne kushiya ne shophen naaqa” yaagis. Musey ba kushiya shophen naaqis. I kessiya wode iya kushey baro hargen oyketidaada booxis. <verse eid="EXO 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 4:7"/>Goday iyako, “Ne kushiya ne shophen zaarada naaqa” yaagis. Musey ba kushiya ba shophen zaari naaqidi kessiya wode iya kushey simmidi hanko asatethi mela gidis.<verse eid="EXO 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 4:8"/>Goday, “Enti nena woyko koyro malaata ammanonna ixiko, nam7antho malaata ammanana. <verse eid="EXO 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 4:9"/>Shin enti ha nam7u malaatata ammanonna ixiko, woyko neeni giyaba si7onna ixiko, Nayle Shaafape haathe ekada, mela biitta bolla gussa. He haathay biitta bolla suuthan laametana” yaagis.<verse eid="EXO 4:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 4:10"/>Musey Godaako, “Abeeti Godaw, kaseka woyko ha77i ne tana odiso oykidaysafe doomin odidi ammanthoy taw hanenna. Ta geeshshada odetanaw danda7ike; ta inxarsay lufa” yaagis.<verse eid="EXO 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 4:11"/>Goday iyako, “Asas doona immiday oonee? Muume woyko tulle oothey oonee? Xeeliseynne qooqisey oonee? Tana Godaa gidikinaayee? <verse eid="EXO 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 4:12"/>Ha77i neeni ba; neeni odetana mela ta nena maadana. Ne gaanaba ta new immana” yaagis.<verse eid="EXO 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 4:13"/>Shin Musey, “Godaw, hayyana, hara asi kiitta” yaagis.<verse eid="EXO 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 4:14"/>Hessafe guye, Goday Muse bolla daro hanqetidi iyako, “Leewe gidida ne ishaa Aaroni baawee? I oda loythidi ereysa ta erayis. Ha77i I neera gahetanaw yishe oge bolla de7ees; I nena be7iya wode wozanape ufaytana. <verse eid="EXO 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 4:15"/>Neeni, ‘Yaaga’, gada iyaw odana. Taani hinte nam7ayka woygi odanekonne waatidi oothaneko hintena tamaarsana. <verse eid="EXO 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 4:16"/>I ne doona gididi asas ne gisho odana. Neeni Xoossa bessan gidada I gaanaba iyaw odana. <verse eid="EXO 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 4:17"/>Ha xam7a eka bada iyara malaata oothada bessa” yaagis.<verse eid="EXO 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Musey Gibxe Simuwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 4:18"/>Hessafe guye, Musey ba bolluwa Yotarako simmi bidi, “Hanno gakanaw asay paxa de7iyako be7anaw, taani guye Gibxe ta asaako boo?” yaagis. Yotori Museko, “Ee ba; saro gaka” yaagis.<verse eid="EXO 4:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 4:19"/>Musey Midiyaame biittan de7ishin Goday iyako, “Nena wodhanaw koyida asati ubbay hayqida gisho guye Gibxe simmada ba” yaagis. <verse eid="EXO 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 4:20"/>Musey ba machiwunne ba adde nayta hare togisidi guye Gibxe simmis. Musey Xoossaa xam7a ba kushen oykidi bis.<verse eid="EXO 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 4:21"/>Goday Muse, “Neeni Gibxe simmada biya wode, taani new immida wolqan Gibxe kawa sinthan malaatata oothanaysa balopa. Shin hessanka I asaa yeddonna mela taani iya wozanaa muumisana. <verse eid="EXO 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 4:22"/>He wode taani Goday giyaba kawas hayssada yaagada oda. ‘Isra7eeli ta bayra na7a. <verse eid="EXO 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 4:23"/>I taw goyinnana mela iya yedda gada taani new odas. Shin neeni yeddonna ixadasa. Hessa gisho, taani ne bayra adde na7aa wodhana’ yaagees gada oda” yaagis.<verse eid="EXO 4:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 4:24"/>Ogen shempo bessan Goday Musera gahetidi iya wodhanaw koyis. <verse eid="EXO 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 4:25"/>Iya machiya Sipoora qara shuchu ekada, ba na7aa qaxarasu. Qaxara shoohuwara Muse tohuwa bochasu. Iya Museko, “Neeni taw tuma suutha medda” yaagasu. <verse eid="EXO 4:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 4:26"/>Hessa gisho, Goday iya wodhonna aggis. He wode iya Museko, “Ha qaxaruwa gaason neeni attadasa” yaagasu.<verse eid="EXO 4:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 4:27"/>He wode Goday Aaronako, “Musera gahetanaw mela biitta ba” yaagis. I bidi, Xoossaa zuma bolla Musera gahetidi iya yeeris. <verse eid="EXO 4:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 4:28"/>Musey Gibxe bidi gaanabaanne oothana malaatata ubba Goday iya kiitidaysa Aaronas odis. <verse eid="EXO 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 4:29"/>Museranne Aaronara Gibxe bidi, Isra7eele cimata ubbaa shiishidosona. <verse eid="EXO 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 4:30"/>Aaroni Goday Muses odida qaala ubbaa entaw odis. Qassi Musey malaatata he asaa sinthan oothis. <verse eid="EXO 4:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 4:31"/>Entika ammanidosona. Goday entaw qopidaysanne enta waayiya be7idaysa si7ida wode gufannidi goyinnidosona.<verse eid="EXO 4:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="EXO 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Museynne Aaroni Gibxe Kawa Sinthan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 5:1"/>Hessafe guye, Museynne Aaroni Gibxe kawako bidi, “Goday, Isra7eele Xoossay, ‘Ta asay tana bonchanaw mela biittan, ba7aale oothana mela enta yedda’ yaagees” yaagidosona.<verse eid="EXO 5:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 5:2"/>Kawoy, “Taani iyaw kiitetada Isra7eele yeddanaw I, Goday oonee? Taani Godaa erike; Isra7eelaka yeddike” yaagis.<verse eid="EXO 5:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 5:3"/>Enti zaaridi, “Ibraaweta Xoossay nuus qoncis. Ha77i nuuni Godaas, nu Xoossaas, yarsho yarshanaw heedzu gallasa oge mela biitta baana mela nuna yeddarki. Hessa nu oothonna ixiko I nuna hargen woyko olan dhaysana” yaagidosona.<verse eid="EXO 5:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 5:4"/>Shin Gibxe kawoy, “Muse, Aarona, Asaa ayis ooso diggetii? Guye bidi hinte oosuwa oothite. <verse eid="EXO 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 5:5"/>Heko, ha biittan hinte darideta; qassi hinte asaa ooso diggeta” yaagis.<verse eid="EXO 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 5:6"/>Kawoy he gallas Gibxe kaapotanne Isra7eeleta oosiseyisata haysada yaagidi kiittis; <verse eid="EXO 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 5:7"/>“Kaseysada xuube oothanaw asaas utulla immofite. Enti utulla bantaw koyidi shiisho. <verse eid="EXO 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 5:8"/>Shin kaseysafe taybuwa guuthonna enti xuube medhidi shiishana mela kiittite; issinnoka pacisopite. Enti, ‘Nuuni nu Xoossaas yarshsho yarshana mela nuna yedda’ yaagidi tana oychey entaw oosoy guuxida gishosa. <verse eid="EXO 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 5:9"/>Enti ooson gundana melanne wordo oda si7onnaw entaw wodey doonna mela ooso deexisite” yaagidi kiittis.<verse eid="EXO 5:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 5:10"/>Gibxe kaapotinne Isra7eeleta oosiseysati keyidi, asaako, “Kawoy, ‘Taani hintew utulla immike. <verse eid="EXO 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 5:11"/>Hinte bidi awupeka koydi demmite. Shin hinte oothiya xuube taybuwape issoyka pacenna’ yaagis” yaagidosona. <verse eid="EXO 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 5:12"/>Hessa gisho asay utulla koyanaw Gibxe biitta ubban laaletidosona. <verse eid="EXO 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 5:13"/>Gibxe kaapoti entaw utulli imetin enti oothiya xuube taybuwa keena oothidi shiishana mela enta un7ethidosona. <verse eid="EXO 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 5:14"/>Gibxe kaapoti bantafe garsara de7iya Isra7eele kaapota, “Hinte kase oothiya xuube keena ayis oothi shiishibeketii?” yaagidi wadhidosona.<verse eid="EXO 5:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 5:15"/>Hessafe guye, Isra7eele kaapoti kawako bidi, “Abeeti godaw, neeni ne aylleta haysada ayis oothay? yaagidi maggannidosona. <verse eid="EXO 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 5:16"/>Ne aylletas utulli imetenna, shin xuube oothana mela kiitetida. Hessa bolla nuna wadhosona; shin balay ne asaa bollana” yaagidosona.<verse eid="EXO 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 5:17"/>Shin kawoy, “Hinte ooso dosonna azallata; hinte wora wodhida azallata. Hinte, ‘Nuuni Godaas yarshanaw baana; nuna yedda’ yaagidi zaari zaari tana oychey hessa gishosa. <verse eid="EXO 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 5:18"/>Ha77i guye bidi oothite. Hintew ayba utullika imetenna, shin hinte kaseysa keena xuube oothanaw bessees” yaagis.<verse eid="EXO 5:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 5:19"/>Isra7eele kaapoti, enti kaseysa keena xuube oothana mela kiitetida wode enti meton gelidaysa eridosona.<verse eid="EXO 5:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 5:20"/>Enti kawa matape keyidi, bantana karen naagiya Musekonne Aaronako bidosona. <verse eid="EXO 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 5:21"/>Enti Musekonne Aaronako, “Hinte nuna kawoynne iya moorinnati ixana melanne wodhana mela hinte oothidaysa Xoossay xeello; I pirdo” yaagidosona.<verse eid="EXO 5:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Muse Woosa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 5:22"/>Musey Godaako simmidi, “Godaw, neeni ha asaa bolla meto ayis ehadii? Neeni tana kiittiday hessasee? <verse eid="EXO 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 5:23"/>Taani ne sunthan kawas odanaw bida wodepe doomin I ha asaa bolla meto ha darsis. Qassi neka ne asaa ashshabaaka” yaagis.<verse eid="EXO 5:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="EXO 6"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 6:1"/>Hessafe guye, Goday Museko, “Taani Gibxe kawa bolla oothanaba ha77i neeni be7ana. I ta deriya yeddana mela taani ta wolqaa iya bessaana. I enta ba biittafe gooddidi kessana” yaagis.<verse eid="EXO 6:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 6:2"/>Xoossay Muse, “Taani Godaa. <verse eid="EXO 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 6:3"/>Taani Abrahaames, Yisaaqasinne Yayqoobas Ubbaa Danda7iya Xoossaa gidada qoncas. Shin taani, ‘Godaa’ geetetiya ta sunthan tanatethaa enta erisabike. <verse eid="EXO 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 6:4"/>Qassi taani enti betetethan de7ida Kanaane biitta immana gada entara caaqas. <verse eid="EXO 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 6:5"/>Qassika Gibxe asati aylleyiya Isra7eeleta waasuwa taani si7as; ta caaquwaka qopas.<verse eid="EXO 6:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 6:6"/>“Hesaa gisho neeni Isra7eeletako, ‘Taani Godaa. Taani hintena Gibxe aylletethaafe ashshada kessana. Taani enta ta mino axan iita pirdaa pirdada hintena wozana. <verse eid="EXO 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 6:7"/>Taani hintena ta dere oothana; taani hinte Xoossaa gidana. Gibxe aylletethaafe taani hintena kessida wode, taani Godaa hinte Xoossaa gideysa hinte erana. <verse eid="EXO 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 6:8"/>Taani Abrahaames, Yisaaqasinne Yayqoobas immana gada caaqida biitta hintena ehana. He biitta taani hintew laata biitta oothada immana. Taani Godaa’ yaaga” yaagis.<verse eid="EXO 6:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 6:9"/>Musey hessa Isra7eeletas odis, shin enti aylletetha un7afe dendoysan ufaysi qanxida gisho I giyaba si7ibookona.<verse eid="EXO 6:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 6:10"/>Hessafe guye, Goday Muse, <verse eid="EXO 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 6:11"/>“Bada Gibxe kawas, ‘Isra7eeleta ne biittafe yedda’ yaagada oda” yaagis.<verse eid="EXO 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 6:12"/>Shin Musey, “Ta inxarsay lufa. Isra7eeleti tana si7ibookona, shin Gibxe kawoy tana waanidi si7anee?” yaagis.<verse eid="EXO 6:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 6:13"/>Goday Musenne Aarona, “Bidi, Isra7eela asaa Gibxefe kessana mela, taani hintena kiitidaysa Isra7eeletasinne Gibxe kawas odite” yaagis.<verse eid="EXO 6:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Musenne Aarona Yeleta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 6:14"/>Haysafe kaallidi xaafetidaysati enta mayzata; Yayqooba bayra na7aa Robeela adde nayti, Heenoke, Faalu, Esroomenne Karma. Haysati Robeela soo asaas mayzata.<verse eid="EXO 6:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 6:15"/>Simoona adde nayti, Yamu7eela, Yamina, Ohada, Yakina, Zohaaranne Kanaane biitta maccaseepe yeletida Saa7ula. Haysati Simoona soo asaas mayzata.<verse eid="EXO 6:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 6:16"/>Leewe adde nayti Gedisoona, Qahaatanne Maraara. Leewey xeetanne hastamanne laapun laythi de7is.<verse eid="EXO 6:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 6:17"/>Gedisoona adde nayti Libinanne Same7a geetetoosona. Haysati banta soo asaas mayzata.<verse eid="EXO 6:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 6:18"/>Qahaata adde nayti Amraama, Izara, Kebroonanne Uzi7eela. Qahaati xeetanne hastamanne heedzu laythi de7is.<verse eid="EXO 6:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 6:19"/>Maraara adde nayti Mahilanne Muse.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 6:19">Banta yeletethaa maaran hayssafe qommon xaafetidaysati Leewe sheeshata.<verse eid="EXO 6:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 6:20"/>Amraami ba aawa michiw Yokebeedo machis. Iya Aaronanne Muse iyaw yelasu. Amraami xeetanne hastamanne laapun laythi de7is.<verse eid="EXO 6:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 6:21"/>Izarada nayti, Qore, Nefeganne Zikira.<verse eid="EXO 6:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 6:22"/>Uzi7eela adde nayti, Misa7eela, Elzafaananne Sitira.<verse eid="EXO 6:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 6:23"/>Aaroni Amnadaabe na7iw, Na7asoona michiw Elsebo machis. Iya iyaw Naadabe, Abyooda, Alaazaranne Itamaara yelasu.<verse eid="EXO 6:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 6:24"/>Qore adde nayti, Asira, Elqaananne Abiyasafa.<verse eid="EXO 6:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 6:25"/>Aarona na7ay Alaazari Puti7eela naytape issinniw machis. Iya iyaw Pinihaasa yelasu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 6:25">Haysati Leewe sheeshatanne enta mayzata.<verse eid="EXO 6:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 6:26"/>Goday, Musenne Aarona Isra7eele asaa yaran yaran enta soo asaara Gibxefe kaalethidi kessana mela kiittis. <verse eid="EXO 6:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 6:27"/>Isra7eeleta Gibxefe kessi yeddana mela Gibxe kawas odiday enta. <verse eid="EXO 6:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 6:28"/>Goday Gibxen Muses odida wode, <verse eid="EXO 6:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 6:29"/>“Taani Godaa; taani new odiyaba ubbaa Gibxe kawas oda” yaagis.<verse eid="EXO 6:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 6:30"/>Shin Musey, “Ta doonay lufa gideysa ne eraasa, yaatin kawoy taani odiyaba waani si7anee?” yaagis.<verse eid="EXO 6:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="EXO 7"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 7:1"/>Goday Museko, “Heko taani nena Gibxe kawas Xoossa mela oothas. Ne ishaa Aaroni ne nabe gididi iyaw odana. <verse eid="EXO 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 7:2"/>Taani nena kiitida kiita ubbaa Aaronas oda. I, Isra7eeleta ba biittafe kessi yeddana mela kawas odana. <verse eid="EXO 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 7:3"/>Shin taani kawa wozanaa muumisana. Taani Gibxe biittan malaatatanne malaalsiyabata oothikoka, <verse eid="EXO 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 7:4"/>I hinte odiyaba si7enna. He wode taani Gibxeta pirdana; ta deriya Isra7eele Gibxefe kessana. <verse eid="EXO 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 7:5"/>Hessi haniya wode taani godaa gididaysa Gibxeti erana” yaagis.<verse eid="EXO 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 7:6"/>Museynne Aaroni Goday kiitidaysada oothidosona. <verse eid="EXO 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 7:7"/>Enti kawas odiya wode, Muses hospun tammu laythi; Aaronas qassi hospun tammanne heedzu laythi.<verse eid="EXO 7:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Aarona Xam7a</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 7:8"/>Goday Musenne Aarona, <verse eid="EXO 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 7:9"/>“Kawoy hintena, malaata oothidi tana bessite giiko, Aaroni ba xam7a ekidi kawa sinthan yeggana mela iyaw oda; he xam7ay shooshi gidana” yaagis. <verse eid="EXO 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 7:10"/>Museynne Aaroni kawako bidi Goday enta kiitidaysada oothidosona. Aaroni ba xam7aa kawa sinthaninne iya moorinnata sinthan yeggin xam7ay shooshu gidis. <verse eid="EXO 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 7:11"/>Hessafe guye, kawoy marotanne bitanchota xeegisis. Entika banta bitan hessada oothidosona. <verse eid="EXO 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 7:12"/>Enti ubbay banta xam7aa sa7an yeggida wode xam7ati shooshi gididosona. Shin Aarona xam7ay enta xam7ata mittis <verse eid="EXO 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 7:13"/>Gidoshin Goday gidaysa mela kawa wozanay muumis. I enti geysa si7onna ixis.<verse eid="EXO 7:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Haathi Suuthu Laametetha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 7:14"/>Goday Muse, “Kawa wozanay muumis; I asaa yeddonna ixis. <verse eid="EXO 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 7:15"/>Wonto wonta guura shooshi laametida xam7aa ekada, Nayle Shaafa matan eqada, kawuwara gahetanaw naaga. <verse eid="EXO 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 7:16"/>Iyako, ‘Goday, Ibraaweta Xoossay ta asay mela biittan taw goyinnana mela yedda’ yaagidi tana neeko kiittis. Shin neeni hanno gakanaw ixadasa. <verse eid="EXO 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 7:17"/>Goday, I, Godaa gideysa I oothiyaban neeni erana. Taani Nayle Shaafa haatha ta kushen de7iya xam7an shociko haathay suuthi laametana. <verse eid="EXO 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 7:18"/>Nayle Shaafan de7iya moloy hayqana; shaafayka xinqana. Gibxeti he shaafa haatha uyanaw danda7okona” yaagada oda.<verse eid="EXO 7:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 7:19"/>Goday Museko, “Aaroni Gibxen de7iya haathata bolla, shaafata bolla, zara haathata bolla, teqe haatha bollanne duuqetida haathi ubbaa bolla ba xam7aa denthana mela oda. He wode haatha ubbay suuthi laametana. Hari attoshin Gibxe biittan mithafenne shuchafe oosetida haathe tikiya miishetan de7iya haathay ubbay suuthi laametana yaaga” yaagis.<verse eid="EXO 7:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 7:20"/>Museynne Aaroni Goday kiitidaysada oothidosona. Kawa sinthaninne iya moorinnata sinthan ba xam7aa denthidi, Nayle Shaafa haatha shocis. Haatha ubbay suuthi laametis. <verse eid="EXO 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 7:21"/>He Shaafa haathan de7iya moloti hayqidosona. Shaafa haathay iita xinqida gisho, Gibxe asay uyanaw danda7ibookona. Gibxe biitta ubban suuthi kumis. <verse eid="EXO 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 7:22"/>Shin Gibxe bitanchoti banta bitan hessada oothidosona. Goday gidaysada kawa wozanay muumin, Museynne Aaroni odidaysa si7onna ixis. <verse eid="EXO 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 7:23"/>Kawoy he hanidaba aybinka taybonna yeggi aggidi ba gadho simmidi bis. <verse eid="EXO 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 7:24"/>Gibxe asay Nayle Shaafa haatha uyanaw danda7iboona gisho, uyiya haathi demmanaw Shaafa gaxan olla bookidosona.<verse eid="EXO 7:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 7:25"/>Goday haatha shoci simmin laapun gallas gidis.<verse eid="EXO 7:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="EXO 8"/>
  <para style="s1">Shodhe Gado</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 8:1"/>Hessafe guye, Goday Museko, “Gibxe kawako bada, ‘Goday, taw goyinnana mela ta asaa yedda. <verse eid="EXO 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 8:2"/>Neeni enta yeddonna ixiko, ne biitta ubban shodhe gado yeddana. <verse eid="EXO 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 8:3"/>Nayle Shaafan shodhey kumana. Enti yaape keyidi ne kawotetha, ne zin7iya kifiliya, ne hiixa, ne moorinnata keethaanne ne deriya keetha ubban gelana. Hessadaka ne cooceninne munuqa miishe ubban gelana. <verse eid="EXO 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 8:4"/>Shodheti ne bolla, ne asaa bollanne ne shuumata ubbaa bolla gupana yaagees’ yaagada oda” yaagis.<verse eid="EXO 8:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 8:5"/>Goday Museko, “Aaroni Gibxen de7iya haathata bolla, zara haathata bollanne teqe haatha ubbaa bolla ba xam7aa denthana mela oda” yaagis.<verse eid="EXO 8:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 8:6"/>Aaroni Gibxe haathata bolla ba xam7aa denthida wode shodheti keyidi, Gibxe biitta ma7idosona. <verse eid="EXO 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 8:7"/>Shin marotika banta bitan hessada oothidi Gibxe biittan shodhe kesidosona.<verse eid="EXO 8:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 8:8"/>Kawoy Musenne Aarona xeegisidi, “Ha shodheta taapenne ta asaape diggana mela Godaa hinte woossiko ta hinte asaa Godaas yarsho yarshana mela yeddana” yaagis.<verse eid="EXO 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 8:9"/>Musey kawako, “Shodheti neepe, ne moorinnatapenne ne asaape kichana mela ta woossanaw qaxaro imma. Hessafe guye, Shaafa shodheti neepenne ne keethaafe kichidi Nayle xalaalan de7ana” yaagis.<verse eid="EXO 8:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 8:10"/>Kawoy zaaridi, “Wonto gido” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 8:10">Musey, “Nu Godaa Xoossaa meli hari oonika baynaysa neeni erana mela ne gidaysada oothana. <verse eid="EXO 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 8:11"/>Shodheti neepe, ne keethaafenne, ne moorinatape kichidi Nayle Shaafa xalaalan attana” yaagis.<verse eid="EXO 8:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 8:12"/>Museynne Aaroni kawa matape keyidi, kawa bolla Goday ehida shodheta diggana mela Musey Godaa woossis. <verse eid="EXO 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 8:13"/>Goday Musey oychidaysada oothin son, kareninne geeshshan de7iya shodheti hayqidosona. <verse eid="EXO 8:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 8:14"/>Gibxe asay hayqida shodheta shiishidi dooridosona; biitta ubbay xinqis. <verse eid="EXO 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 8:15"/>Shin shodheti hayqidaysa kawoy be7ida wode iya wozanay zaari muumis. Goday gidaysa mela I Musenne Aarona si7onna ixis.<verse eid="EXO 8:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Boxe Gado</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 8:16"/>Hessafe guye, Goday Museko “Aaroni ba xam7a denthidi biitta baana shocana mela oda. Gibxe biitta ubban de7iya baanay boxe gidana” yaagis. <verse eid="EXO 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 8:17"/>Enti kiitetidaysada oothidosona. Aaroni xam7ara biitta baana shocis. Gibxen de7iya baana ubbay boxe laametidi mehiyanne asaa ma7is. <verse eid="EXO 8:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 8:18"/>Marotika banta bitan hessada oothanaw paacidosona, shin xoonetidosona. Boxey asaa bollanne mehiya bolla laaletis. <verse eid="EXO 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 8:19"/>Maroti kawako, “Haysi Xoossaa ooso” yaagidosona. Shin kawa wozanay muumis. Goday gidaysa mela I entana si7onna ixis.<verse eid="EXO 8:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Udunxe Gado</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 8:20"/>Goday Muse, “Guura dendada, kawoy Shaafa bishin iyara gahetada, ‘Goday, tana goyinnana mela ta asaa yedda. <verse eid="EXO 8:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 8:21"/>Neeni ta asaa yeddona ixiko, taani, ne bolla, ne moorinnata bollanne, ne asaa bolla udunxe gado yeddana. Gibxeta keethaanne enti de7iya biitta ubban udunxey kumana. <verse eid="EXO 8:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 8:22"/>Shin he gallas ta asay de7iya Geesame biittan udunxey doonada enta teqada ashshana. Taani Goday, He wode ha biittan taani Goday ootheysa neeni erana. <verse eid="EXO 8:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 8:23"/>Taani, ta asaanne ne asaa shaakana; he gita malaatay wonto hanana’ yaagees gada oda” yaagis.<verse eid="EXO 8:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 8:24"/>Hessafe guye, Goday gidaysada oothis. Kawa gadhonne iya moorinnata soo daro udunxe gado yeddis. Kumetha Gibxe biittay udunxe gadon qohetis.<verse eid="EXO 8:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 8:25"/>He wode kawoy Musenne Aarona xeegisidi, “Bidi, ha biittan hinte Xoossaas yarsho yarshite” yaagis.<verse eid="EXO 8:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 8:26"/>Shin Muse zaaridi, “Hessi hanonnaba. Nuuni Godaas, nu Xoossaas yarshiya yarshoy Gibxeta matan ixetiya gisho, hessa oothoko. Nu yarshishin enti be7iko nuna shuchan caddana. <verse eid="EXO 8:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 8:27"/>Nuna kiitidaysa mela, nuuni Godaas, nu Xoossaas yarsho yarshanaw heedzu gallas oge mela biitta baanaw bessees” yaagis.<verse eid="EXO 8:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 8:28"/>Kawoy zaaridi, “Godaas, hinte Xoossaas mela biitta bidi yarshana mela taani hintena yeddana. Shin hinte haakidi boopite; taw woossite” yaagis.<verse eid="EXO 8:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 8:29"/>Musey zaaridi, “Taani ne matape keyida mela Godaa woossana. Ha udunxey wonto kawuwape, iya moorinnatapenne iya asaape kichana. Shin kawoy asay Godaas goyinnanaysa diggidi zaari nuna cimmofo” yaagis.<verse eid="EXO 8:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 8:30"/>Hessafe guye, Musey kawa matape keyidi, Godaa woossis. <verse eid="EXO 8:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 8:31"/>Goday Musey oychidaysada oothis. Udunxey kawuwape, iya moorinnatapenne iya asaape issoyka attonna kichis. <verse eid="EXO 8:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 8:32"/>Shin ha77ika kawa wozanay muumin asaa yeddonna ixis.<verse eid="EXO 8:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="EXO 9"/>
  <para style="s1">Mehe Bolla Yida Gado</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 9:1"/>Goday Museko, “Gibxe kawako bada, Goday, Ibraaweta Xoossay neeko, ‘Enti taw goyinnana mela ta asaa yedda. <verse eid="EXO 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 9:2"/>Neeni enta yeddonna ixiko, <verse eid="EXO 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 9:3"/>taani ne parata bolla, ne hareta bolla, ne gimaleta bolla, ne mehiya bolla, ne dorsata bollanne ne deeshata bolla iita gado yeggana. <verse eid="EXO 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 9:4"/>Shin taani Goday Isra7eele asaa mehiya giddoninne Gibxe asaa mehiya giddon dummatethi medhana. Isra7eele asaa mehiyape issoyka hayqenna. <verse eid="EXO 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 9:5"/>Wonto taani hessa oothana gidi Goday wode qanxis’ yaaga” yaagis.<verse eid="EXO 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 9:6"/>Wontetha gallas Goday gidaysada oothis. Gibxe asaa mehe ubbay hayqis, shin Isra7eele asaa mehiyape issoyka hayqibeenna. <verse eid="EXO 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 9:7"/>Kawoy hanidabaanne Isra7eeleta mehiyape hari attoshin issoyka hayqonaysa ase kiittidi, oychidi eris. Shin ha77ika iya wozanay muumida gisho asaa yeddonna ixis.<verse eid="EXO 9:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kixa Gado</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 9:8"/>Hessafe guye, Goday Musenne Aarona, “Coocepe bido kuuci ekidi, kawoy be7ishin bolla dharcite. <verse eid="EXO 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 9:9"/>Hessi Gibxe biitta ubbaa bolla baana gididi laaletana. Gibxe biittan de7iya asaa bollanne mehey bolla kixa gado ehana” yaagis. <verse eid="EXO 9:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 9:10"/>Enti coocepe guutha bido ekidi kawa sinthan eqidosona. Musey hessa bolla laallin, asaa bollanne mehiya bolla kixa gadoy wodhi aggis. <verse eid="EXO 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 9:11"/>Gibxe asaa bolla wodhida kixay marota bollaka wodhida gisho Muse sinthan eqanaw danda7ibookona. <verse eid="EXO 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 9:12"/>Shin Goday Muses gidaysa mela, kawoy ba wozana muumisida gisho, Musenne Aarona si7onna ixis.<verse eid="EXO 9:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Shacha Gado</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 9:13"/>Hessafe guye, Goday Museko, “Kawako guura denda bada, ‘Goday, Ibraaweta Xoossay, taw goyinnana mela ta asaa yedda. <verse eid="EXO 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 9:14"/>Ha77i ne ixas giiko, ne moorinnatanne ne asaa xalaala gidonashin ne bollaka iita gado ehana. He wode alame ubban Godi ta xalaala gideysa neeni erana. <verse eid="EXO 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 9:15"/>Taani ta kushiya denthada nenanne ne asaa gadon shocidaba gidiyako ha77i gakanaw hinte biitta bolla de7eketashin. <verse eid="EXO 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 9:16"/>Shin ta sunthay biitta ubban eretana mela taani ta wolqaa bessanaw nena de7on wothas. <verse eid="EXO 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 9:17"/>Neeni ha77ika otortada ta asaa yeddonna ixadasa. <verse eid="EXO 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 9:18"/>Taani wonto hannoode Gibxe biittay medhotosape hachi gakanaw buki eronna wolqaama shachi bukisana. <verse eid="EXO 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 9:19"/>Ha77i neeni ne mehiyanne karen de7iyaba ubbaa elle soo gelsana mela kiitta. Soo gelonna asaa bollanne mehiya ubbaa bolla shachi bukidi, enta wodhana yaagees’ yaaga” yaagis. <verse eid="EXO 9:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 9:20"/>Kawa moorinatape issoti issoti Goday gidaysa si7idi yayyida gisho, banta aylletanne banta meheta soo gelsidosona. <verse eid="EXO 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 9:21"/>Shin harati Goday gidaysa si7onna ixidi banta aylletanne banta mehiya karen aggaagidosona.<verse eid="EXO 9:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 9:22"/>Hessafe guye, Goday Museko, “Gibxe biitta ubbaa bolla, asa bolla, mehiya bollanne gaden de7iya katha bolla shachi bukana mela ne kushiya salo dentha” yaagis. <verse eid="EXO 9:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 9:23"/>Musey ba xam7aa salo denthida wode, Goday wolqaama deshonne wol7anthi yeddis. Hessada oothidi Goday Gibxen shachi bukisis. <verse eid="EXO 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 9:24"/>Goday gedera haara wolqaama wol7anthi yeddis. Hessa melabay Gibxe biittan asi doosape hani erenna. <verse eid="EXO 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 9:25"/>He shachay Gibxen de7iya asaanne mehiya shocis. Gaden de7iyaba, mithinne maata ubbaa dhaysis. <verse eid="EXO 9:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 9:26"/>Isra7eeleti de7iya Geesame biitta xalaalan shachi bukibeenna.<verse eid="EXO 9:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 9:27"/>Kawoy Musenne Aarona xeegisidi, “Taani ha77i nagara oothas. Goday tumancho; taaninne ta asay bala. <verse eid="EXO 9:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 9:28"/>Deshoynne shachay nu bolla daridi un7ethida gisho nuus Godaa woossite. Taani hintena yeddana; hizape hinte haysan gam7eketa” yaagis.<verse eid="EXO 9:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 9:29"/>Musey iyako, “Taani ha katamaape keyida wode ta kushiya denthada Godaa woossana. Deshoynne shachay eqiya wode sa7ay Godaaba gideysa neeni hessan erana. <verse eid="EXO 9:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 9:30"/>Shin nenne ne moorinnati ha77ika Godaa Xoossa yayyonnaysa taani erayis” yaagis.<verse eid="EXO 9:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 9:31"/>Talbay ciishshe, bangay qorxa gidiya gisho ubbay shachan dhayis. <verse eid="EXO 9:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 9:32"/>Shin gisteynne murqay gakiboonna gisho shachan dhaybeenna.<verse eid="EXO 9:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 9:33"/>Musey kawa matape keyidi, katamaape gaxaa bidi ba kushiya denthidi Godaa woossis. Yaatin deshoy, shachaynne iray ellesidi eqi aggis. <verse eid="EXO 9:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 9:34"/>Shin kawoy he ubbay eqidaysa be7ida wode zaaridi nagara oothis. Iyaranne iya moorinnatara banta wozana gujidi minthidosona. <verse eid="EXO 9:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 9:35"/>Goday Muse baggara odidaysa mela kawa wozanay muumin, Isra7eeleta yeddonna ixis.<verse eid="EXO 9:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="EXO 10"/>
  <para style="s1">Boole Gado</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 10:1"/>Hessafe guye, Goday Museko, “Gibxe kawako ba. Taani ha malaatata enta giddon oothanaw koyada kawa wozanaanne iya moorinnata wozana muumisas. <verse eid="EXO 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 10:2"/>Taani hessa oothiday ta malaatatan waatada Gibxeta seeridaako hinte hinte naytasinne hinte nayta naytas odana mela koyida gishosa. He wode taani Godaa gideysa hinte erana” yaagis.<verse eid="EXO 10:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 10:3"/>Museynne Aaroni kawako bidi, “Goday, Ibraaweta Xoossay neeko, ‘Neeni taw kiitetethi ixey awude gakanaasee? Tana goyinnana mela ta asaa yedda. <verse eid="EXO 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 10:4"/>Neeni enta yedo ixiko, wonto ne biitta bolla taani boole yeddana. <verse eid="EXO 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 10:5"/>Booley darotethaafe dendoysan biitta ubba kammana. Enti shacha gaduwape attida guuthabanne mitha haythi ubbaa maana. <verse eid="EXO 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 10:6"/>Ne keethaa, ne moorinnata keethaanne Gibxe asaa ubbaa keethaa enti kumana. Hessi ne mayzati ha biittan de7osape hano gakanaw be7ida iitabaape aadhiyaba gidana’ yaagees” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 10:6">Hessafe guye, Musey kawa sinthafe keyidi bis.<verse eid="EXO 10:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 10:7"/>Kawa moorinnati kawako, “Ha uray awude gakanaw nuus xihe gidanee? Asay Godaa, banta Xoossaa goyinnana mela enta yedda. Gibxe biittay dhayeysa neeni akeekikii?” yaagidosona.<verse eid="EXO 10:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 10:8"/>Kawoy Musenne Aarona guye xeegisidi, “Bidi Godaa, hinte Xoossa goynite, shin beysati oonantee?” yaagis.<verse eid="EXO 10:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 10:9"/>Musey, “Nuuni biya bessan Godaa bonchanaw ba7aale oothana gisho, nuuni nu guutha nayta, nu cimata, nu adde nayta, nu macca nayta, nu dorsatanne nu miizata ekidi issife baana” yaagis.<verse eid="EXO 10:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 10:10"/>Kawoy, “Hinte hinte naytanne hinte maccasata eki boonna mela taani Godan caaqisayis. Hinte hinte wozanan iitaba qopidaysi eretees. <verse eid="EXO 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 10:11"/>Hinte, bidi Godaa goyinnanaw koyaba gidiko addeta xalaala eki biite” yaagis. Hessafe guye, Musenne Aarona kawa sinthafe goodetidi keyidosona.<verse eid="EXO 10:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 10:12"/>Goday Museko, “Booley yidi shacha gaduwape attida ubbaa maana mela ne kushiya Gibxe biitta bolla dentha” yaagis.<verse eid="EXO 10:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 10:13"/>Musey ba xam7aa Gibxe biitta bolla denthida wode, Goday doloha bagga carko he qammanne gallas kumethi biitta bolla carkisis. Wontiya wode he carkoy boole ehis. <verse eid="EXO 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 10:14"/>Booley Gibxe biitta ubbaa gakidi ma7is. Hessa mela boole gadoy he biittan kaseka hanibeenna; sinthafeka hanenna. <verse eid="EXO 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 10:15"/>Biitti dhumana gakanaw booley biitta ubbaa ma7is. He booley shachafe attidi gaden dicciyaba ubbaanne mitha ayfe ubbaa midosona. Gibxe biittan de7iya mitha haythinne cil7oba ubbaa midigis.<verse eid="EXO 10:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 10:16"/>Kawoy Musenne Aarona ellesi xeegisidi, “Taani Godaa hinte Xoossaanne hintena naaqas. <verse eid="EXO 10:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 10:17"/>Hiza ta nagara taw issi toho atto giite. Ha dhaysiya gaduwa taape diggana mela Godaa hinte Xoossaa woossite” yaagis.<verse eid="EXO 10:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 10:18"/>Musey kawa matape keyidi Godaa woossis. <verse eid="EXO 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 10:19"/>Goday wuloha wolqaama carkuwa kiittidi booliya biittafe denthidi, Zo7o Abba yeddis. Gibxe biitta ubban issi booleyka hayqibeenna. <verse eid="EXO 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 10:20"/>Shin Goday kawa wozanaa muumisida gisho Isra7eeleta yeddonna ixis.<verse eid="EXO 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Sakana Dhuma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 10:21"/>Goday Muse, “Gibxe biittan asi oyki be7iya dhumi dhumana mela ne kushiya salo dentha” yaagis. <verse eid="EXO 10:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 10:22"/>Musey ba kushiya salo denthis. Gibxe biitta ubban heedzu gallas kumethi sakana dhumay dhumis. <verse eid="EXO 10:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 10:23"/>He heedzu gallasatan Gibxeti issoy issuwa be7ibookona woyko oonika ba soope keybeenna. Shin Isra7eeleti de7iya Geesamen poo7oy de7ees.<verse eid="EXO 10:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 10:24"/>Kawoy Muse xeegisidi, “Bidi hinte Godaa goyinnite. Hinte maccasaynne hinte nayti hintera baanaw danda7oosona. Hinte dorsaa wudiyanne hinte miiza wudiya xalaala aggidi biite” yaagis.<verse eid="EXO 10:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 10:25"/>Shin Musey, “Nuuni xuussa yarshonne hara yarsho Godaa Xoossaas yarshana mela mehe neeni nuus immanaw koshshees. <verse eid="EXO 10:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 10:26"/>Issoyka guye attona nu mehey nuura baanaw koshshees. Godaa, nu Xoossaa goyinnanaw mehiyape dooranaw bessey nuna. Nuuni ya gakonna de7ishe ay mehe yarshaneko eranaw danda7oko” yaagis.<verse eid="EXO 10:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 10:27"/>Shin Goday kawa wozanaa muumisida gisho, I enta yeddanaw koybeenna. <verse eid="EXO 10:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 10:28"/>Hessafe guye, kawoy Museko, “Ta sinthafe kicha; ta sinthan zaara bentada nena era. Ta ayfiya ne be7ida gallas hayqana” yaagis. <verse eid="EXO 10:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 10:29"/>Musey iyako, “Tumaka ne gidaysada neeni ta ayfiya zaarada be7aka” yaagis.<verse eid="EXO 10:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="EXO 11"/>
  <para style="s1">Bayra Bolla Yida Gado</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 11:1"/>Goday Museko, “Taani Gibxe kawa bollanne iya asaa bolla issi hara gado yeddana. Hessafe guye, I hintena kessi yeddana. I hintena ubbaa gooddidi kessana. <verse eid="EXO 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 11:2"/>Isra7eele asay, addeynne maccasi banta shoorotape biranne worqa alleeqo oychana mela entaw oda” yaagis. <verse eid="EXO 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 11:3"/>Goday Isra7eele asaas Gibxeta sinthan teemo immis. Gibxe kawa moorinnatinne asay Muse daro bonchetida asada xeellidosona.<verse eid="EXO 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 11:4"/>Musey kawako, “Goday haysada yaagees; ‘Qamma bilahe taani Gibxe biitta giddora kanthana. <verse eid="EXO 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 11:5"/>Gibxe biittan de7iya bayra adde na7i ubbay, kawa araata laattanaw de7iya bayra na7aape doomidi, woxan gaaciya macca aylle bayra na7a gakanaw, bayra yeletida mehe ubbay hayqana. <verse eid="EXO 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 11:6"/>Gibxe biitta ubban hessafe kaseka sinthafeka hanonna gita yeehoy yeekeettana. <verse eid="EXO 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 11:7"/>Shin Isra7eele asaa bolla woyko enta mehiya bolla kanika boccenna.’ He wode taani Goday Gibxeta giddoninne Isra7eele giddon dummatethi medheysa neeni erana. <verse eid="EXO 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 11:8"/>Ne moorinnati ubbay yidi ta sinthan gufannana. Ta asaa ekada ha biittafe keyana mela enti tana woossana. Hessafe guye, taani baana” yaagis. Musey shenen xuugetidi kawa sinthafe keyidi bis.<verse eid="EXO 11:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 11:9"/>Goday muses kase, “Gibxe biittan taani malaalsiyaba darsada oothana gaso kawoy hintena si7enna” yaagidi odi wothis. <verse eid="EXO 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 11:10"/>Museynne Aaroni malaalsiyaba ubbaa kawa sinthan oothidosona. Shin Goday kawa wozanaa muumisida gisho, Isra7eeleta ba biittafe yeddonna ixis.<verse eid="EXO 11:10"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="EXO 12"/>
  <para style="s1">Paasika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 12:1"/>Goday Gibxe biittan Musenne Aarona haysada yaagis; <verse eid="EXO 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 12:2"/>“Ha ageenay hintew laythas koyro ageena gido. <verse eid="EXO 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 12:3"/>Isra7eele asa ubbaas ha wogaa odite. Ha ageenay gelida tammantho gallasan, issi asi ba soo asaas issi maraze woyko issi kole eko. <verse eid="EXO 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 12:4"/>He keetha asaa tayboy he mehiya wursidi maanaw danda7onna ixiko, iyaranne iya mata shooruwara banta soo asaa taybuwa melanne issi issi asi midi wursanaw danda7iya keena ekidi he mehiya shukidi issife mona. <verse eid="EXO 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 12:5"/>Hinte dooriya mehey dorse woyko deeshe gidanaw danda7ees, shin issi laythi kumidaysanne iya bolla borey bayna adde gido. <verse eid="EXO 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 12:6"/>Ha ageenas tammanne oyddantho gallas gakanaw enta heemmite. He gallas omarsi laadiya wode Isra7eele asaa maabara ubbay enta shukanaw bessees. <verse eid="EXO 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 12:7"/>Asay he suuthaafe ekidi enti miya keetha wula garsa, qomuwanne bokoluwa tiyo. <verse eid="EXO 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 12:8"/>Ashuwa he gallas qamma taman caacidi cammiya boncoranne uythara miite. <verse eid="EXO 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 12:9"/>Ashuwa qaye woyko kathidi moopite. Huuphiya, gedatanne ulo ashota ubbaa caacidi miite. <verse eid="EXO 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 12:10"/>He ashuwape wontana gakanaw aykoka ashshofite. Wontana gakanaw attiko hessa xuuggite. <verse eid="EXO 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 12:11"/>Oges giigiya ma7o ma7idi, hinte caammaa aathidi, hinte xam7aa oykidi eeson miite. Hessi tana Godaa bonchiya Paasika ba7aale hintew gido.<verse eid="EXO 12:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 12:12"/>“Taani he qamma Gibxera kanthada bayra yeletida ubbaa, asenne mehe wodhana. Gibxe eeqata ubbaa pirdana; taani Godaa. <verse eid="EXO 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 12:13"/>He suuthay hinte de7iya keethaa erisiya malla gidana. Taani Gibxeta pirdiya wode he suuthaa be7ada hintena qohonna agga aadhana.<verse eid="EXO 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 12:14"/>“Ha gallasay taani Goday hintew oothidaysa laythan laythan qofisiya Godaa bonchiya ba7aale gido” yaagis.<verse eid="EXO 12:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 12:15"/>“Laapun gallas gakanaw irshoy gelonna uythi miite. Koyro gallas irsho hinte soope diggite. He laapun gallasatan irshoy de7iya uythi miya asi Isra7eele asaa giddofe duuxidi kureto. <verse eid="EXO 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 12:16"/>Koyro gallasaninne laapuntha gallasan goyinnanaw shiiqite. He gallasatan aybi oosoka oothopite, shin kathi kathanaw danda7eeta.<verse eid="EXO 12:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 12:17"/>“Taani Isra7eele deriya Gibxefe kessiday he gallas gidiya gisho ha uytha baaliya laythan laythan bonchite. Hessi hintew merina woga gido. <verse eid="EXO 12:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 12:18"/>Koyro ageenan, tammanne oyddantho gallas omarsafe doomidi, laatamanne issintho gallas omarsi gakanaw irshoy geliboonna uythaa miite. <verse eid="EXO 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 12:19"/>Laapun gallas gakanaw irshoy hinte son bentofo. Irshoy gelidaba miya biitta aawu na7a gidin woyko asa gade asi gidin, he keetha aaway Isra7eele maabara giddofe kureto. <verse eid="EXO 12:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 12:20"/>Irshoy gelidaba aykoka moopite. Hinte de7iyason awunka irshoy geliboonna uythu miitepe attishin, irshoy gelida uythu moopite” yaagis.<verse eid="EXO 12:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 12:21"/>Musey Isra7eele cimata ubbaa xeegisidi haysada yaagis; “Hinte issoy issoy soo bidi paasika ba7aale bonchanaw maraze woyko kole shukite. <verse eid="EXO 12:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 12:22"/>Hisoophe mitha haythafe danki ekidi, keren de7iya suuthan yeddi ekidi wula garsa, qomuwanne bokoluwa tiyite. Wontana gakanaw hintefe issoyka ba keethaafe kare keyopo. <verse eid="EXO 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 12:23"/>Goday Gibxe bayrata wodhanaw he biittara kanthiya wode, he suuthaa wula garsa, qomuwaninne bokoluwa bolla be7idi aggidi aadhana. Hayqo ehiya kiitanchoy hinte soo gelidi hintena wodhonna mela diggana. <figure style="fig" alt="Hyssop" file="HK00114B.tif" size="col" ref="12:23">Hisophe geetetiya Mithi </figure><verse eid="EXO 12:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 12:24"/>“Hintenne hinte nayti ha kiita merinaw naagite. <verse eid="EXO 12:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 12:25"/>Goday kase immana gidi qaala gelida biitta hinte geliya wode ha wogaa oothite. <verse eid="EXO 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 12:26"/>Hinte nayti hintena, ‘Ha baaliya nu ayis bonchiw?’ gidi oychiya wode, <verse eid="EXO 12:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 12:27"/>hinte entako, ‘Haysi Godaa bonchiya Paasika yarsho. Hessika Goday Gibxe biittan Isra7eele asa keethaa aggidi, aadhidi, Gibxe bayrata wodhidi, nuna ashshida gishosa’ yaagite” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 12:27">Hessafe guye, Isra7eeleti gulbatidi goyinnidosona. <verse eid="EXO 12:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 12:28"/>Isra7eeleti, Goday Musenne Aarona kiitidaysada oothidosona.<verse eid="EXO 12:28"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Gibxen Bayrata Hayquwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 12:29"/>Giddi bilahe Goday Gibxen bayra yeletida ubbaa, kawa araata laattanaw de7iya bayra na7aape doomidi, qasho keethan de7iya asata bayra nayta gakanawunne bayra yeletida mehe ubbay hayqidosona. <verse eid="EXO 12:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 12:30"/>Kawoy, iya moorinnatinne Gibxe biitta asa ubbay qamma dendidosona. Gibxe biittan asi hayqiboona issi keethika bayna gisho, asay banta qaala dhoqu oothidi gita yeeho yeekidosona. <verse eid="EXO 12:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 12:31"/>He qamma kawoy Musenne Aarona xeegisidi, “Hintenne hinte Isra7eeleti ta biittafe keyidi biite. Hinte tana oychidaysada bidi hinte Godaa goyinnite. <verse eid="EXO 12:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 12:32"/>Hinte gidaysa mela hinte dorsaanne mehiya wudiya ekidi biite. Qassi hinte Xoossay tana anjana mela woossite” yaagis.<verse eid="EXO 12:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 12:33"/>Gibxe asay, “Isra7eeleti banta biittafe ellesidi keyana mela dirgisidosona. Hinte keyonna ixiko nu ubbay wuroos” yaagidosona. <verse eid="EXO 12:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 12:34"/>Hessa gisho, Isra7eele asay irshoy geliboonna munaqa keren kunthidi, banta ma7uwan kammidi, banta hashen tookidosona. <verse eid="EXO 12:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 12:35"/>Isra7eeleti Musey enta kiitidaysada Gibxeta, bira alleeqo, worqa alleeqonne ma7o immana mela oychidosona. <verse eid="EXO 12:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 12:36"/>Goday, Isra7eeleti Gibxeta sinthan sabetanaada oothin, Gibxeti enti oychidaba ubbaa immidosona. Hessada yaatidi enti Gibxeta shaluwa bonqi ekidi bidosona.<verse eid="EXO 12:36"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Isra7eele Asay Gibxefe Kessa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 12:37"/>Isra7eeleti Ramse katamaape dendidi Sukota geetetiya bessi tohon bidosona. Asaa tayboy naytanne maccasaa gujonna usupun xeetu mukula. <verse eid="EXO 12:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EXO 12:38"/>Qassi entara hara daro walaka asay, meheynne dorsa deesha wudey laagetidi bis. <verse eid="EXO 12:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="EXO 12:39"/>Gibxefe enti dirgon keyida gisho kathi kathanaw wode dhayidosona. Enti keyishe eki keyida irshoy geliboonna munuqape ekidi uythi uukidosona.<verse eid="EXO 12:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="EXO 12:40"/>Isra7eeleti Gibxe biittan de7ida laythay oyddu xeetanne hastama. <verse eid="EXO 12:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="EXO 12:41"/>Oyddu xeetanne hastamu laythay wuriya he wursetha gallas Godaa asa ubbay Gibxe biittafe keyidosona. <verse eid="EXO 12:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="EXO 12:42"/>Goday ba asaa naagidi, Gibxefe kessida wode sa7i qamma. He qammay yeletethaafe yeletethaa gakanaw Isra7eele asay barkidi naagishe aqiya, Godaas dummatida qamma.<verse eid="EXO 12:42"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Paasika Ba7aale Boncho Woga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="EXO 12:43"/>Goday Musenne Aarona, “Paasika gallasaa bonchiya wogay haysa yaagis; asa gade asi paasika kathaafe moopo. <verse eid="EXO 12:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="EXO 12:44"/>Hinte hinte miishen shammida aylley qaxaretidaape guye mo. <verse eid="EXO 12:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="EXO 12:45"/>Shin hintera gam7iya imathinne une oothiya asi iyape moopo.<verse eid="EXO 12:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="EXO 12:46"/>“He Paasika kathay kaxida keethan yan miite. He ashuwape aykoka kare kessofite. Meqethatape issuwaka menthofite. <verse eid="EXO 12:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="EXO 12:47"/>Isra7eele maabara ubbay Paasika ba7aale bonchanaw koshshees.<verse eid="EXO 12:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="EXO 12:48"/>“Asa gade asi gididi hinte giddon de7iya asi Godaa Paasika Ba7aale bonchanaw koyko, iyaranne iya son de7iya adde ubbay qaxareto. Hessafe guye, I biitta aawu na7ada taybetidi Paasika Ba7aale bonchanaw danda7ees. Shin qaxaretiboona asi iyape moopo. <verse eid="EXO 12:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="EXO 12:49"/>Ha wogay biitta aawu naytasinne hara biitta asi gididi hinte giddon de7iya asaas issino” yaagis.<verse eid="EXO 12:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="EXO 12:50"/>Isra7eele ubbay, Goday Musenne Aarona kiitidaysada oothidosona. <verse eid="EXO 12:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="EXO 12:51"/>He gallas Goday Isra7eeleta cugan cugan Gibxe biittafe kessis.<verse eid="EXO 12:51"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="EXO 13"/>
  <para style="s1">Bayri Ubbay Godaas Dumma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 13:1"/>Goday Museko, <verse eid="EXO 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 13:2"/>“Bayra yeletida adde ubbaa taw dummaya. Isra7eele asaa giddon bayra yeletida ubbay, ase woyko mehe gidin ubbay tabaa” yaagis.<verse eid="EXO 13:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 13:3"/>Hessafe guye, Musey asaako, “Ha gallasay, hinte Gibxe aylletethaafe keyida gallas gidiya gisho iya qopite. Goday ba gita wolqan hintena kessiday he gallasaana gidiya gisho, irshoy gelidaba aykoka moopite. <verse eid="EXO 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 13:4"/>Abiiba ageenan, hachi gallasan hinte Gibxefe keydeta. <verse eid="EXO 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 13:5"/>Goday Kanaaneta, Hiteta, Amooreta, Hiwetanne Yaabuseta biitta hintena laatisanaw hinte mayzatas caaqis. Goday hintena maathinne eessi kumida he biitta gathiya wode laythan laythan ha koyro ageenan ha gallasaa bonchite. <verse eid="EXO 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 13:6"/>Laapun gallas kumethi irshoy geliboonna uythi miite. Laapuntha gallasay Godaa bonchiya ba7aale gidana. <verse eid="EXO 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 13:7"/>He laapun gallasatan irshoy geliboonna uythi miite. Irshoy woyko irshoy de7iyabay hinte giddoninne hinte zawan bentofo. <verse eid="EXO 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 13:8"/>He gallas neeni, ‘Taani haysa oothey taani Gibxefe keyiya wode Goday taw oothidaysa qopanaasa’ yaagada ne naytas oda. <verse eid="EXO 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 13:9"/>Ha ba7aaley hinte kushen woyko hinte som7on qashetida malla gididi hintena qofisiyaba gidana. Goday hintena ba gita wolqan Gibxefe kessida gisho, Godaa wogay hinte doonape wodhonna melanne haratas hinte odana mela hintena qofisana. <verse eid="EXO 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 13:10"/>Hessa gisho, hinte ha baaliya laythan laythan ba wodiyan bonchite.<verse eid="EXO 13:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 13:11"/>“Goday hintewunne hinte mayzatas immana gidi caaqida Kanaaneta biitta gelsidi, he biitta hintew immiya wode, <verse eid="EXO 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 13:12"/>bayra yeletida ubbaa Godaas imma. Ne mehetan bayra yeletiya adde ubbay Godaasa. <verse eid="EXO 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 13:13"/>Bayra yeletiya hare mari ubbaa dorsa maran woza. Wozonna ixiko iya morgiya mentha. Ne adde nayta giddon bayra yeletida ubbaa woza. <verse eid="EXO 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 13:14"/>Sinthara yaana laythatan ne nayti nena, ‘Haysi aybee?’ gidi oychiko neeni, ‘Goday nuna ba gita wolqan Gibxe aylletethaafe kessis. <verse eid="EXO 13:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 13:15"/>Gibxe kawoy ba wozana muumisidi nuna yeddonna ixin, Goday Gibxe biittan de7iya asape doomidi mehe gakanaw bayra ubbaa wodhis. Nuuni bayra yeletida mehe adde Godaas yarsheynne bayra adde nayta nuuni wozey hessasa yaaga. <verse eid="EXO 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 13:16"/>Goday nuna ba gita wolqan Gibxefe kessida gisho, ha ba7aaley nu kushen woyko nu som7on qashetida malla gididi nuna qofisiyaba gidana’ yaaga” yaagis.<verse eid="EXO 13:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Shaaranne Tama Tuussu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 13:17"/>Kawoy asaa yeddida wode, Xoossay enta mata gidida Filisxeeme biittara kanthisiya ogiyara kaalethibeenna. Xoossay hessa oothiday, “Asaa oli gakiko, banta qofaa laammidi guye Gibxe simmana” yaagidi qopida gishosa. <verse eid="EXO 13:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 13:18"/>Hessa gisho, Xoossay asaa mela biitta ogiyara yuushshidi, Zo7o Abbaako<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:18 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Zo7o Abba: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ibraawetho doonan ha qaalay Mayre Abba geetetees.</char></note> kaalethis. Isra7eeleti olas giigidi Gibxe biittafe keyidosona.<verse eid="EXO 13:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 13:19"/>Yoosefi, “Xoossay tuma hintena ashshanaw yaana. He wode hinte ta meqethaa ha biittafe ekidi biite” yaagidi Isra7eeleta caaqisidi wothida gisho Musey iya meqethaa baara ekidi bis.<verse eid="EXO 13:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 13:20"/>Enti Sukotape dendidi mela biitta gaxan de7iya Etaaman uttidosona. <verse eid="EXO 13:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 13:21"/>Enti gallasinne qamma hemetana mela gallas entana kaalethanaw shaara tuussan, qamma poo7isidi enta kaalethanaw tama tuussan enta sinthan bis. <verse eid="EXO 13:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 13:22"/>Gallas shaara tuussay, qamma tama tuussay asaa sinthafe kichibeenna.<verse eid="EXO 13:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="EXO 14"/>
  <para style="s1">Zo7o Abba Pinethi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 14:1"/>Hessafe guye, Goday Museko, <verse eid="EXO 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 14:2"/>“Enti guye simmidi Migdoolapenne Zo7o Abbaafe giddon, Pihahiroota sinthan, Ba7aal-Zafoona matan uttana mela oda. <verse eid="EXO 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 14:3"/>Kawoy, ‘Isra7eeleti mela biitta keyanaw oge dhayidi coo toylatoosona’ yaagidi qopana. <verse eid="EXO 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 14:4"/>Taani kawa wozanaa muumisana; I enta gooddana. Taani kawanne iya olanchota ubbaa xoonada bonchetana. He wode Gibxet taani Godaa gideysa erana” yaagis. Hessa gisho, Isra7eeleti I odidaysada oothidosona.<verse eid="EXO 14:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 14:5"/>Asay kessi ekidaysa Gibxe kawoy si7idi, iyaranne iya moorinnatara banta qofa laammidi, “Nuuni ayis hessa oothido? Nuuni Isra7eeleta yeddidi, nuna haggaaziya asi ayis dhayane” yaagidosona. <verse eid="EXO 14:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 14:6"/>Hessa gisho, I ba para gaariya kooridi, ba olanchota ekidi dendis. <verse eid="EXO 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 14:7"/>I usupun xeetu dooretida para gaaretanne Gibxe biittan de7iya hara gaareta ubbaa enta halaqatara ekidi bis. <verse eid="EXO 14:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 14:8"/>Goday Gibxe biitta kawa wozana muumisida gisho yashshi bayna kessa bolla de7iya Isra7eele asaa yedethis. <verse eid="EXO 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 14:9"/>Gibxe kawa parati, para gaaretinne olanchoti Isra7eeleta kaallidi bidi, Abba doonan Ba7aal-Zafoonanne Pihahiroota matan enti uttidashin demmidosona.<verse eid="EXO 14:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 14:10"/>Kawoy ba olanchotara yishin Isra7eeleti demmidi yayyidosona; bantana maaddana mela Godaako waassidosona. <verse eid="EXO 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 14:11"/>Enti Museko, “Gibxe biittan nuus duufoy dhayidee? Nuuni mela biitta hayqana mela nuna kessiday hessasee? Nuna Gibxefe ayis ehadii? <verse eid="EXO 14:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 14:12"/>Gibxen de7ishe haysi hananaysa eridi, ‘Nuna agga nuuni Gibxetas haaretana’ yaagidi new odibooko? Mela biittan hayqanaape entaw haareteysi nuus lo77oshin” yaagidosona.<verse eid="EXO 14:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 14:13"/>Shin Musey zaaridi, “Yayyofite; minnidi eqite. Goday hachi hintena ashshiya ashuwa hinte be7ana. Hachi hinte be7iya Gibxeta zaari be7eketa. <verse eid="EXO 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 14:14"/>Hinte si77i giite; Goday hinte gisho oletana” yaagis.<verse eid="EXO 14:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 14:15"/>Goday Museko, “Neeni ayis taako waassay? Isra7eeleti sinthe hemetana mela oda. <verse eid="EXO 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 14:16"/>Ne xam7a Abbaa bolla dentha; haathay shaaketana. Isra7eeleti mela biittara Abbaa pinnidi baana. <verse eid="EXO 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 14:17"/>Taani Gibxeta wozanaa muumisana; enti hinte geedo kaallidi Abban gelana. Taani kawa, iya olanchota, iya para gaariyanne iya para gaariya laageyisata xoonada bonchetana. <verse eid="EXO 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 14:18"/>Ta enta xoonida wode, taani Godaa gideysa Gibxeti erana” yaagis.<verse eid="EXO 14:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 14:19"/>Xoossaa kiitanchoy, Isra7eele olanchotape sinthara hemeteysi entafe guye aadhidi hemetis. Shaara tuussay enta sinthafe guye bagga aadhidi, <verse eid="EXO 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 14:20"/>Gibxetasinne Isra7eeletas giddon eqis. He shaaray Gibxetas dhumisidi, Isra7eeletas poo7isis. Yaatin qamma kumethi Gibxeti Isra7eeletako shiiqibookona.<verse eid="EXO 14:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 14:21"/>Musey Abba bolla ba kushiya miccis. Goday he qamma wolqaama doloha carko yeddidi mela biitti bentana gaso Abbaa shocis. Haathay shaaketis. <verse eid="EXO 14:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 14:22"/>Haathay shaaketidi nam7u baggan godada eqin, Isra7eeleti mela biittara hemetidi pinnidosona. <verse eid="EXO 14:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 14:23"/>Gibxe kawa parati, iya para gaaretinne iya para gaariya laaggeysati entana kaallidi, Abban gelidosona. <verse eid="EXO 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 14:24"/>Sa7i wontana hanishin Goday tamanne shaara tuussan gididi Gibxe olanchota duge xeellidi, entaw hananaba dhaysis. <verse eid="EXO 14:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 14:25"/>Para gaareta gertoy genderetonna mela Goday enta para gaareta gertuwa sa7ara oythis. Gibxeti, “Goday Isra7eeleta maaddidi nuna oliya gisho, nuuni enta aggidi baqatoos” yaagidosona.<verse eid="EXO 14:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 14:26"/>Goday Museko, “Haathay Gibxeta bolla, enta para gaareta bollanne enta para gaariya laageyisata bolla guye simmana mela ne kushiya Abbaa bolla micca” yaagis. <figure style="fig" alt="Horses and chariots in battle" file="HK00191B.tif" size="col" ref="14:6">Paranne para gaare</figure> <verse eid="EXO 14:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 14:27"/>Musey ba kushiya Abbaa bolla miccin, sa7i wontiya wode Abbay ba kase bessaa guye simmis. Gibxeti baqatanaw koydosona, shin Goday enta Abban yeggis. <verse eid="EXO 14:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 14:28"/>Haathay guye simmidi, Isra7eeleta kaallidi Abban gelida para gaareta, para gaareta laaggeysatanne Gibxe olanchota mittis. Entafe issoyka attibeenna. <verse eid="EXO 14:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 14:29"/>Shin Isra7eeleti Abbaa giddora mela biittara hemetidi, haathay shaaketidi godada eqidashin pinnidosona. <verse eid="EXO 14:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 14:30"/>Goday he gallas Isra7eele asaa Gibxeta kushepe ashshis. Isra7eeleti hayqidi zin7ida Gibxeta Abbaa doonan be7idosona. <verse eid="EXO 14:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 14:31"/>Isra7eeleti Goday Gibxeta bolla bessida gita wolqaa be7ida wode Godaa yayyidosona. Godaanne iya aylliya Muse ammanidosona.<verse eid="EXO 14:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="EXO 15"/>
  <para style="s1">Musenne Mayraami Mazmure</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 15:1"/>He wode Museynne Isra7eele asay ha mazmuriya Godaas yexidosona.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="EXO 15:1"/>
  <para style="q1" vid="EXO 15:1">I ba gita xoonuwan bonchetida gisho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:1">taani ta Godaas galata mazmuriya yexana.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:1">Paranne para toggeysa Abban yeggis.<verse eid="EXO 15:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 15:2"/>Goday ta minotethaanne ta mazmuriya gasuwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:2">I tana ashsheysa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EXO 15:2">I ta Xoossaa; taani iya sabbana.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:2">I ta aawata Xoossaa; taani iya bonchana; galatana.<verse eid="EXO 15:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 15:3"/>Goday olancho;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:3">iya sunthayka Godaa.<verse eid="EXO 15:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 15:4"/>Gibxe kawa para gaaretanne iya olanchota Abban yeggis.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:4">Gibxe kawa, ubbaafe aadho gidida toora moconata, Zo7o Abban mitisis.<verse eid="EXO 15:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 15:5"/>Entana ciimmo haathay mittis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:5">enti shuchada ciimmon mitetidosona.<verse eid="EXO 15:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 15:6"/>“Abeeti Godaw, ne ushacha kushey wolqan gooba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:6">ne kushey morkiya mentherethis.<verse eid="EXO 15:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 15:7"/>Ne gita xoonuwan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:7">neera eqeteyisata oladasa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EXO 15:7">Ne sheney tamada eexidi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:7">enta kafleda mis.<verse eid="EXO 15:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 15:8"/>Ne hanquwan ne Abbaa punnin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:8">haathay godada eqis.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:8">Abbaa ciimmoti garsan shuchada minnidosona.<verse eid="EXO 15:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 15:9"/>“Morkey, ‘Taani enta yedethada oykana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:9">taani enta shaluwa shaakada,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:9">ta koydaba ubbaa ekana.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:9">Taani ta mashsha shoddada enta dhaysana’ yaagidi ceeqetis.<verse eid="EXO 15:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 15:10"/>Shin neeni enta punnin, Abbay enta mittis.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:10">Enti Abbaa ciimmuwan biratada mitetidosona.<verse eid="EXO 15:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 15:11"/>Abeeti Godaw, Xoossata giddon ne mali oonee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:11">Geeshshatethan yashshey ne mali oonee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:11">Bonchoy daggantheynne malaalsiyaba oothey ne mali oonee?<verse eid="EXO 15:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 15:12"/>Neeni ne ushacha kushiya miccida wode,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:12">biittay enta mittis.<verse eid="EXO 15:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 15:13"/>“Neeni wozida asaa ne merina siiquwan kaalethadasa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:13">Neeni ne wolqan enta ne geeshsha biitta gelsadasa.<verse eid="EXO 15:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 15:14"/>Kawotethati hessa si7idi yashshan kokoridosona.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:14">Filisxeeme biitta asatika un7etidosona.<verse eid="EXO 15:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 15:15"/>He wode Edoome biitta halaqati dagammidosona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:15">Moo7abe biitta haareysati yashshan kokoridosona;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EXO 15:15">Kanaane asati dagaman daaburidosona.<verse eid="EXO 15:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 15:16"/>Dagaminne yashshi enta oykis.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EXO 15:16">Abeeti Godaw, enti ne wolqaa gitatetha be7idi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:16">ne asay aadhana gakanaw,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:16">neeni wozida asay aadhana gakanaw,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:16">shuchada toletidi eqidosona.<verse eid="EXO 15:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 15:17"/>Neeni enta ehada, ne zumaa huuphen tokana.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:17">Abeeti Godaw, he bessay neeni new daanaw doorida bessi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:17">neeni ne kushiyan minthada keexida ne keethe.<verse eid="EXO 15:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 15:18"/>Goday merina gakanaw kawotana”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:18">yaagidi yexidosona.<verse eid="EXO 15:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 15:19"/>Isra7eeleti Abbaa giddora mela biittara pinnin, Gibxe kawa parati, iya para gaaretinne iya para toggeysati Abban gelida wode Goday enta bolla Abbaa haatha zaarin haathay enta mittis. <verse eid="EXO 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 15:20"/>Aarona michiya, nabiya Mayraama karaabo ekasu. Hara maccasati ubbay banta karaabo ekidi baqishenne yexishe iyo kaallidosona. <verse eid="EXO 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 15:21"/>Mayraama,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EXO 15:21">“I ba gita xoonuwan bonchetida gisho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:21">Paranne para toggeyisata I Abban yeggida gisho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:21">Iyaw mazmuriya yexite” yaagada entaw yexasu.<verse eid="EXO 15:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Camo Haathi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 15:22"/>Hessafe guye, Musey Zo7o Abbaa matape Isra7eeleta denthidi Shuura mela biitta gakanaw kaalethis. He mela biittan enti heedzu gallas hemetidosona shin haathe demmibookona. <verse eid="EXO 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 15:23"/>Enti Maara geetetiya bessi gakidi haathe demmidosona, shin haathay camo gidiya gisho uyanaw danda7ibookona. Hessa gisho, he bessay Maara<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:23 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Maara: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Maara guussay “Camo” guussu.</char></note> geetetis. <verse eid="EXO 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 15:24"/>Asay, “Nuuni ay uyanee?” gidi Muse bolla zuuzumidosona.<verse eid="EXO 15:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 15:25"/>Yaanin, Musey Godaako waassis; Goday iya issi mithi bessis. Musey he mitha haathan yeggin haathay mal7is.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 15:25">Yan Goday entaw higge immis; yan Goday enta paacis. <verse eid="EXO 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 15:26"/>Musey entako, “Hinte hinte Godaa Xoossaas kiitetite; I koyaba oothite. Hinte taw polo kiitetikonne ta giyaba si7iko Gibxeta bolla ta yeddida hargiyan hintena pirdike. Taani hintena pathiya Godaa” yaagis.<verse eid="EXO 15:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 15:27"/>Hessafe guye, enti Elima bidosona. Yan tammanne nam7u haatha pultotinne laapun tammu zamba mithati de7oosona. Enti yan haatha doonan uttidosona.<verse eid="EXO 15:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="EXO 16"/>
  <para style="s1">Mannanne Kuraacho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 16:1"/>Gibxefe keyida nam7antho ageenan, tammanne ichashantho gallas Isra7eele asa ubbay Elimape dendidi, Elimapenne Siinape giddon de7iya Siine geetetiya mela biitta yidosona. <verse eid="EXO 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 16:2"/>Isra7eele asa ubbay mela biittan Muse bollanne Aarona bolla zuuzumidosona. <verse eid="EXO 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 16:3"/>Isra7eeleti entako, “Nuuni Gibxe biittan Godaa kushen hayqida gidorkoshin. Hari atto nuuni yan wodhi uttidi ashuwanne hara kathi ubbaa nu koyida mela moos. Shin hinte nuna ubbaa kessidi ha mela biitta koshan wodhiseeta” yaagidosona.<verse eid="EXO 16:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 16:4"/>Goday Museko, “Taani hintew salope kathi buksana. Asay gallas gallas keyidi, hachis gidiyaba maxanaw koshshees. Asay taw kiitetiyakonne kiitetonaako taani enta hessan paacana. <verse eid="EXO 16:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 16:5"/>Saamintan saamintan Usupuntho gallas enti kase maxeysas nam7u kushe maxidi katho” yaagis.<verse eid="EXO 16:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 16:6"/>Hesaa gisho Museynne Aaroni Isra7eele asaako, “Hintena Gibxe biittafe kessiday Godaa gideysa omarsi hinte erana. <verse eid="EXO 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 16:7"/>Hinte Godaa bolla zuuzumidaysa I si7ida gisho, wonta Godaa bonchuwa hinte be7ana. Hinte nu bolla zuuzumanaw nuuni oonee?” yaagidosona. <verse eid="EXO 16:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 16:8"/>Hessafe guye, Musey, “Hinte Godaa bolla zuuzumidaysa I si7ida gisho, I hintew omarsi maanaw asho immeynne wonta maanaw hinte koyiya mela uythu immey Godaa gideysa hinte erana. Hinte nu bolla gidonashin Godaa bolla zuuzumeta” yaagis.<verse eid="EXO 16:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 16:9"/>Musey Aaronako, “Neeni Isra7eele asaa ubbaa, ‘Goday hinte zuuzuntha si7ida gisho, yidi Godaa sinthan eqite’ yaaga” yaagis. <verse eid="EXO 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 16:10"/>Aaroni Isra7eele asaa ubbaas odida wode enti mela biitta simmidi, shaara giddora qoncida Godaa bonchuwa be7idosona. <verse eid="EXO 16:10"/><verse number="11-12" style="v" sid="EXO 16:11-12"/>Goday Museko, “Taani Isra7eeleta zuuzuntha si7as. Neeni entaw ‘Omarsi asho hinte maana; wonta hinte koyida mela uythu ekana. He wode hinte taani Godaa hinte Xoossaa gideysa erana’ yaagada oda” yaagis.<verse eid="EXO 16:11-12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 16:13"/>He gallas omarsi kuraachoti yidi, Isra7eele asay de7iya bessaa ma7idosona. Wonta enta heeran aki biitta ma7is. <figure style="fig" alt="Israelites gathering quail" file="CO00854B.tif" size="col" ref="16:13">Isra7eeleti kuraachomaxishin</figure> <verse eid="EXO 16:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 16:14"/>Akay, xiz7ida wode lee7onne laafabay mela biitta bolla bentis. Ika shachada boothi. <verse eid="EXO 16:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 16:15"/>Isra7eeleti hessa be7ida wode iya eronna gisho, issoy issuwako, “Haysi aybee?” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 16:15">Yaatin Musey entako, “Hinte maana mela Goday immida kathay haysa. <verse eid="EXO 16:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 16:16"/>Goday, ‘Asay issoy issoy baw koshsheysa mela shiisho; son de7iya issi issi asi ba huuphen nam7u litiro eko’ yaaga” yaagidi kiittis.<verse eid="EXO 16:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 16:17"/>Isra7eeleti kiitetidaysada oothidosona; baggay darsidi, baggay guuthidi shiishidosona. <verse eid="EXO 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 16:18"/>Enti shiishidi litiron makiya wode darsi shiishidaysas palahibeenna; guuthu shiishidaysaska pacibeenna. Issoy issoy baw koshsheysa mela shiishis. <verse eid="EXO 16:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 16:19"/>Musey entako, “Oonika iyape wontas ashshofo” yaagidi kiittis. <verse eid="EXO 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 16:20"/>Shin entafe issoti issoti Musey odidaysa si7onna ixidi wontas minjidosona. Enti minjidaysi guxuntidi xinqis. Hessa gisho, Musey enta bolla hanqetis. <verse eid="EXO 16:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 16:21"/>Wonta wonta asa ubbay bantaw koshsheysa mela shiishees. Away michiya wode sa7an attidaysi til7ees.<verse eid="EXO 16:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 16:22"/>Usupuntho gallas enti kase shiishiya nam7u litiruwa bolla iya mela gujidi issi issi asas oyddu litiro shiisho. Yaatin Isra7eele halaqati bidi hessa Muses odidosona. <verse eid="EXO 16:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 16:23"/>Musey zaaridi, “Wontoy shempo gallas gididi Godaa bonchiya geeshsha Sambaata. Hessa gisho, hinte uukiyaba uukite; doysiyaba doysite. Palahidaysa wontos wothite” yaagis. <verse eid="EXO 16:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 16:24"/>Enti Musey kiitidaysada wontos wothin, xinqibeenna woyko guxuntibeenna. <verse eid="EXO 16:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 16:25"/>Musey entako, “Haysa hachi miite; hachi Godaa bonchiya shempo Sambaata gidiya gisho, hinte hachi denban demmeketa. <verse eid="EXO 16:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 16:26"/>Hinte kathaa usupun gallasatan shiishanaw danda7eeta, shin laapuntha gallasay shempo gallas gidiya gisho aybi kathika he wode deenna” yaagis.<verse eid="EXO 16:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 16:27"/>Laapuntha gallasan issi issi asay shiishanaw keyidosona, shin aykoka demmibookona. <verse eid="EXO 16:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 16:28"/>Yaatin, Goday Museko, “Ta kiitaanne ta higgiya hinte naagonna ixey awude gakanaasee? <verse eid="EXO 16:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 16:29"/>Taani hintew Sambaata immidaysa akeekite. Usupuntho gallasan I hintew nam7u gallasa kathi immey hessa gishosa. Laapuntha gallasan oonika kare keyonna ba son ba son gam7o” yaagis. <verse eid="EXO 16:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 16:30"/>Hesaa gisho, asay laapuntha gallasan shempis.<verse eid="EXO 16:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 16:31"/>Isra7eele asay he katha manna<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:31</char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Manna: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ibraawetho doonan Manna guussay “Haysi aybe” guussu.</char></note> gidi xeegidosona. Mannay deebo ayfe mela gididi boothi. I eessara uukida uythada mal7ees.<verse eid="EXO 16:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 16:32"/>“Taani hintena Gibxe biittafe kessida wode mela biittan muziday manna gideysa yaana yeletethay be7ana mela iyape nam7u kilo giraame wothite” yaagidi Goday kiitidaysa Musey Isra7eele asaas odis.<verse eid="EXO 16:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 16:33"/>Musey Aaronako, “Nam7u kilo giraame manna ekada xaaron qolada yaana yeletethaas Goday goyinnetiya bessan wotha” yaagis.<verse eid="EXO 16:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 16:34"/>Goday Muse kiitidaysada, Aaroni manna Godaa sinthan taabotiya giddon wothis. <verse eid="EXO 16:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 16:35"/>Isra7eeleti banta de7iya Kanaane biitta zawa yidi gakanaw oytamu laythi manna midosona. <verse eid="EXO 16:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 16:36"/>He wode asay makiya miishey laatamanne nam7u litiro oykees.<verse eid="EXO 16:36"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="EXO 17"/>
  <para style="s1">Zaallafe Pultida Haathe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 17:1"/>Isra7eele asa ubbay Goday kiitidaysada issi bessafe hara bessi yuuyishe, Siin mela biittafe dendidi Rafidima geetetiya bessan uttidosona. Shin enti uyanaw haathi he bessan dhayis. <verse eid="EXO 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 17:2"/>Enti, “Nuus uyanaw haathe imma” yaagidi Musera kacetidosona.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 17:2">Musey zaaridi, “Hinte taara ayis kacceteetii? Godaa ayis paacetii?” yaagis.<verse eid="EXO 17:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 17:3"/>Shin asay yan haatha saamotidi, “Neeni nuna, nu naytanne nu mehiya saamon wodhanaw Gibxefe kessada haysa ayis ehadii?” yaagidi Muse bolla zaari zaari zuuzumidosona.<verse eid="EXO 17:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 17:4"/>Yaatin Musey, “Taani ha asaa waato? Enti tana shuchan caddana hanoosona” yaagidi Godaa woossis.<verse eid="EXO 17:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 17:5"/>Goday Museko, “Neeni Isra7eele asaape cimata neera ekada asaape sinthe aadhada hemeta. Qassi Nayle Shaafa shocida xam7aa ne kushen oykada ba. <verse eid="EXO 17:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 17:6"/>Taani Koreeba zuman zaalla bolla ne sinthan eqana. He zaalla shoca; asay uyana haathay iyape keyana” yaagis. Musey Isra7eele cimata sinthan hessa oothis.<verse eid="EXO 17:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 17:7"/>Isra7eeleti, “Tuma Goday nuura de7ii?” yaagidi zuuzumida gishonne Godaa paacida gisho he bessa Masahanne Mariba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:7 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Masahanne Mariba: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ibraawetho doonan Masaha guussay “Paaco” guussu, qassi Mariba guussay “Zuuzunthi” guussu.</char></note> gidi sunthis.<verse eid="EXO 17:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Isra7eelenne Amaaleqa Ola</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 17:8"/>Amaaleqati yidi Rafidiman Isra7eeleta olidosona. <verse eid="EXO 17:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 17:9"/>Muse Iyyasuko, “Neeni wonto Amaaleqata olanaw guutha asi doora. Taani Xoossaa xam7aa oykada zuma huuphen eqana” yaagis.<verse eid="EXO 17:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 17:10"/>Musey kiitidaysada Iyyasuy Amaaleqata olis. Musey, Aaroninne Hoori zuma huuphe keyidosona. <verse eid="EXO 17:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 17:11"/>Musey ba kushiya denthidi gam7iya wode Isra7eeleti xoonosona, shin I ba kushiya wothiya wode Amaaleqati xoonosona. <verse eid="EXO 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 17:12"/>Muse kushey argaacida wode Aaronaranne Huurara shuchi ehidi Muse iya bolla utisidosona. Aaroninne Huuri ushacharanne haddirsara eqidi away wullana gakanaw iya kushiya katisi oykidosona. <verse eid="EXO 17:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 17:13"/>Hessada oothidi Iyyasuy Amaaleqata mashshan olidi dhaysis.<verse eid="EXO 17:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 17:14"/>Hessafe guye, Goday Museko, “Haysi ubba wode hassayetana mela ha xoonuwa taarikiya xaafa. Taani Amaaleqata burxora dhaysanaysanne enti dogetanaysa Iyyasus oda” yaagis. <verse eid="EXO 17:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 17:15"/>Musey yarsho bessi giigisidi, “Goday ta xoonuwa bandira” gidi sunthis. <verse eid="EXO 17:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 17:16"/>I, “Godaa xoono Bandira dhoqu oothidi oykite. Goday Amaaleqata merinaw olana” yaagis.<verse eid="EXO 17:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="EXO 18"/>
  <para style="s1">Yotori Muse Xomoosuwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 18:1"/>Midiyaame biitta kahiney, Muse bolloy Yotori, Goday Musesinne ba asaa Isra7eeletas oothidabaanne entana Gibxefe kessidaba si7is.<verse eid="EXO 18:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 18:2"/>He wode Muse bolloy Yotori, iya matan Musey aggidi bida iya machiw Sipooronne, <verse eid="EXO 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 18:3"/>I nam7u nayta ekidi yis. Musey, “Taani allaga biittan bete asi gidas” gidi bayra na7aa Gersaama gidi sunthis. <verse eid="EXO 18:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 18:4"/>Kaaluwa qassi, “Ta aawa Xoossay, tana Gibxe kawa mashshafe ashshis” gidi Alaazara gidi sunthis.<verse eid="EXO 18:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 18:5"/>Muse bolloy Yotori, iya machiwunne I adde nayta baara ekidi, mela biittan, Xoossaa zumaa matan de7iya Museko yis. <verse eid="EXO 18:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 18:6"/>I banta yuussaa erisanaw Museko kiittis.<verse eid="EXO 18:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 18:7"/>Hessa gisho, Musey ba bolluwa mokanaw keyidi, iya ziggi sarothidi iya yeeris. Enti issoy issuwa sarothi simmidi Muse dunkaaniya giddo gelidosona. <verse eid="EXO 18:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 18:8"/>Goday Isra7eeleta ashshanaw Gibxe asaa bollanne enta kawa bolla oothidaba ubbaanne ogen enta gakida metuwa ubban Goday waati maaddidaako Musey ba bolluwas odis.<verse eid="EXO 18:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 18:9"/>Yotori Goday Isra7eele asaa Gibxeta kushepe ashshanaw oothida lo77o oosotaba si7idi ufaytis. <verse eid="EXO 18:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 18:10"/>I, “Hintena Gibxetape enta kawa kushiyape ashshidi, Gibxe aylletethaafe kessida Goday, I galatetto. <verse eid="EXO 18:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 18:11"/>Otoron enta bolla iitaba oothida Gibxetape Isra7eeleta ashshanaw hessa oothida gisho, Goday xoossata ubbaafe gita gideysa taani ha77i eras” yaagis. <verse eid="EXO 18:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 18:12"/>Hessafe guye, Yotori, Muse bolloy, xuussa yarshonne hara yarsho Xoossaas yarshis. Aaroninne Isra7eele cimati ubbay Xoossaa sinthan iyara geeshsha katha maanaw yidosona.<verse eid="EXO 18:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 18:13"/>Wontetha gallas Musey asaas pirdanaw uttis. Asay Muse yuushuwan wontafe omarsi gakanaw eqidi de7ees. <verse eid="EXO 18:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 18:14"/>Muse bolloy Musey asaas ootheysa ubbaa be7idi, “Neeni ne xalaala haysa ayis oothay? Asay wontafe omarsi gakanaw ne yuushuwan essada ayis nerka oothay?” yaagis.<verse eid="EXO 18:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 18:15"/>Musey ba bolluwako, “Asay Xoossaa sheniya oychanaw koyidi taako yaa gishosa. <verse eid="EXO 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 18:16"/>Enta giddon odi de7iko taako yoosona. Ta enta giddon balinne tumi ooneko shaakayis; Xoossa kiitaanne higgiya entaw odayis” yaagis.<verse eid="EXO 18:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 18:17"/>Muse bolloy, “Haysi ne ootheysi lo77o gidenna. <verse eid="EXO 18:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 18:18"/>Neka neeko yaa asa ubbay daabureta. Ha oosoy issi asape daro gidiya gisho, neeni nerka oothanaw danda7aka. <verse eid="EXO 18:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 18:19"/>Ha77i taani nena zoreysa si7a; Xoossay neera gidana. Neeni ha asaa bessan gidada entaba Xoossas oda. <verse eid="EXO 18:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 18:20"/>Xoossa kiitaanne higgiya enta tamaarsa. Enti waani daanekonne ay oothaneko enta bessa. <verse eid="EXO 18:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 18:21"/>Qassi asaa giddon oda shaakidi eriya asata, Xoossaa yayyeyisata, ammantheysatanne wodhaafe ekonnaysati doora. Entana asaa bolla shaalaqata, mato halaqata, hamsalaqatanne asiralaqata oothada shuuma. <verse eid="EXO 18:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 18:22"/>Enti ubba wode kawushsha odata bantaw pirdo, shin deexo odata neeko eho. Hessada ne oothiko toohoy new kawuyana. <verse eid="EXO 18:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 18:23"/>Ne oothana mela Xoossi koyey hessa. Qassi ne daaburaka ha asa ubbay ba allalley poletin ba soo ba soo simmana” yaagis.<verse eid="EXO 18:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 18:24"/>Musey Yotora zoriya si7is; I gidaba ubbaa oothis. <verse eid="EXO 18:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 18:25"/>Musey Isra7eeleta giddofe oda shaaki eriya asata dooris. Entana asaa bolla shaalaqata, mato halaqata, hamsalaqatanne asiralaqata oothidi shuumis. <verse eid="EXO 18:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 18:26"/>Shuumati kawusha odata bantaw pirdidosona, shin deexo odata Museko ehoosona.<verse eid="EXO 18:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 18:27"/>Hessafe guye, Musey ba bolluwa moyzin, I ba biitta simmis.<verse eid="EXO 18:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="EXO 19"/>
  <para style="s1">Goday Siina Zuma Bolla</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 19:1"/>Isra7eele asay Gibxefe keyida heedzantho ageenas koyro gallasan Siina mela biitta gakidosona. <verse eid="EXO 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 19:2"/>Enti Rafidimape dendidi bidi, Siina zuma sinthan de7iya mela biittan uttidosona.<verse eid="EXO 19:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 19:3"/>Musey Xoossara gahetanaw zuma bolla keyis. Goday zumaa huuphepe iya xeegidi, “Yayqooba sheeshi gidida Isra7eeletas haysada yaaga; <verse eid="EXO 19:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 19:4"/>‘Taani Gibxeta bolla oothidabaanne arganthi ba na7a ba qefiyan tookeysda ta hintena waata tookada taako ehidaako hinte hinte huuphen be7ideta. <verse eid="EXO 19:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 19:5"/>Ha77i hinte taw kiitetikonne ta caaquwa naagiko, biitta kumethay tabaa gidikoka hinte taw dooretida dere gidana. <verse eid="EXO 19:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 19:6"/>Hinte taw geeshsha dere gidana; hinte kawotethan kahine gididi tana haggaazana.’ Neeni Isra7eeletas odana qaalay haysa” yaagis.<verse eid="EXO 19:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 19:7"/>Musey guye bidi, zumako cimata xeegi shiishidi, Goday odida qaala ubbaa entaw odis. <verse eid="EXO 19:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 19:8"/>Enti, “Goday gidaba ubbaa nuuni oothana” yaagidosona. Musey enti gidaysa Godaas odis.<verse eid="EXO 19:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 19:9"/>Goday Museko “Taani neera haasayishin asay si7anaadanne enti nena ubba wode ammananada taani muumida shaarara neeko yaana” yaagis. Hessafe guye, Musey asay gidaysa Godaas odis.<verse eid="EXO 19:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 19:10"/>Goday Museko “Neeni asaako bada hachinne wonto taara gahetanaw bantana geeshshana mela entaw oda. Enti banta ma7uwa meeccidi, <verse eid="EXO 19:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 19:11"/>heedzantho gallasas giigeto. He gallas asa ubbay tana be7ishin taani Siina zuma bolla wodhana. <verse eid="EXO 19:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 19:12"/>Neeni ha zuma yuushuwan zawa wotha. Asay zuma bolla keyonna mela woyko zumaa xaphuwa bochonna mela entaw oda. Zumaa bochida oonika hayqana. <verse eid="EXO 19:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 19:13"/>He uray shuchan cadetidi woyko dongen duketidi hayqo; iya kushen oonika bochofo. Mehey woyko asi hessada hayqo. Moyzey punetiya wode enti zumaa bolla keyanaw danda7oosona” yaagis.<verse eid="EXO 19:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 19:14"/>Musey zumaa bollafe wodhidi, asay Xoossaa goyinnanaw bantana giigisana mela odis. Entika banta ma7uwa meeccidosona. <verse eid="EXO 19:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 19:15"/>Musey asaako, “Heedzantho gallasaas giigetite; hinte machetara aqopite” yaagis.<verse eid="EXO 19:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 19:16"/>Heedzantho gallas wonta guura deshoy dechis. Wol7anthinne sakana shaari zumaa ma7idi bentis. Wolqaama moyze waasoy si7etis. Asay dunkaanida bessa ubban yashshan kokoridosona. <verse eid="EXO 19:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 19:17"/>Hessafe guye, Musey asaa Xoossara gathanaw entana dunkaaniyape kessidi efis; enti zumaa xaphon eqidosona. <verse eid="EXO 19:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 19:18"/>Goday Siina zumaa bolla tama lacora wodhida gisho Siina derey cuyan kametis. Gita coocepe cuyi keyeysada iyape cuyiya zuley suure keyis. Asa ubbay daro kokoridosona. <verse eid="EXO 19:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 19:19"/>Moyziya waasoy dari dari bida wode Musey odin, Xoossay deshon iyaw zaaris. <verse eid="EXO 19:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 19:20"/>Goday Siina zumaa huuphe bolla wodhidi, Muse pude zumaa bolla xeegis. Musey zumaa bolla keyis. <verse eid="EXO 19:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 19:21"/>Goday iyako, “Neeni duge bada asay tana be7ana gidi, zawa aadhona melanne entafe daroy hayqonna mela entaw oda. <verse eid="EXO 19:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 19:22"/>Hari atto Godaa mati shiiqiya kahinetika bantana geeshsho. Enti hessa oothonna ixiko ta enta hanqana” yaagis.<verse eid="EXO 19:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 19:23"/>Musey Godaako, “Neeni zuma dummayida gishonne zawa immida gisho asay zuma huuphe keyanaw danda7okona” yaagis.<verse eid="EXO 19:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 19:24"/>Goday iyako, “Neeni duge bada Aarona neera ekada ya. Kahinetinne asay zawa kanthidi taako yishe dhayona mela entaw oda” yaagis. <verse eid="EXO 19:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 19:25"/>Hessa gisho, Musey asaako wodhidi Goday gidaysa entaw odis.<verse eid="EXO 19:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="EXO 20"/>
  <para style="s1">Tammu Kiitata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 20:1"/>Xoossay Isra7eele asaako haysada yaagis; <verse eid="EXO 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 20:2"/>“Nena Gibxefe aylletethaafe kessida Goday ne Xoossay tana.<verse eid="EXO 20:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 20:3"/>“Taape attishin, hara xoosse goyinnofa.<verse eid="EXO 20:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 20:4"/>“Bolla saluwan de7iyaba, woyko garsa sa7an de7iyaba, woyko sa7ape garsan haatha giddon de7iyaba aybaka new goyinniya eeqa daanisada oothofa. <verse eid="EXO 20:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 20:5"/>Entaw hokofa woyko enta goyinnofa. Ayis giiko, taani, Goday ne Xoossay, ta bonchuwa hara xoossatara koxonna Xoosse. Tana ixiya aawata nagaraa gisho nayta heedzantho woyko oyddantho yeletethi gakanaw hanqana. <verse eid="EXO 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 20:6"/>Shin tana siiqeysatanne ta kiita naageysata sheesha mukulu yeletethi gakanaw keehana.<verse eid="EXO 20:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 20:7"/>“Xoossaa ne Godaa sunthaa hadan denthofa. Goday ba sunthaa hadan dentheyisata seeronna aggenna.<verse eid="EXO 20:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 20:8"/>“Sambaata Geeshsha gallas oothada naaga. <verse eid="EXO 20:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 20:9"/>Neeni ooso oothanaw bessiya usupun gallasati de7oosona. <verse eid="EXO 20:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 20:10"/>Shin laapuntha gallasay neeni Godaa bonchiya shempo gallas. He gallasan ayba oosoka oothofa. Neeni, woyko ne nayti, woyko ne aylleti, woyko ne mehey, woyko ne biittan de7iya asa gade asati he gallasan ooso oothopite. <verse eid="EXO 20:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 20:11"/>Usupun gallasa giddon Goday salota, sa7aa, abbanne enta giddon de7iya ubbaa medhis, shin laapuntha gallasan shempis. Hessa gisho, Goday Sambaata gallasaa anjisinne dummayis.<verse eid="EXO 20:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 20:12"/>“Goday ne Xoossay new immiya biittan ne laythay aduqana mela ne aawanne ne aayiw boncha.<verse eid="EXO 20:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 20:13"/>“Ase wodhopa.<verse eid="EXO 20:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 20:14"/>“Laammofa.<verse eid="EXO 20:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 20:15"/>“Kaysotopa.<verse eid="EXO 20:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 20:16"/>“Ne laggiya bolla wordo markatofa.<verse eid="EXO 20:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 20:17"/>“Ne laggiya keethaa amottofa. Ne laggiya machiw, woyko iya aylleta, woyko iya mehiya, woyko iya hariya, woyko iyaw de7iyaba aybaka amottofa” yaagis.<verse eid="EXO 20:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 20:18"/>Asa ubbay deshoy decheysanne moyzey puneteysa si7idi, wol7anthay wol7ameysanne derey cuyeysa be7idi yashshan kokorishe haahon eqidosona. <verse eid="EXO 20:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 20:19"/>Enti Museko, “Neeni nuus oda; nuuni si7ana. Shin nuuni hayqonna mela Xoossay nuus odopo” yaagidosona. <verse eid="EXO 20:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 20:20"/>Musey asaako, “Yayyofite; Xoossay hintena paacanawunne hinte iyaw kiitetidi nagara oothonna mela I yis” yaagis. <verse eid="EXO 20:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 20:21"/>Asay banta de7iyasuwan haakidi eqidashin, Xoossay de7iyasuwa muumida shaarako Musey shiiqis.<verse eid="EXO 20:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yarsho Bessatanne Eeqata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 20:22"/>Hessafe guye, Goday Museko “Isra7eele asaas haysada yaagada oda; ‘Salope taani hintew odishin hinte tana hinte huuphen be7ideta. <verse eid="EXO 20:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 20:23"/>Yaaniya gisho, bira eeqa woyko worqa eeqa hintew oothidi ta bolla gujidi goyinnofite. <verse eid="EXO 20:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 20:24"/>Neeni taw yarsho bessi urqafe giigisa. Ne dorsatapenne ne booratape ekada xuussa yarshonne issifetetha yarsho iya bolla yarsha. Hinte tana goyinnana mela taani doorida bessa ubban hinteko yada hintena anjana. <verse eid="EXO 20:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 20:25"/>Neeni taw yarsho bessi shuchafe keexiyaba gidiko masetida shuchafe keexofa. Neeni massiya miishen iya bochiko tunisaasa. <verse eid="EXO 20:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 20:26"/>Neeni keyashe kallotonna mela taw yarsho bessi kodora keyiya bessan keexofa’ ” yaagis.<verse eid="EXO 20:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="EXO 21"/>
  <para style="s1">Aylle Ayso Woga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="NUM 15:12-18">Taybo 15:12-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 21:1"/>Goday Muse baggara ba deriyas immida wogay haysa; <verse eid="EXO 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 21:2"/>“Ne Ibraawe aylle shammiko, I new usupun laythi ootho, shin laapuntha laythan aykoka qanxonna, aylletethaafe coo yedeto. <verse eid="EXO 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 21:3"/>I macho ekona shametidaba gidiko, barka yedeto. I machidi, shametidaba gidiko, iya machiyaka iyara yedeto. <verse eid="EXO 21:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 21:4"/>Iya goday iyaw macho immidaba gidikonne machiya iyaw adde nayta woyko macca nayta yelidaba gidiko, iya machiyanne I nayti iya godaaba gido; addey barka yedeto. <verse eid="EXO 21:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 21:5"/>Shin aylley, ‘Taani ta godaa, ta machiwnne ta nayta dosayis’ gidi aylletethaafe keyanaw koyonna ixiko, <verse eid="EXO 21:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 21:6"/>iya goday, Godaa sinthe iya aatho. Yaatidi, penge woyko penge zizgiya matan iya essidi, iya haythaa goothan luko. Hessafe guye, I ba de7o laytha ubban iyaw aylle gido.<verse eid="EXO 21:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 21:7"/>“Issi asi ba macca na7iw aylletethas bayziko, adde aylletatho aylletethaafe keyopo. <verse eid="EXO 21:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 21:8"/>Iyo shammidi machanaw efida goday iyo dosona ixiko, I goday iyo deriyan woziso. I goday I bolla iitabaa oothida gisho, iyo allagas bayzanaw danda7ena. <verse eid="EXO 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 21:9"/>I iyo ba na7aas immanaw koyiko, ba macca na7atho oothidi eko. <verse eid="EXO 21:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 21:10"/>I hara macho I bolla ekiko, koyro machees kathi, ma7onne indas bessiya woga iw pacisopo. <verse eid="EXO 21:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 21:11"/>I ha heedzubata iw oothonna ixiko, aybi miisheka qanxonna aylletethaafe keyada boo.”<verse eid="EXO 21:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Iita Asi Seero Woga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 21:12"/>“Ase shocidi wodhiya oonika hayqanaw bessees. <verse eid="EXO 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 21:13"/>I wodhanaw qoponna iyape hayqiyaba gidiko, I baqatidi attana bessi taani iyaw giigisana. <verse eid="EXO 21:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 21:14"/>Shin asi qopidi hara asi wodhiko, he uray ta yarsho bessi biiko yaape diggada hara bessan wodha.<verse eid="EXO 21:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 21:15"/>“Ba aawa woyko ba aayiw dechiya oonika hayqo.<verse eid="EXO 21:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 21:16"/>“Ase bayzanaw woyko haaranaw wolqan oykiya asi hayqanaw bessees.<verse eid="EXO 21:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 21:17"/>“Ba aawa woyko ba aayiw cayey hayqo.<verse eid="EXO 21:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 21:18"/>“Nam7u asati ooyetidi, issoy issuwa shuchan caddidi qoo7iko, woyko zhultiko, he deshetidaysi hayqonna attidi hargidi hiixan pee7iko, <verse eid="EXO 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 21:19"/>dendidi guufetidi kare heeran hemetiko, he dechidaysi hayqope attees. Gidikoka I iya oosope ashshida gisho, accanawunne paxana gakanaw hargisanaw koshshees.<verse eid="EXO 21:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 21:20"/>“Issi asi ba adde aylliya woyko macca aylliw xam7an shocidi wodhiko seeretanaw bessees. <verse eid="EXO 21:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 21:21"/>Shin he aylley issi woyko nam7u gallasa giddon hayqonna ixiko, iya goday seeretofo. He aylley iya shalo gidiya gisho iya hayqoy baw seera.<verse eid="EXO 21:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 21:22"/>“Nam7u asati issoy issuwara wadhetidi qanxatida maccasiw dechidi, iya boshetana mela oothiko, hara iita qoho gathonna ixiko, he dechida uray, he mache azinay oychiya aca daynnati pirdiko ciggo. <verse eid="EXO 21:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 21:23"/>Shin he maccase deshethay dariko, shempo gisho shempo, <verse eid="EXO 21:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 21:24"/>ayfe gisho ayfe, acha gisho ache, kushe gisho kushe, toho gisho toho, <verse eid="EXO 21:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 21:25"/>xuussa gisho xuussi, maduntha gisho madunthi, qoo7o gisho qoo7o ekanaw koshshees.<verse eid="EXO 21:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 21:26"/>“Issi asi ba adde aylliyas woyko macca ayllees ayfe baqidi toysiko, he ayfiya gisho aylletethafe kessi yeddo. <verse eid="EXO 21:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 21:27"/>Hessadaka, ba aylliya ache woyko ba aylle ache menthiko, he acha gisho aylletethafe kessi yeddo.<verse eid="EXO 21:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 21:28"/>“Boori ase qaycidi wodhiko, he booray shuchan caddeti hayqo. Iya ashoy meetetofo, shin boora goday seeretofo. <verse eid="EXO 21:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 21:29"/>Shin booray kaseka qayciyaba gidikonne koyrottidi boora godaas odetin, I qachonna ixidaba gidiko, he booray ase wodhiko, booraynne boora goday issife shuchan cadetidi hayqo. <verse eid="EXO 21:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 21:30"/>Shin boora goday aca qanxana mela oyshetiko, enti oychidaba qanxidi ba shempuwa wozo. <verse eid="EXO 21:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 21:31"/>Booray adde na7a woyko macca na7a qaycidi wodhiko pirday iya mela gido. <verse eid="EXO 21:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 21:32"/>Booray adde aylle woyko macca aylle qaycidi wodhiko, boora goday aylliya godaas hastamu bira santime qanxo; booray shuchan caddetidi hayqo.<verse eid="EXO 21:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 21:33"/>“Issi asi olla bookidi kammonna aggiko woyko kamaa denthin boori woyko harey he ollan wulliko, <verse eid="EXO 21:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 21:34"/>he ollaa goday mehiya gatiya qanxo. I iya godaas gatiya qanxidi, hayqida mehiya baw eko.<verse eid="EXO 21:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 21:35"/>“Issi asa boori hara asa boori caddidi wodhiko, paxa boora bayzidi, iya miishiyanne hayqida boora ashuwa nam7ay shaaki eko. <verse eid="EXO 21:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 21:36"/>Shin he booray kaseka qayciyaba gideysa erishe, iya goday qachonna aggidaba gidiko, he uray iyaw boori qanxo. Yaatidi, he hayqidaysa baw eko.”<verse eid="EXO 21:36"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="EXO 22"/>
  <para style="s1">Shalo Naago Woga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 22:1"/>“Issi asi boori woyko dorse kaysidi shukiko, woyko bayziko, boora gisho ichashu boorata, dorsaa gisho oyddu dorsata ciggo.<verse eid="EXO 22:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 22:2"/>“Kaysoy keethe bookishe oyketidi shocetidi hayqiko, shoci wodhidaysi oyshetenna. <verse eid="EXO 22:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 22:3"/>Shin hessi haniday gallas gidiko, I he gusida suuthaa acuwan oyshetees. Kaysoy ba kaysidaysa zaaro, shin iyaw zaaranabay dhayko ba huuphen aylletethas bayzeto. <verse eid="EXO 22:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 22:4"/>I kaysida mehey paxa de7ishe iya kushen bentiko, boori woyko hare woyko dorse gidiko, I kaysidaysas nam7u kushe ciggo.<verse eid="EXO 22:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 22:5"/>“Issi asi ba mehiya denban woyko woyne gaden heemmishin, mehey hara asa kathi miiko, I ba kathaafe woyko ba woyniyape lo77uwa aca qanxo.<verse eid="EXO 22:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 22:6"/>“Issi asi ba gaden tama xuuggishin tamay buuriya kanthidi hara asa gaden dicciya kathaanne dooriya miiko, tama oythida uray aco qanxo.<verse eid="EXO 22:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 22:7"/>“Issi asi bira woyko hara al7o miishe ba shooruwas hadara immin, he shooruwa soope kaysoy he miishiya ekikonne he kaysoy oyketiko, he kaysoy miishiya nam7u kushe ciggo. <verse eid="EXO 22:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 22:8"/>Shin kaysoy bentonna ixiko, uray Xoossaa sinthe shiiqidi, ba shooruwa miishiya, I ekonnaysa erisanaw caaqo.<verse eid="EXO 22:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 22:9"/>“Nam7u asati boora gaason woyko hare gaason woyko dorsa gaason woyko ma7o gaason woyko hara dhaydaba gaason mootetidi, Xoossaa sinthe shiiqiko, Xoossay iya bolla pirdidaysi nam7u kushe ciggo.<verse eid="EXO 22:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 22:10"/>“Issi asi hare woyko boori woyko dorse woyko hara mehe hadara immidasuwan hayqiko woyko me7iko woyko oonika be77onna kaysotetiko, <verse eid="EXO 22:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 22:11"/>hadaro ekidaysi ba laggiya mehiya kaysotonaysa Godaa sinthan caaqo. He mehiya goday caaquwa eko; mehey iyape dhayida uray cigganaw koshshenna. <verse eid="EXO 22:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 22:12"/>Shin mehey kaysotetidaba gidiko, mehiya godaas ciggo. <verse eid="EXO 22:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 22:13"/>He mehiya do7i midaba gidiko, marka gidanaada gawuxaa eho; do7i midaba gidiko iyaw ciggofo.<verse eid="EXO 22:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 22:14"/>“Asi ba shooruwape mehe woossi ekiko iya goday bayna bessan he mehey deshetiko woyko hayqiko, he mehiyas ciga immo. <verse eid="EXO 22:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 22:15"/>Shin iya goday iyara de7ishin hessi hanidaba gidiko aca qanxofo. Hashe ekidaba gidiko, he hashe miishey aco gate gido.<verse eid="EXO 22:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Duussa Wogata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 22:16"/>“Issi asi issi geela7iw cimmidi, iira zin7etiyaba gidiko, iw aca immidi, baw macho ootho. <verse eid="EXO 22:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 22:17"/>I aaway iyo iyaw immanaw koyona ixiko, geela7o ekiya uray aca immiya miishe mela I aawas immidi acco.<verse eid="EXO 22:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 22:18"/>“Bita bitiya maccasi hayqo.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 18:10-11">Zaare 18:10-11</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="EXO 22:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 22:19"/>“Mehera tuniya oonika hayqo.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 18:23">Leewe 18:23</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 20:15">20:15</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="EXO 22:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 22:20"/>“Xoossaafe hara godatas yarshiya oonika hayqo. <verse eid="EXO 22:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 22:21"/>Hinte Gibxe biittan bete asi gididi, de7ida gisho, bete asi qohopite woyko un7ethofite. <verse eid="EXO 22:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 22:22"/>Am7etanne yi7ota un7ethofite. <verse eid="EXO 22:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 22:23"/>Hinte enta un7ethiko, enti taako waassana; <verse eid="EXO 22:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 22:24"/>taani enta waasuwa si7ana. He wode ta hinte bolla hanqetada hintena olan wursana. Hinte macheti am7o, hinte naytika aawu baynayisata gidana.<verse eid="EXO 22:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 22:25"/>“Hinte giddon de7iya manqo gidida ta asaape oodeska miishe tal7iko, yelon tal7iya asada yelo oychofite. <verse eid="EXO 22:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 22:26"/>Neeni issiba gisho, iya ma7uwa oykida asi de7iko, awi wullonna de7ishin iya ma7uwa zaara. <verse eid="EXO 22:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 22:27"/>I ma7idi aqey I xalaala. I hara ay ma7idi aqanaw danda7ii? Taani qadhetiya Xoossi gidiya gisho, I taako waassiya wode si7ana.<verse eid="EXO 22:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 22:28"/>“Xoossaa bolla<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:28 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Xoossa bolla: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">“Daynnata bolla” </char></note> cashsha qaala haasayopa, woyko ne deriya ayseysa baaddofa. <verse eid="EXO 22:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 22:29"/>Ne kathaafe, ne woyne ushshafenne ne shamaho zaytiyape taw yarsho yarsha.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 22:29">“Bayra gididi yeletida adde na7aa taw imma. <verse eid="EXO 22:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 22:30"/>Ne miizapenne ne dorsaafe bayra yeletidaysa taw imma. Enti laapun gallas gakanaw, banta aayetara gam7o; hospuntho gallasan enta taw imma.<verse eid="EXO 22:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 22:31"/>“Hinte taw geeshsha asi gidanaw koshshees. Hessa gisho, do7i menthidi wodhida mehe asho moopite; hessa kanas yeggite.”<verse eid="EXO 22:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="EXO 23"/>
  <para style="s1">Suure Pirda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 23:1"/>“Wordo oda gasethofa; wordo markatada bala asi maaddofa. <verse eid="EXO 23:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 23:2"/>Iitaba oothanaw daro asaa kaallofa. Pirda wobisanaw daro asaara issifada markatofa. <verse eid="EXO 23:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 23:3"/>Manqoy pirdas shiiqiya wode iya manqotetha be7ada maaddofa.<verse eid="EXO 23:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 23:4"/>“Ne morkiya booray woyko harey dhayin demmiko, zaarada iyaw efa. <verse eid="EXO 23:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 23:5"/>Nena ixiya uraa harey caanara kundin be7ada, uraa maaddada denthona aggada aadhofa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 22:1-4">Zaare 22:1-4</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="EXO 23:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 23:6"/>“Pirda dabaaban manqoy pirdas shiiqiya wode iya pirdaa wobbisopa. <verse eid="EXO 23:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 23:7"/>Oonaka malten mootopa; xilluwa wodhopa. Hessa melaba oothidaysa taani pirdonna aggike. <verse eid="EXO 23:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 23:8"/>Wodhaafe ekofa; wodhaafey suure xeelliya asa ayfe qooqisees, xillota pirdaa mirqees.<verse eid="EXO 23:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 23:9"/>“Betanchuwa naaqofa. Hinte Gibxe biittan bete asi gididi de7ida gisho, asa gade asi gidoy ay mela si7etiyako ereeta.<verse eid="EXO 23:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Laapuntho Laythinne Laapuntho Gallas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 23:10"/>“Neeni ne gadiya usupun laythi goyada ma. <verse eid="EXO 23:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 23:11"/>Laapuntha laythan gadiya goyonna shaacha; iyan dolidi kaxiyaba shiishopa. Ne asaa giddon de7iya manqoti iyape mo; qassi entafe attidaysa do7ati mo. Ne woyne gadiyanne ne shamaho gadiya hessada ootha.<verse eid="EXO 23:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 23:12"/>“Neeni usupun gallas ooso ootha. Ne booraynne ne harey shempana melanne ne son yeletida aylleynne bete asi shempana mela laapuntha gallasan ooso oothofa. <verse eid="EXO 23:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 23:13"/>Taani hintew odidaba ubbaa minthidi oothite. Hara xoossata sunthaa xeegidi woossofite; enta sunthaa denthofite.<verse eid="EXO 23:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Gita Ba7aale Gallasata</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 34:18-26">Kessa 34:18-26</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 16:1-17">Zaare 16:1-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 23:14"/>“Tana bonchanaw laythan heedzu ba7aale gallasati hintew de7o. <verse eid="EXO 23:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 23:15"/>Hinte Gibxefe keyida Abiiba geetetiya ageenan, taani hintena kiitidaysada Uytha Ba7aale bonchite. Laapun gallas irsho yeggidi uukida uythi moopite. Tana goyinnanaw yishe mela kushe yoopite.<verse eid="EXO 23:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 23:16"/>“Qassi hinte, hinte gaden zerin, koyro gakida kathaa cakiya wode Kathaa Cako Ba7aale bonchite.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 23:16">“Laytha wursethan, woyniyanne hessa mela mithata ayfiya hinte gadepe maxiya wode Shaqara Ba7aale bonchite. <verse eid="EXO 23:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 23:17"/>Laythan laythan bonchetiya ha heedzu ba7aaletan adde ubbay tana, hinte Godaa goyinnanaw yo.<verse eid="EXO 23:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 23:18"/>“Neeni taw mehe yarshiya wode irsho yeggidi uukida uythara taw yarshofa. Ba7aale bonchiya gallas yarshetida modhuwafe wontas aybika attofo. <verse eid="EXO 23:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 23:19"/>Hinte gaden bayra kaxida katha ubbaafe lo77uwa Godaa, hinte Xoossaa soo ehite. Deesha mari woyko dorsa mari iya aaye maathan doysopa.<verse eid="EXO 23:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ufaysa Qaalatanne Wogata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 23:20"/>“Ne ogiyan nena naagana malanne taani new giigisida bessaa nena efana mela taani kiitancho ne sinthan kiittana. <verse eid="EXO 23:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 23:21"/>I odiyaba si7ada iyaw kiiteta; iya bolla Makallofa. Ta iyaw maata immida gisho, hinte nagara oothiyaba gidiko, hinte nagaraa maarenna. <verse eid="EXO 23:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 23:22"/>Hinte iyaw kiitetikonne ta kiita ubbaa poliko, hinte morketa ubbaa morkana; hintera eqeteyisata taani olana. <verse eid="EXO 23:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 23:23"/>Ta kiitanchoy hinte sinthan bidi, hintena Amooreta, Hiteta, Parzeta, Kanaaneta, Hiwetanne Yaabuseta biitta ehana. Taani enta dhaysana. <verse eid="EXO 23:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 23:24"/>Enta xoossatas ziggofite woyko goyinnofite, woyko enta ammano wogaa kaallopite. Enta xoossata dhaysite, enta eeqa shuchata mentherethite. <verse eid="EXO 23:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 23:25"/>Godaa, hinte Xoossaa tana, goyinnite. Hessada hinte oothiko, taani hinte kathaanne hinte haatha anjana; hargiyaka hinte giddofe diggana. <verse eid="EXO 23:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 23:26"/>Hinte biittan maccasay boshetenna; maynnena. Taani hinte laytha adussana.<verse eid="EXO 23:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 23:27"/>“Taani ne morketa bolla ta yashsha yeddana. Hintera eqetiya kawotethata ubbaa daganthana. Hinte morketi ubbay hintew zoko zaaridi baqatana mela oothana. <verse eid="EXO 23:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 23:28"/>Taani hinte morketa bolla kazhe yeddada Hiweta, Kanaanetanne Hiteta hinte sinthafe goodda kessana. <verse eid="EXO 23:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 23:29"/>Shin biittay mela attonaadanne bazzo do7i hintena waaysonaada issi laythan enta goodike. <verse eid="EXO 23:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 23:30"/>Shin hinte taybon daridi, minnidi, he biitta laattana gakanaw enta guuthara guuthara goodda kessana. <verse eid="EXO 23:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 23:31"/>Taani hinte zawa Zo7o Abbaafe Filisxeeme Abbaa, mela biittafe bidi Efraxiisa Shaafa gakanaw dalgisana. He biittan de7iya ubbaa taani hinte kushen aathada immana; hinteka enta gooddidi kessana. <verse eid="EXO 23:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 23:32"/>Entara woyko enta xoossatara caaqo oothopite. <verse eid="EXO 23:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 23:33"/>Enta hinte biittan wothofite. Hankoode enti hintena ta bolla nagara oosisana. Enta xoossata hinte goyinniko hintew xihe gidana” yaagis.<verse eid="EXO 23:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="EXO 24"/>
  <para style="s1">Xoossay Ba Caaquwa Minthis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 24:1"/>Goday Museko, “Neeni, Aaroni, Naadabi Abyoodanne Isra7eele cimatape laapun tammu asati taako zuma bolla keyidi, haahon eqidi, gufannidi, taw goyinnite. <verse eid="EXO 24:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 24:2"/>Shin neeni nerka taako shiiqa; harati ta mati shiiqopo. Qassi asayka neera zuma bolla keyopo” yaagis.<verse eid="EXO 24:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 24:3"/>Musey bidi, Godaa qaalanne woga ubbaa asaas odin, asa ubbay issi qaalan, “Goday gidaba ubbaa nuuni oothana” yaagidosona. <verse eid="EXO 24:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 24:4"/>Musey Goday odidaba ubbaa xaafis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 24:4">Wontetha gallas guura dendidi, zumaa garsan yarsho besse giigisis. Tammanne nam7u Isra7eele sheeshata sunthan, tammanne nam7u shucha tuussi essis. <verse eid="EXO 24:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 24:5"/>Isra7eele panthata I kiittin, enti bidi xuussa yarshuwanne issifetetha yarshuwas kormata shukidi, Godaas yarshidosona. <verse eid="EXO 24:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 24:6"/>Musey mehiya suuthaafe bagga ekidi keriyan tigis; attida bagga suuthaa yarsho bessan dharcis. <verse eid="EXO 24:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 24:7"/>Hessafe guye, Caaqo Maxaafa ekidi, asaas nabbabin, enti, “Goday gidaba ubbaa nuuni oothana; nuuni iya kiita polana” yaagidosona.<verse eid="EXO 24:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 24:8"/>Hessafe guye, Musey he suuthaa ekidi, asaa bolla dharcidi, enta, “Goday hintew ha kiitata immiya wode hintera gelida caaquwa minthiya suuthay haysa” yaagis.<verse eid="EXO 24:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 24:9"/>Musey, Aaroni, Naadabi, Abyoodanne Isra7eele cimatape laapun tammay zumaa bolla keyidi, <verse eid="EXO 24:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 24:10"/>Isra7eele Xoossaa be7idosona. Iya tohuwape garsan saloda geeyida, sanpare geetetiya shuchafe oosetidaba daaniya demba bessi de7ees. <verse eid="EXO 24:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 24:11"/>Shin Xoossay Isra7eele asaa halaqata wodhibeenna. Enti Xoossaa be7idosona; iya sinthan midosonanne uyidosona.<verse eid="EXO 24:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Musey Siina Zuma Bolla</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 24:12"/>Goday Museko, “Neeni taako zumaa bolla haa keyada, haysan gam7a. Ta asay taw kiitetana mela nam7u loche shuchata bolla ta kushen ta xaafida higgeta new immana” yaagis.<verse eid="EXO 24:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 24:13"/>Museynne iyaw kiitetiya Iyyasuy baanaw dendidosona; Musey Xoossara gahetanaw zumaa bolla keyis. <verse eid="EXO 24:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 24:14"/>Musey Isra7eele cimatako, “Nuuni hinteko simmana gakanaw haysan gam7ite. Aaroninne Huuri haysan hintera de7oosona; odi de7iya oonika entako boo” yaagis.<verse eid="EXO 24:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 24:15"/>Musey zumaa bolla keyida wode shaaray zumaa ma7is. <verse eid="EXO 24:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 24:16"/>Godaa bonchoy Siina Zumaa bolla uttis. He shaaray usupun gallas zuma bolla ma7is; laapuntha gallas Goday shaara giddon gididi Muse xeegis. <verse eid="EXO 24:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 24:17"/>Zumaa bolla qoncida Godaa bonchoy Isra7eeletas tama laco daanidi bentis. <verse eid="EXO 24:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 24:18"/>Hessafe guye, Musey zumaa huuphiya keyidi shaara giddo gelis; yan oytamu gallasinne oytamu qamma gam7is.<verse eid="EXO 24:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 24"/>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="EXO 25"/>
  <para style="s1">Xoossa Keethaas Imetida Imuwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 25:1"/>Goday Museko haysada yaagis; <verse eid="EXO 25:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 25:2"/>“Taw imota ehana mela Isra7eeletas oda. Iya wozani iya imma imma gidaba immiya imota asa ubbaafe taw eka. <verse eid="EXO 25:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 25:3"/>Hinte entafe ekana imotay, worqaa, bira, naase birata, <verse eid="EXO 25:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 25:4"/>kaalose qacina, ocha teera daaniya qacina, zo7o qacinanne al7o liino, deesha ikise, <verse eid="EXO 25:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 25:5"/>haashetidi zo7o qalamen tiyetida dorsa ite, lo77o do7a ite, soqala mithi, <verse eid="EXO 25:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 25:6"/>xompes maaddiya shamaho zayte, shuumatetha zayteninne ixaanen guzhetiya sawota, <verse eid="EXO 25:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 25:7"/>Kahine halaqay ma7iya efuude geetetiya ma7uwa bollanne iya tiran wosetiya margide geetetiya al7o shuchaanne hara alleeqo shuchata eho. <verse eid="EXO 25:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 25:8"/>Taani enta giddon daana mela enti tana goyinniya bessi giigiso.” <verse eid="EXO 25:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 25:9"/>Dunkaaniyanne iya giddon de7iya miisheta ubbaa ta nena bessiya maaran ootha.<verse eid="EXO 25:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Caaqo Taabote</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 37:1-9">Kessa 37:1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 25:10"/>“Soqala mithafe, adussatethay nam7u wadhanne takadho, gompay issi wadhanne takadho, geesay issi wadhanne takadho gidiya saaxine oothite. <verse eid="EXO 25:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 25:11"/>Gaathaanne kariya walahi bayna worqan kamma; iya yuushuwaka worqan lanxa. <verse eid="EXO 25:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 25:12"/>He Taabotiyas oyddu worqa sagaayota oothada; oyddu gedata bolla issi baggara nam7u sagaayota, qassi hanko baggara nam7u sagaayota aathada gasetha. <verse eid="EXO 25:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 25:13"/>Taabotiya tookiya kaso mithata soqala mithafe kessada worqan lanxa. <verse eid="EXO 25:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 25:14"/>Taabotiya tookanaw iya miyen de7iya sagaayotan kaso mithata aatha. <verse eid="EXO 25:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 25:15"/>Tookiya kaso mithati Taabotiya sagaayota giddon de7o; enti yaape keyopo. <verse eid="EXO 25:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 25:16"/>Taabotiya giddon taani new immiya, tammu kiitati xaafetida nam7u loche shuchata wotha.<verse eid="EXO 25:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 25:17"/>“Walahi bayna worqafe adussatethay nam7u wadhanne takadho, gompay issi wadhanne takadho gidiya nagara atotetha kama ootha. <verse eid="EXO 25:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 25:18"/>Qefera de7iya nam7u kiruubeta worqafe qoxada ootha. <verse eid="EXO 25:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 25:19"/>Issi kiruubiya issi bagga gaxan, nam7antho kiruubiya hanko bagga gaxan wothada nam7aa Taabotiya guphiyara oythada ootha. <verse eid="EXO 25:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 25:20"/>Kiruubeti woliko simmi uttidi, banta qefiya denthidi, atotetha kamaa kammo. <verse eid="EXO 25:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 25:21"/>Taani new immiya loche shucha bolla xaafetida tammu kiitata Taabotiya giddon wotha. Yaatada, guphiya Taabotiya bolla wotha. <verse eid="EXO 25:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 25:22"/>Taabotiya guphiya bolla de7iya nam7u kiruubetape giddon gidada taani neera gahetana. Isra7eele asaas immiya kiita ubbaa taani yan new immana.”<verse eid="EXO 25:22"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Uytha Xarpheeza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 25:23"/>“Soqala mithafe adussatethay nam7u wadha, gompay issi wadha, geesay issi wadhanne takadho gidiya issi xarpheeza ootha. <verse eid="EXO 25:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 25:24"/>Yaatada, walahi bayna worqan lanxa; iya yuushuwaka worqan lanxa. <verse eid="EXO 25:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 25:25"/>Hessadaka, gompay takadho gidiya goossa iya bolla yuushsha aatha. Yaatada, iya yuushuwa worqan lanxa. <verse eid="EXO 25:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 25:26"/>He xarpheezas oyddu worqa sagaayota oothada, xarpheezaa oyddu tohotara oytha. <verse eid="EXO 25:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 25:27"/>Xarpheezaa tookanaw kaso mithata aathiya sagaayoti xarpheeza goossaa matan shiiqidi de7o. <verse eid="EXO 25:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 25:28"/>He tookiya kasota soqala mithafe kessada, worqan lanxa. <verse eid="EXO 25:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 25:29"/>Hessadaka, shaatetanne cilpata, woyne yarshuwa duuqiya miishetanne xuu7ata walahi bayna worqafe ootha. <verse eid="EXO 25:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 25:30"/>Xarpheezay Taabotiyas sintha baggara utto. Ta sinthan uttiya geeshsha uythay ubba wode xarpheezaa bollafe dhayopo.”<verse eid="EXO 25:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Xompe Wothiya Kocaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 37:17-24">Kessa 37:17-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 25:31"/>“Xompe wothiya kocaa walahi bayna worqafe ootha. He kocay eqiya tohuwanne tooma worqafe qoxada ootha. Alleeqos oosetiya wallaxati, gambuthatinne ciishshati ubbay issino gididi oosetanaw bessees. <figure style="fig" alt="Seven-branched candlestick or lampstand" file="HK00264B.tif" size="col" ref="25:31">Xompe Wothiya Koca</figure> <verse eid="EXO 25:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 25:32"/>Nam7u baggara, heedzu heedzu tasheta iyaw kessa. <verse eid="EXO 25:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 25:33"/>Usupun tashetas xeeran xeeran heedzu heedzu alleeqo gambuthatinne ciishshati de7iya lawuze mitha ciishshe daaniyabay de7o. <verse eid="EXO 25:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 25:34"/>Xompiya wothiya kocaa giddon de7iya tooma xeeran oyddu alleeqo gambuthatinne ciishshati de7iya lawuze mitha ciishshe daaniyabay de7o. <verse eid="EXO 25:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 25:35"/>Tashetape garsan, nam7u tasheti gahetiya bessan issi issi gambuthi de7o. <verse eid="EXO 25:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 25:36"/>Gambuthay, tasheynne xompiya wothiya kocay issino gididi, walahi bayna worqafe qoxetidi ooseto.<verse eid="EXO 25:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 25:37"/>“Xompe wothiya kocaa bolla laapun xompeta giigisada, enti sinthe poo7ana mela dhoqu oothada wotha. <verse eid="EXO 25:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EXO 25:38"/>Xompiya naaganaw maaddiya Qaphetanne enta wothiyabata walahi bayna worqafe ootha. <verse eid="EXO 25:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="EXO 25:39"/>Xompe wothiya kocaynne iya miisheti ubbay hastamanne ichashu kilo giraame gidiya walahi bayna worqafe ooseto. <verse eid="EXO 25:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="EXO 25:40"/>Taani nena zumaa bolla bessida leemisuwa kaallada, akeekada ootha.”<verse eid="EXO 25:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 25"/>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="EXO 26"/>
  <para style="s1">Geeshsha Dunkaane</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 36:8-38">Kessa 36:8-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 26:1"/>“Dunkaaniya gaatha baggaas al7o liinope oosetida, tammu geshe giigisa. Enta kaalose, ocha teera daaneysaninne zo7o qacinan daddada kiruubeta misiliyara alleeqisa. <verse eid="EXO 26:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 26:2"/>Gesheti ubbay issi like gido; adussatethay laatamanne oydda, gompay qassi oyddu wadha gido. <verse eid="EXO 26:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 26:3"/>Ichashu gesheta issife gathada sika; hanko attida ichashata hessada ootha. <verse eid="EXO 26:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 26:4"/>Issife gahetidi siketida nam7u geshetas issuwa issuwa gaxan kaalose afilape oosetida sagaayota ootha. <verse eid="EXO 26:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 26:5"/>Issife siketida koyro magarajuwa bolla koyro maaran kaalose afilape oosetida ishatamu sagaayota ootha; hessadaka nam7antho magarajuwa bolla wursetha gaxan ishatamu sagaayota ootha. <verse eid="EXO 26:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 26:6"/>Geeshsha Dunkaaney issino gidana mela nam7un shaaketi siketida gesheta woli gathidi oysethanaw, ishatamu worqafe oosetida oykiyabata ootha.<verse eid="EXO 26:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 26:7"/>“Geeshsha Dunkaaniya bollara kammana mela tammanne issi gesheta deesha ikisepe ootha. <verse eid="EXO 26:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 26:8"/>Tammanne issi gesheti issi gina gido; issi issi magarajuwa adussatethay hastamu wadha, gompay oyddu wadha gido. <verse eid="EXO 26:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 26:9"/>Ichashu gesheta issi baggara, usupun gesheta hanko baggara gathada sika. Usupuntho magarajoy dakoyetidi, dunkaaniyas sintha baggara daabuleto. <verse eid="EXO 26:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 26:10"/>Woli gathi sikida geshetape issi magarajuwas macara bolla ishatamu sagaayota ootha; qassi hanko magarajuwas macara bolla ishatamu sagaayota ootha. <verse eid="EXO 26:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 26:11"/>Nam7un shaaketi siketida gesheti issi kama gidana mela ishatamu naase biratape oosetida oykiyabata ootha. <verse eid="EXO 26:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 26:12"/>He dunkaaniya geshetape palahida baggaa ekada Geeshsha Dunkaaniyas guye baggara kaqa. <verse eid="EXO 26:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 26:13"/>Dunkaaniya geshetape adusatetha baggara palahida gompay issi issi wadha gidida gesheta Geeshsha Dunkaaniyas nam7u baggara kaqa.<verse eid="EXO 26:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 26:14"/>“Dunkaaniyas bolla baggara daabulidi kammanaw zo7o qalamen tiyetida maraze itenne lo77o do7a ite ootha. <verse eid="EXO 26:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 26:15"/>Geeshsha Dunkaaniya tuuqeta soqala mithafe ootha. <verse eid="EXO 26:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 26:16"/>Issi issi tuuqiya adussatethay tammu wadha, gompay issi wadhanne bagga gido. <verse eid="EXO 26:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 26:17"/>Nam7u tuuqeti issife oyketana mela issi issi tuuqiyas oysethiyabay de7o. Geeshsha Dunkaaniya tuuqeta ubbaa hessada ootha. <verse eid="EXO 26:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 26:18"/>Geeshsha Dunkaaniya wuloha baggara laatamu tuuqeta ootha. <verse eid="EXO 26:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 26:19"/>Entana essanaw enta garsan bira biratape oosetida oytamu luhoy de7iya tohota ootha. Issi issi tuuqiyas nam7u nam7u toho kessa. <verse eid="EXO 26:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 26:20"/>Geeshsha Dunkaaniya pudeha baggara laatamu tuuqeta ootha. <verse eid="EXO 26:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 26:21"/>Entana essanaw enta garsan bira biratape oosetida oytamu luhoy de7iya tohota ootha. Issi issi tuuqiyas nam7u nam7u toho kessa. <verse eid="EXO 26:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 26:22"/>Geeshsha Dunkaaniyas guyera wuloha baggara usupun tuuqeta ootha. <verse eid="EXO 26:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 26:23"/>Guye baggara de7iya maazanetas nam7u tuuqeta ootha. <verse eid="EXO 26:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 26:24"/>He maazaniyan de7iya tuuqeti tohope huuphe gakanaw oyketo. Nam7u maazaneta medhiya nam7u tuuqeta hessatho oosetanaw bessees. <verse eid="EXO 26:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 26:25"/>Hessadaka nam7u nam7u tohoy de7iya hospun tuuqeta oothada, entaw bira biratape oosetida tammanne usupun luhoy de7iya tohota ootha.<verse eid="EXO 26:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 26:26"/>“Tuuqeta sathidi oythiya soqala mithafe oosetida tammanne ichashu liyoota kessa. Entafe ichashata Geeshsha Dunkaaniyas issi bagga miyen de7iya tuuqetas, <verse eid="EXO 26:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 26:27"/>qassi ichashata hanko bagga miyen de7iya tuuqetas, hessadaka attida ichashata wuloha baggan de7iya tuuqetas ootha. <verse eid="EXO 26:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 26:28"/>Ha gaxa tuuqiyapenne ya gaxa tuuqiyape yaa liyooti giddo tuuqiyara oyketo. <verse eid="EXO 26:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 26:29"/>Tuuqeta worqan lanxa; liyoota oykanaw maaddiya sagaayota worqafe ootha; qassi liyoota worqan lanxa. <verse eid="EXO 26:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 26:30"/>Geeshsha Dunkaaniya zumaa bolla ta nena bessidaysada ootha.<verse eid="EXO 26:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 26:31"/>“Al7o liinope issi magarajo oothada, iya kaalose, ocha teera daaneysaninne zo7o qacinan daddada kiruubeta misilen alleeqisa. <verse eid="EXO 26:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 26:32"/>Iya soqala mithafe oothada, worqan meeshetida kocataninne bira biratape oosetida oyddu tohoy de7iya tuussata bolla kaqa. <verse eid="EXO 26:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 26:33"/>He magarajuwa Geeshsha Dunkaaniyas kaaran de7iya qaphetape garsan kaqa. Yaatada higgey xaafetida nam7u loche shuchata oykida Caaqo Taabotiya magarajuwas guye baggan wotha. He geshey, Geeshsha Bessaanne Ubbaafe Geeshsha Bessaafe shaakees. <verse eid="EXO 26:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 26:34"/>Nagara atotetha kaman Caaqo Taabotiya kamma. <verse eid="EXO 26:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 26:35"/>Xarpheezaa, Ubbaafe Geeshsha Bessaafe karera, Geeshsha Dunkaaniyape pudeha baggan wotha; xompe wothiya kocaa dugeha baggara wotha.<verse eid="EXO 26:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 26:36"/>“Dunkaaniya penge magarajuwa, al7o liinope giigisada, kaalose, ocha teera daaneysaninne zo7o qacinan daddada alleeqisa. <verse eid="EXO 26:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 26:37"/>Magarajuwas ichashu tuussata soqala mithafe oothada worqan lanxa; kocatika worqafe oosetidaysata gido. Tuussatas naase biratape ichashu tohota giigisa.”<verse eid="EXO 26:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 26"/>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="EXO 27"/>
  <para style="s1">Yarsho Bessi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 27:1"/>“Soqala mithafe yarsho bessi ootha. Adussatethaynne gompay oyddu wadhanne takadho, geesay heedzu wadha gidida oyddu maazanera de7iya yarsho bessi ootha. <verse eid="EXO 27:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 27:2"/>Oyddu maazaneta bolla kace daaniyaba kessa; kaceti yarsho bessaara issino gididi ooseto. Yaatada, yarsho bessa ubbaa naase biratan laxa. <verse eid="EXO 27:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 27:3"/>Iyaw go7etiya miisheta; bido kessiya kereta, akaafata, baldeta, asho qaphetanne cooceta ubbaa naase biratape ootha. <verse eid="EXO 27:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 27:4"/>Yaatada, naase biratape zarzare daaniyaba oothada, iyaw oyddu maazaneta bolla oyddu sagaayota giigisa. <verse eid="EXO 27:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 27:5"/>He zarzariya yarsho bessa goossaafe garsan yarsho bessaas bagga zawa gathada wotha. <verse eid="EXO 27:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 27:6"/>Soqala mithafe yarsho bessa tookiya kaso mithata kessada, naase biratan lanxa. <verse eid="EXO 27:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 27:7"/>Yarsho bessaa tookiya wode maaddana mela he kaso mithata nam7u miyera de7iya sagaayotan aatha. <verse eid="EXO 27:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 27:8"/>Taani nena zumaa bolla bessidaysada yarsho bessi xawulape oothada, gidduwa kaysi ootha.”<verse eid="EXO 27:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Geeshsha Dunkaane Dabaaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 27:9"/>“Geeshsha Dunkaaniya dabaaba gechanaw al7o liinope magarajo giigisa. Geshetas adussatethay dugeha baggara xeetu wadha gido. <verse eid="EXO 27:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 27:10"/>Iyaw kate gidana mela naase biratape oosetida laatamu tuussatanne laatamu tohota ootha. Enta bolla bira biratape oosetida xam7atanne kaceta ootha. <verse eid="EXO 27:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 27:11"/>Dabaabas pudeha baggaraka hessada ootha.<verse eid="EXO 27:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 27:12"/>“Dabaabas wuloha bagga adussatethay ishatamu wadha gidida gesheti oosetidi, entaw tammu tohoy de7iya tuussati de7o. <verse eid="EXO 27:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 27:13"/>Geliya wulay de7iya, doloha bagga dabaaba gompay ishatamu wadha gido. <verse eid="EXO 27:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 27:14"/>Dabaaba pengiyafe issi baggara adussatethay tammanne ichashu wadha gidiya gesheti de7o; entaw heedzu tohoy de7iya heedzu tuussati de7o. <verse eid="EXO 27:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 27:15"/>Hanko baggara de7iya geshetika hessada ooseto.<verse eid="EXO 27:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 27:16"/>“Dabaaba geliya wulaas adussatethay laatamu wadha gidiya, al7o liinope magarajo giigisada, kaalose, ocha teera daaneysaninne zo7o qacinan daddada alleeqisa. Enti iyan zempana mela oyddu tohora de7iya oyddu tuussata giigisa. <verse eid="EXO 27:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 27:17"/>Dabaaba yuushuwan de7iya tuussati ubbay bira biratape oosetida xam7atan oyketo; enta kaceti bira biratape, enta tohoti naase biratape ooseto. <verse eid="EXO 27:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 27:18"/>Dabaaba adussatethay xeetu wadha, gompay oytamu wadha, geesay ichashu wadha gido. Magarajoti al7o liinope, enta tohotika naase biratape ooseto.<verse eid="EXO 27:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 27:19"/>“Geeshsha Dunkaaniyan go7etiya miishe ubbay, dunkaaniyanne dabaaba dhisheti ubbay naase biratape ooseto.<verse eid="EXO 27:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Xompe Zayte</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 27:20"/>“Xompey qamma poo7ishe aqana mela gum7i xillisida shamaho zayte new ehana mela Isra7eele asaa kiita. <verse eid="EXO 27:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 27:21"/>Aaroninne iya nayti, poo7oy, Godaa sinthan omarsafe wonta gakanaw poo7ana mela Geeshsha Dunkaaniya giddon, Marka Taabotiya sinthan de7iya magarajuwafe kare baggara eetho. Hessi Isra7eele asaas merina woga gididi de7o.<verse eid="EXO 27:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 27"/>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="EXO 28"/>
  <para style="s1">Kahineta Ma7o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 28:1"/>“Ne ishaa Aaronanne iya nayta Nadaaba, Abyooda, Alaazaranne Itamaara neeko xeega. Enti kahine gididi taw haggaazana mela Isra7eele asaa giddofe enta dummaya. <verse eid="EXO 28:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 28:2"/>Iyaw bonchonne teema immana mela ne ishaa Aaronas boncho ma7ota giigisa. <verse eid="EXO 28:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 28:3"/>Aaroni kahinetethan dummatidi taw haggaazanaada, taani hiillatethi immida oosanchota ubbaa xeegada, Aaronas ma7ota giigisana mela oda. <verse eid="EXO 28:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 28:4"/>Enti giigisana ma7otika haysata; tiran ma7etiya ma7o, efuude, adussa qamise, alleeqetidi dadetida shamize, qacenne danco. Ne ishay Aaroninne iya nayti kahine gididi taw haggaazishe ma7ana mela geeshsha ma7ota entaw giigiso. <verse eid="EXO 28:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 28:5"/>Kushe hiillanchoti he ma7ota worqa cachafe, kaalosepe, ocha teera daaneysafe zo7o qacinapenne al7o liinope giigiso.<verse eid="EXO 28:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Efuude</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 39:2-7">Kessa 39:2-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 28:6"/>“Efuude geetetiya ma7uwa worqa cacha qacinape, kaalosepe, ocha teera daaneysafe, zo7o qacinapenne al7o liinope kushe hiillanchoti alleeqisidi giigiso. <verse eid="EXO 28:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 28:7"/>Nam7u hashiyara wodhidi, nam7u baggaa woli gathidi qachanaw maaddiya qangoti de7o. <verse eid="EXO 28:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 28:8"/>Efuudey oosetidabaape hiillan oosetida dancoy efuudiyara wolla oosetidaba gididi issife oyketo. <verse eid="EXO 28:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 28:9"/>Margide geetetiya nam7u shuchata ekada, tammanne nam7u Yayqooba nayta sunthaa enta bolla woocada xaafa. <verse eid="EXO 28:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 28:10"/>Enta yeleta maarada issi shucha bolla usupun sunthata, hanko shuchaa bolla attida usupun sunthata woocada xaafa. <verse eid="EXO 28:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 28:11"/>Ha nam7u shuchata bolla tammanne nam7u Yayqooba nayta sunthaa woocadi xaafanaw hiillancho demma; he xaafetida shuchata efuudiya bolla oythanaw iya yuushuwa worqan lanxa. <verse eid="EXO 28:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 28:12"/>Yaatada tammanne nam7u Isra7eele sheesha qofisiyaba gidana mela ha nam7u shuchata efuudiyara oythada hashiyara aadhiya qanguwa bolla wotha. Taani, Goday, ta asaa ubba wode hassayana mela Aaroni enta sunthaa ba hashiyan tooko. <verse eid="EXO 28:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 28:13"/>He shuchata oykeysa worqafe ootha. <verse eid="EXO 28:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 28:14"/>Qassi walahi bayna worqafe wodoroda dooqetida nam7u santhalaata hashiyara aadhiya qanguwara oyketana mela ootha.<verse eid="EXO 28:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Tiran Ma7etiya Ma7o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 28:15"/>“Godaa sheniya oychidi eranaw, tiran ma7etiya ma7uwa kushe hiillanchon oosisa. He tiran ma7etiya ma7uwa worqa cacha qacinape, kaalosepe, ocha teera daaneysafe, zo7o qacinapenne al7o liinope efuudiyada alleeqisidi giigiso. Kaalosepe oosetidabaape oothada alleeqisa. <verse eid="EXO 28:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 28:16"/>Iyaw geesaynne gompay issi issi takadho gididi oyddu maazaney de7o. <verse eid="EXO 28:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 28:17"/>Iyaw oyddu maaran al7o shuchata wotha. Koyro maaran sardiyoone, toophazenne phooliya al7o shuchata wotha. <verse eid="EXO 28:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 28:18"/>Nam7antho maaran baluure, sanperenne almaaze geetetiya al7o shuchata wotha. <figure style="fig" alt="Turban and breastpiece" file="HK00261B.tif" size="col" ref="28:15">Huupheqacenne Tiran ma7etiya ma7o</figure> <verse eid="EXO 28:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 28:19"/>Heedzantho maaran yaakinte, kelqedoonenne ametesxinoosa geetetiya al7o shuchata wotha. <verse eid="EXO 28:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 28:20"/>Oyddantho maaran birelle, margide, yasphide geetetiya al7o shuchata wotha. Haysati ubbay worqa kaquwa bolla woseto. <verse eid="EXO 28:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 28:21"/>Isra7eele naytas qofiso gidana mela ha tammanne nam7u al7o shuchata, issi issi Yayqooba nayta sunthay, issi issi shucha bolla woocetidi xaafeto.<verse eid="EXO 28:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 28:22"/>“Tiran ma7etiya ma7uwas walahi bayna worqafe wodoroda dooqada santhalaata ootha. <verse eid="EXO 28:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 28:23"/>Nam7u worqa migiddota oothada, tiran ma7etiya ma7uwas qommo gaxa maazaniyan gathada oytha. <verse eid="EXO 28:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 28:24"/>He nam7u worqa santhalaatata migiddotara gathada oytha. <verse eid="EXO 28:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 28:25"/>Hanko baggan de7iya nam7u santhalaata gaxa nam7u qangotara gasetha. Hessada oothada sintha baggara, hashiyara wodhiya efuudiya qanguwara gasetha. <verse eid="EXO 28:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 28:26"/>Qassi nam7u worqa sagaayota oothada, efuudiyape gatha baggara kaallidi de7iya tiran ma7etiya ma7uwas nam7u maazaneta xeeran aatha. <verse eid="EXO 28:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 28:27"/>Hessadaka, worqafe hara nam7u migiddota oothada, efuudiyas sintha bagga hashiyara wodhiya qanguwas garsa baggara gasetha. Efuudiya sikuwa matan dancuwaafe qommo baggara enta gasethanaw bessees. <verse eid="EXO 28:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 28:28"/>Tiran ma7etiya ma7uwan de7iya migiddota efuudiyan de7iya migiddotara gathada kaalose qacinan qacha. Hessada oothiko, tiran ma7etiya ma7oy xeessafe qommon de7iya gisho, qashoy dol7enna.<verse eid="EXO 28:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 28:29"/>“Aaroni Geeshsha bessa geliya wode Isra7eele mayzata sunthaa oykida, tiran ma7etiya ma7uwa ma7o. Yaaniya gisho, taani, Goday ubba wode ta asaa qopana. <verse eid="EXO 28:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 28:30"/>Qassi saama yeggiya nam7u geeshsha shuchata tiran ma7etiya ma7uwan yegga.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Tay 27:21; <ref loc="DEU 33:8">Zaare 33:8</ref>; <ref loc="EZR 2:63">Izi 2:63</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 7:65">Nahi 7:65</ref>.</char></note> Aaroni Geeshsha dunkaaniya geliya wode ba tiran enta tookidi gelo. Ta sheniya Isra7eele asaa erisanaw ta sinthe geliya wode ubban tira kiisiyape dhaysofo.<verse eid="EXO 28:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Hara Kahine Ma7ota</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 28:31"/>“Efuudiyape bollara ma7iya adussa ma7uwa kumethi kaalose afilape giigisa. <verse eid="EXO 28:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 28:32"/>He adusse ma7uwas huuphe aathiya luho medha. He luhoy peedhetonna mela guye qalam7ada yuushsha aathada sika. <verse eid="EXO 28:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 28:33"/>Adussa ma7uwas duge bagga macara yuushuwan kaalose, ocha teera daaneysaninne zo7o qacinape, oromaane teera misile medha. Yaatada enta giddon aatha aatha worqafe oosetida daalata ootha. <verse eid="EXO 28:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 28:34"/>Worqa daalatinne oromaane teera misileti he adusse ma7uwas duge bagga macara yuushuwan aadho. <verse eid="EXO 28:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 28:35"/>Aaroni kahinetethan oothiya wode ha adussa ma7uwa ma7o. Godaa sinthe, Geeshsha Bessaa geliya wodenne keyiya wode, daalay giirana; ika hayqenna. <verse eid="EXO 28:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 28:36"/>Walahi bayna worqafe issi alleeqo oothada, iya bolla ‘Godaas Dummatis’ yaagada woocada xaafa. <verse eid="EXO 28:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 28:37"/>Yaatada huuphiya qaciya bolla kaalose qacinara qacha. <verse eid="EXO 28:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EXO 28:38"/>Aaroni iya ba som7uwan wotho. Hessan Isra7eele asay Godaas imota immishe balidabay de7iko, he balaa Aaroni tookees. Asay ehiyaba Goday ekana mela I hessa ubba wode ba som7uwan wothanaw koshshees.<verse eid="EXO 28:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="EXO 28:39"/>“Aarona shamziyanne qacciya al7o liinope dadda. Qassi dancuwaka al7o liinope daddada alleeqisa. <verse eid="EXO 28:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="EXO 28:40"/>Aarona naytas bonchonne puula immana mela shamizeta, dancotanne huuphen wothiya qoobeta giigisa. <verse eid="EXO 28:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="EXO 28:41"/>Neeni ha ma7ota ne ishaa Aaronanne iya nayta mayza. Enti kahinetethan taw haggaazana mela enta shamaho zayten tiyada taw dummaya. <verse eid="EXO 28:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="EXO 28:42"/>Enta kalloy kametana mela garsan ma7iya ma7uwa xeessafe bidi wodire gakanaw kammiyaba al7o liinope sure giigisa. <verse eid="EXO 28:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="EXO 28:43"/>Aaroninne iya nayti Geeshsha Dunkaaniya geliya wode woyko Geeshsha Bessan kahinetethan haggaazanaw yarsho bessi shiiqiya wode ha ma7ota ma7o. Hessada haniko, enti banta bolla hayqo ehokona. Hessi Aaronasinne iya sheeshatas merinaa woga gido.<verse eid="EXO 28:43"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 28"/>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="EXO 29"/>
  <para style="s1">Kahineta Shuumo Woga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LEV 8:1-36">Leewe 8:1-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 29:1"/>“Aaroninne iya nayti kahinetethan taw haggaazana mela neeni enta dummayanaw haysada ootha; borey bayna wofaanonne nam7u maraze eka. <verse eid="EXO 29:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 29:2"/>Geeshsha giste dhiille ekada, irsho yeggonna shamaho zaytera gindada uythu uuka. Qassi zaytey gelonna hara uythu uuka; hessadaka, lee7o uythu uukada zayten tiya. <verse eid="EXO 29:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 29:3"/>Wofaanuwanne nam7u marazeta yarshiya wode he uytha ubbaa gaytan wothada taw shiisha.<verse eid="EXO 29:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 29:4"/>“Yaatada Aaronanne iya nayta Geeshsha Dunkaaniya penge ehada haathan enti meecetana mela oda. <verse eid="EXO 29:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 29:5"/>Hessafe guye, kahinetetha ma7ota, shamziya, efuudiya, efuudiya bollara ma7iya adussa ma7uwanne tiran ma7etiya ma7uwa Aarona mayza; dancuwaka dancisa. <verse eid="EXO 29:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 29:6"/>Qacciya qaccisa; iya bolla, ‘Godaas dummatis’ geetetidi xaafetida worqa alleequwa wotha. <verse eid="EXO 29:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 29:7"/>Tishsha zaytiya ekada iya huuphiyan tigada tiya. <verse eid="EXO 29:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 29:8"/>Iya nayta ehada shamziya mayza. <verse eid="EXO 29:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 29:9"/>Enta xeessaa dancisa; enta huuphiyanka qoobe wotha. Aaronanne iya nayta yaatada kahinetethan shuuma. Hessika, entaw merina woga gido.<verse eid="EXO 29:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 29:10"/>“Wofaanuwa Geeshsha Dunkaaniya sinthe ehada, Aaroninne iya nayti iya huuphiyan banta kushiya wothana mela ootha. <verse eid="EXO 29:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 29:11"/>Wofaanuwa Geeshsha Dunkaaniya pengiyan Godaa sinthan shuka. <verse eid="EXO 29:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 29:12"/>Wofaanuwa suuthaafe guuthu ekada ne biradhiyan, yarsho bessa bolla de7iya kaceta tiya. Attidaysa yarsho bessaafe garsan gussa. <verse eid="EXO 29:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 29:13"/>Hessafe guye, ulo ashuwa kammida modhuwa ubbaa, tiriyaas lo77o baggaa, nam7u kilahotanne enta kammida modhuwa ekada, yarsho bessaa bolla wothada xuugga. <verse eid="EXO 29:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 29:14"/>Shin wofaanuwa ulo ashuwa, iya galbaanne maraaciya gutaape gaxa kessada xuugga. Hessi kahineta nagaraa quchiya yarsho.<verse eid="EXO 29:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 29:15"/>“Nam7u marazetape issuwa ekada, Aaroninne iya nayti banta kushiya iya huuphen wothana mela ootha. <verse eid="EXO 29:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 29:16"/>He maraziya shukada, suuthaa yarsho bessan oyddu maazanetan wurxa. <verse eid="EXO 29:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 29:17"/>Iya ashuwa qanxerethada, ulo ashuwanne gedaa meeccada, huuphiya hara qommo ashotara issife yarsho bessan wotha. <verse eid="EXO 29:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 29:18"/>Hessafe guye, kumetha ashuwa yarsho bessan xuugga. Hessika Godaas xuussa yarsho. He yarshuwa sawoy Godaa ufaysees.<verse eid="EXO 29:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 29:19"/>“Qassi kahinetetha wogas eketida hanko maraziya ekada Aaroninne iya nayti banta kushiya iya huuphen wothana mela oda. <verse eid="EXO 29:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 29:20"/>Iya shukada, suuthaafe guuthu ekada, Aaronasinne iya naytas ushacha haythatas gaxaa, enta ushacha kushiyasinne tohuwas wogga biradheta tiya. Attida suuthaa yarsho bessa oyddu maazanetan wurxa. <verse eid="EXO 29:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 29:21"/>Yarsho bessan de7iya suuthaafenne tiyiya zaytiyape guuthu ekada, Aarona bollanne iya ma7uwa bolla, qassika iya nayta bollanne enta ma7uwa bolla wurxa. Hessan Aaroninne iya nayti banta ma7uwara taw dummatidaysata gidana.<verse eid="EXO 29:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 29:22"/>“He marazey kahineta shuuma wogaas eketiya gisho, goyna modhuwa, ulo ashuwa kammida modhuwa, tiriya kammida moodhiya, nam7u kilahota, enta kammida moodhiyanne ushacha guye gedaa qanxada shaaka. <verse eid="EXO 29:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 29:23"/>Godaa sinthan wothida uythatape, zaytey geliboonna uythaa, zaytera uukida uythaanne lee7o uythaafe issuwa eka. <verse eid="EXO 29:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 29:24"/>Neeni ha katha ubbaa Aarona kushiyaninne iya nayta kushiyan wotha. Enti iya yuusho yarsho oothidi Godaas immiya yarsho oothidi Godaa sinthan shiisho. <verse eid="EXO 29:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 29:25"/>Hessafe guye, enta kushepe ekada yarsho bessa bolla wotha; xuussa yarshuwara gathada, Godaa sawana mela yarsho bessa bolla taman xuugga. <verse eid="EXO 29:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 29:26"/>Aaroni kahine gididi shuumetiya wode shukida maraziya angaasuwa ekada, Godaa sinthan yuusho yarsho ootha. Hessi hintena gakiya gisho gidana.<verse eid="EXO 29:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 29:27"/>“Kahiney shuumetiya wode, Aaronanne iya nayta kahinetethan shuumanaw eketida angaaysuwanne toho ashuwa taw dummaya. Hessika, kahineta gakiya gisho gido. <verse eid="EXO 29:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 29:28"/>Isra7eeleti ubbay kahine shuumanaw woyko anjetanaw Godaas Angaasonne guye toho yarsho immiya wode ashoy taw dummatidaysa gido. Shin gishoy Aaronasinne iya naytas gako; he wogay laametofo.<verse eid="EXO 29:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 29:29"/>“Aaroni hayqida wode iya nayti iya kahinetetha ma7uwa laatto. Enti kahinetethan shuumetidaape guye he ma7uwa ma7o. <verse eid="EXO 29:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 29:30"/>Iya naytape iya bessan kahine gididi, Geeshsha bessan haggaazanaw Geeshsha Dunkaaniya yaa na7i he ma7uwa laapun gallas ma7o.<verse eid="EXO 29:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 29:31"/>“Aaroninne iya nayti kahine gididi shuumetiya wode shuketida maraziya ashuwa ekada, geeshsha bessan katha. <verse eid="EXO 29:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 29:32"/>Aaroninne iya nayti maraziya ashuwa gaytan attida uythaara Geeshsha Dunkaaniya pengen mo. <verse eid="EXO 29:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 29:33"/>Enti kahine gididi shuumetiya wode nagara atotethas yarshetida he ashuwa mona. Shin he kathay geeshshi gidida gisho, kahineta xalaali mo; hara asi oonika moopo. <verse eid="EXO 29:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 29:34"/>Ashuwapenne kathaafe mishin attidi aqiko, taman xuugeto; geeshshi gidida gisho meetetofo.<verse eid="EXO 29:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 29:35"/>“Aaroninne iya nayti kahine gididi shuumetiya wode, ta nena kiitida ubbaa ootha; ba7aaley laapun gallasan poleto. <verse eid="EXO 29:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 29:36"/>Nagaraa atotethas issi issi gallasan issi wofaano shukada yarsha. Hessi yarsho bessa geeshshees. Yaatada yarsho bessa polo geeshshanaw shamaho zayte tiya. <verse eid="EXO 29:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 29:37"/>Hessa laapun gallas gakanaw gallas gallas ootha. Yaatiko yarsho bessay polo geeshshi gidana. I polo geeshshi gidida gisho, iya bochiya asi woyko haraba ubbay geeyana.<verse eid="EXO 29:37"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Gallasa Yarsho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="EXO 29:38"/>“Laythan laythan yarsho bessan gallas gallas issi laythi gidida nam7u marazeta yarsha. <verse eid="EXO 29:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="EXO 29:39"/>Marazetape issuwa wonta, qassi hankuwa omarsi yarsha. <verse eid="EXO 29:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="EXO 29:40"/>Koyro maraziyara issi kilo giraame gidiya geeshsha lo77o giste dhiille, issi litiro shamaho zaytera gindada yarsha. Issi litiro woyne ushsha yarsho oothada gussa. <verse eid="EXO 29:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="EXO 29:41"/>Hanko maraziya omarsi yarshashe wonta yarshoysa mela dhiille, zaytenne woyne ushsha shiisha. Hessi taw yarshetiya katha yarsho; iya sawoy tana ufayseysa gidana.<verse eid="EXO 29:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="EXO 29:42"/>“Laythan laythan he xuussa yarshoy Geeshsha Dunkaaniya pengen, Godaa sinthan paci bayna yashetanaw bessees. He bessan taani ta deriyara gahetana; neeraka yan odetana. <verse eid="EXO 29:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="EXO 29:43"/>Yan taani Isra7eeletara gahetana; ta bonchoy he bessa dummayana. <verse eid="EXO 29:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="EXO 29:44"/>Taani Geeshsha Dunkaaniyanne yarsho bessa dummayana; enti taw kahine gididi haggaazana mela Aaronanne iya nayta dummayana. <verse eid="EXO 29:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="EXO 29:45"/>Yaatada, taani Isra7eeleta giddon daana; enta Xoossaa gidana. <verse eid="EXO 29:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="EXO 29:46"/>Enta giddon daanaw Gibxefe enta kessida Goday, enta Xoossay tana gideysa enti erana. Taani Godaa, enta Xoossaa.<verse eid="EXO 29:46"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 29"/>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="EXO 30"/>
  <para style="s1">Ixaane Yarshiya Bessi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 37:25-28">Kessa 37:25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 30:1"/>“Ixaane cuyisiya bessaa soqala mithafe medha. <verse eid="EXO 30:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 30:2"/>Iyaw oyddu maazaney de7o. Adussatethaynne gompay issi issi wadha, geesay nam7u wadha gido. Oyddu maazaniyan de7iya kaceti iyara oyketidi oosetonna. <verse eid="EXO 30:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 30:3"/>Iyaw bolla baggaa, iya oyddu maazanetanne iya kaceta walahi bayna worqan lanxa. Iya yuushuwaka worqan lanxa. <verse eid="EXO 30:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 30:4"/>Nam7u worqa sagaayota oothada, xarpheeza tookanaw maaddiya kaso mithata aathanaw goossaas nam7u baggara oytha. <verse eid="EXO 30:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 30:5"/>Kaso mithata soqala mithafe kessada, enta worqan lanxa. <verse eid="EXO 30:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 30:6"/>He ixaane yarsho xarpheezaa, Caaqo Taabotiya sinthan kaqetida magarajuwafe kare baggara wotha. Yan taani neera gahetana.<verse eid="EXO 30:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 30:7"/>“Aaroni wonta wonta xompeta giigisanaw yaa wode, sawiya ixaane yarshiya bessan cuyiso. <verse eid="EXO 30:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 30:8"/>Hessada, Aaroni omarsi xompeta xompiya wodeka ixaane cuyiso. He ixaaniya yarshoy yaana laytha ubban Godaa sinthan cuyo. <verse eid="EXO 30:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 30:9"/>Ha yarsho bessan hara digetida ixaane, katha yarsho, mehe yarshonne woyne yarsho yarshofa. <verse eid="EXO 30:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 30:10"/>Aaroni, nagaraa atotethas laythafe issi toho shuketiya mehiya suuthaafe ekidi, he yarsho bessa maazaneta bolla de7iya kaceta wothidi geeshsho wogaa polo. Ha wogay sinthara yaana wode ubban laythan laythan poleto. He yarsho bessay geeshshi gidiya gisho Godaas dummatis” yaagis.<verse eid="EXO 30:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nagara Atotetha Miishe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 30:11"/>Hessafe guye, Goday Museko haysada yaagis; <verse eid="EXO 30:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 30:12"/>“Neeni Isra7eele asaa taybiya wode, issi issi asi ba shempuwa wozanaw Godaas miishe qanxo. Yaatiko neeni enta taybiya wode gadoy enta bolla yeenna. <verse eid="EXO 30:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 30:13"/>Taybon geliya asi oonika huuphen huuphen geeshsha dunkaanen eretida mizaane ginan bira ciggo. Issi issi asi hessa taw yarsho oothidi immo. <verse eid="EXO 30:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 30:14"/>Taybon geliya asi oonika laythi laatamanne iyape bolla gidida ubbay Godaas hessa eho. <verse eid="EXO 30:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 30:15"/>Enti banta shempuwa wozanaw Godaas imota immiya wode, dureyka manqoyka issi gina immofe attishin, durey darsidi woyko manqoy guuthidi immofo. <verse eid="EXO 30:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 30:16"/>He miishiya Isra7eele asaape ekada, Geeshsha Dunkaaniya naaganaw peeshsha. He miishey enta shempuwa wozanawunne ta enta naagana mela qofisiyaba gidana” yaagis.<verse eid="EXO 30:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Meecha Kere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 30:17"/>Goday Museko haysada yaagis; <verse eid="EXO 30:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 30:18"/>“Meecha keriyanne iya tohuwa naase biratape medha. Iyan haathe tigada Geeshsha Dunkaaniyapenne yarsho bessaafe giddon wotha.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 38:8">Kessa 38:8</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="EXO 30:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 30:19"/>Aaroninne iya nayti banta kushiyanne banta tohuwa yan meeceto. <verse eid="EXO 30:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 30:20"/>Enti Geeshsha Dunkaaniya gelanaapenne yarsho yarshanaape sinthe hessa oothanaw bessees. Hessa enti oothiko hayqope attoosona. <verse eid="EXO 30:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 30:21"/>Enti hayqonna mela, banta kushiyanne banta tohuwa meecetanaw bessees. Hessi Aaronasinne iya sheeshatas, yaa yeletetha ubbaas merinaa woga gidana” yaagis.<verse eid="EXO 30:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Shuumatetha Zayte</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 30:22"/>Goday Museko haysada yaagis; <verse eid="EXO 30:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 30:23"/>“Geeshsha sawota, hessatika; usupun kilo giraame gukiya karbe, heedzu kilo giraame sawiya qarafa, heedzu kilo giraame sawiya maata, <verse eid="EXO 30:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 30:24"/>usupun kilo giraame burgude eka. He ubbayka geeshsha dunkaanen eretida mizaaniya gina gido. Hessata bolla oyddu litiro zayte guja. <verse eid="EXO 30:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 30:25"/>Hessata shittoda walakada, sawiya geeshsha zayte oothada, <verse eid="EXO 30:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 30:26"/>Geeshsha Dunkaaniyanne Caaqo Taabotiya tiya. <verse eid="EXO 30:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 30:27"/>Xarpheezanne iya miisheta, xompe wothiya kocaanne iya miisheta, ixaane cuyisiya xarpheezaa, <verse eid="EXO 30:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 30:28"/>xuussa yarsho bessinne iyan bolla de7iya miisheta ubba, meecha keriyanne iya tohuwa tiya. <verse eid="EXO 30:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 30:29"/>Enti polo geeshshi gidana mela enta dummaya. Enta bochiya oonika geeshshi gidana.<verse eid="EXO 30:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 30:30"/>“Hessafe guye, Aaroninne iya nayti kahine gididi taw haggaazana mela enta tiyada dummaya. <verse eid="EXO 30:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 30:31"/>Isra7eele asaas, ‘Haysi Geeshsha shuumatetha zaytey yaa yeletethaas tana haggaazanaw maaddiya zayte gido. <verse eid="EXO 30:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 30:32"/>He zaytiya coo asa bolla gussofa; qassi ay zayteka iya oothida ogiyan oothofa. Zaytey geeshshi gidida gisho, hinteka iya geeshshatetha erite. <verse eid="EXO 30:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 30:33"/>He shittuwa giigisiya asi, woyko kahine gidonna hara asi tiyiya oonika ta asaa giddofe hileto’ yaaga” yaagis.<verse eid="EXO 30:33"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ixaane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 30:34"/>Goday Museko haysada yaagis; “Geeshsha sawota, xokiya mitha made, dhaadhe keethan de7iya shitto, sawiya madenne sawiya ixaane eka; enta ubbaa mizaaney issi gina gido. <verse eid="EXO 30:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 30:35"/>Shittoda walahetida ixaane oothada enta go7eta. Walahi baynanne geeshshi gidana mela iyan maxine yegga. <verse eid="EXO 30:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 30:36"/>Iyape guuthara ekada liiqisa caddada, taani neera gahetiya Geeshsha Dunkaaniya giddon, Caaqo Taabotiya sinthan wurxa. He ixaaney new polo geeshshi gido. <verse eid="EXO 30:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 30:37"/>Hintew go7etanaw he ixaaniya ay ogenka giigisopite. Hessi taw dummatidaysa gideysa erite. <verse eid="EXO 30:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EXO 30:38"/>Hessatho oothidi, iya sawuwa singidi ufaytanaw koyiya oonika, ta asaa giddofe dhayana” yaagis.<verse eid="EXO 30:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 30"/>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="EXO 31"/>
  <para style="s1">Basili7eelanne Eliyaaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 31:1"/>Goday Museko haysada yaagis; <verse eid="EXO 31:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 31:2"/>“Taani Yihuda sheeshape gidida Huura na7aa na7aa, Ure na7aa, Basili7eela dooras. <verse eid="EXO 31:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 31:3"/>Taani iya ta Ayyaanan kunthas; taani hiilla, akeekanne ooso ubbaa oothiya era iyaw immas. <verse eid="EXO 31:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 31:4"/>Hessika, hiillan oothana oosota halchidi worqafe, birapenne naase biratape dumma dummaba kessidi oothanaasa. <verse eid="EXO 31:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 31:5"/>Hessadaka, al7o shuchu massidi giigiseysa, mithi masseysanne hara ooso ubbaa oothana mela cincatethi immas. <verse eid="EXO 31:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 31:6"/>Qassi iya maaddana mela Daane sheeshi gidida Ahisamaaka na7aa Eliyaaba dooras. Taani nena kiittidaba ubbaa enti oothana mela kushe hiilla eriya harata ubbaas gita eratethi immas. <verse eid="EXO 31:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 31:7"/>Enti oothanabati, Geeshsha Dunkaaniya, Caaqo Taabotiya, iya bolla wothiya nagara atotetha kamaa, Dunkaaniya giddon go7etiya miishe ubbaa, <verse eid="EXO 31:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 31:8"/>xarpheezanne iya miisheta, walahi bayna worqafe oosetida xompe wothiya kocaanne iya miishe ubbaa, ixaane cuyisiya xarpheezaa, <verse eid="EXO 31:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 31:9"/>xuussa yarsho bessinne iya miishe ubbaa, meecha keriyanne iya tohuwa, <verse eid="EXO 31:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 31:10"/>Aaroninne iya nayti kahinetethan haggaazishe ma7iya kahinetetha ma7uwa, <verse eid="EXO 31:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 31:11"/>shuumatetha zaytiyanne Geeshsha Bessaas haniya sawiya ixaaniya, taani nena kiitidaysada enti oothana” yaagis.<verse eid="EXO 31:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Sambaata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 31:12"/>Goday Muse haysada yaagidi kiittis; <verse eid="EXO 31:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 31:13"/>“Isra7eele asaa, ‘Ta Sambaata naagite. Hessi taani, Goday, hintena taw geeshsha dere oothada dooridaysa bessiya malla gididi, yaana yeletetha ubbaas taapenne hintefe giddon de7o. <verse eid="EXO 31:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 31:14"/>He gallasay geeshshi gidiya gisho, iya bonchite. Sambaata bonchonaynne he gallasan ooso oothiya oonika ta asaa giddofe dhayo woyko hayqo. <verse eid="EXO 31:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 31:15"/>Hinte ooso oothanaw bessiya usupun gallasati de7oosona. Shin laapuntha gallasay Godaas dummatida, shempo gallas. Sambaata gallasan ooso oothiya oonika hayqo. <verse eid="EXO 31:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 31:16"/>Isra7eele yeletetha ubbay ha Sambaata gallasaa merina caaqo malla oothidi boncho. <verse eid="EXO 31:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 31:17"/>Taani usupun gallasan saluwanne sa7aa medhida gishonne laapuntha gallasan ooso aggada shempida gisho, ta giddoninne Isra7eeleta giddon hessi merinaw eqidi de7iya malla gidana’ yaaga” yaagis.<verse eid="EXO 31:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 31:18"/>Goday Muse Siina zuma bolla odiseysa ongida wode, I ba biradhen xaafida tammu kiitata oykida nam7u loche shuchata Muses immis.<verse eid="EXO 31:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 31"/>
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="EXO 32"/>
  <para style="s1">Worqa Mara Misile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 32:1"/>Asay, Musey zumaa bollafe wodhanaw gam7idaysa be7ida wode Aaronako yidi, “Nuna kaalethishe naagana xoossata nuus ootha. Gibxe biittafe nuna kessida Musey waanidaako eroko” yaagidosona. <verse eid="EXO 32:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 32:2"/>Aaroni entako, “Hinte macheta, hinte adde naytanne hinte macca nayta haythan de7iya worqaa kessidi, taw haa ekidi yiite” yaagis. <verse eid="EXO 32:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 32:3"/>Asi ubbay banta haythafe worqaa kessidi, Aaronas ehidosona. <verse eid="EXO 32:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 32:4"/>I hessa entafe ekidi, taman sheeshidaape guye, qoxidi, worqa mara misile oothidi medhis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 32:4">Enti, “Isra7eeleto, nuna Gibxe biittafe kaalethidi kessida nu xoossati haysata” yaagidosona. <verse eid="EXO 32:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 32:5"/>Aaroni hessa be7ida wode, he maraa sinthan yarsho besse giigisidi, “Wonto Godaa bonchiya ba7aale gallas gidana” yaagidi erisis. <verse eid="EXO 32:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 32:6"/>Wontetha gallas guura asay dendidi, xuussa yarshonne issifetetha yarsho yarshidosona. Yaatidi, asay maanawunne uyanaw uttidosona. Mi uyi simmidi, duranawunne pokoba hananaw dendidosona.<verse eid="EXO 32:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 32:7"/>Goday Museko, “Neeni Gibxefe kessada, ehida ne asay nagara oothidi, bantana tunisida gisho ellesada duge wodha. <verse eid="EXO 32:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 32:8"/>Taani enta kiitida ogiyape enti ellesidi shiretidosona. Worqa sheeshidi mara misile oothidi, bantaw eeqa medhidi iya goyinnidosona. Iyaw yarshidi, ‘Nuna Gibxe biittafe kessida nu xoossay haysa’ yaagidosona. <verse eid="EXO 32:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 32:9"/>Goday Museko, ha asay ay mela wozana muumeko ta be7as. <verse eid="EXO 32:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 32:10"/>Ha77i ta hanqoy enta bolla eexin, taani enta dhaysanaw giigetida gisho, neeni tana diggofa. Yaatada, taani nena gita dere oothana” yaagis.<verse eid="EXO 32:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 32:11"/>Shin Musey ba Godaa, Xoossaa haysada yaagidi woossis; “Abeeti Godaw, neeni ne gita wolqaaninne ne mino kushiyan Gibxefe kessada ehida ne asaa bolla ne hanqoy ayis eexii?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Tay 14:13-19.</char></note> <verse eid="EXO 32:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 32:12"/>Ne hessa oothiyaba gidiko, Gibxeti, ‘Goday entana dereta bolla wodhanawunne biittafe pittidi dhaysanaw kessis’ ayis gaanee? Ne yashshiya hanquwafe simma. Ne asaa dhaysanaw qopidaysa agga. <verse eid="EXO 32:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 32:13"/>Ne aylleta Abrahaame, Yisaaqanne Yayqooba hassaya. Neeni entaw, ‘Taani hinte sheesha salo xoolintoda darsana; taani hintew immana gida ha biitta ubbaa hinte sheeshatas immana; enti he biitta merinaw laattana’ gada ne huuphen ne caaqida caaquwa qopa” yaagis. <verse eid="EXO 32:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 32:14"/>Hessa gisho, Goday ba deriya bolla iitabaa ehanaw qopidaysa aggidi, enta maaris.<verse eid="EXO 32:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 32:15"/>Musey nam7u baggara xaafetida, tammu kiitati de7iya nam7u loche shuchata ba kushen oykidi, zumaape duge wodhis. <verse eid="EXO 32:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 32:16"/>He masetida shuchata giigisiday Xoossaa; shuchata bolla woocidi xaafidayka Xoossaa.<verse eid="EXO 32:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 32:17"/>Iyyasuy asaa kooshincha si7ida wode, Museko, “Asay siiratida bessan ola waasoy si7etees” yaagis.<verse eid="EXO 32:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 32:18"/>Musey zaaridi, “Haysi xoonida asa ceeqo woyko xoonetida asa yeeho gidonashin, yetha waaso” yaagis.<verse eid="EXO 32:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 32:19"/>Musey gutaako matida wode maranne dursaa be7idi daro hanqetis. He wode ba kushen oykidi yida, masetida shuchata zumaa xaphon holidi mentherethis. <verse eid="EXO 32:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 32:20"/>Enti medhida maraa ekidi, taman xuuggis. Hessafe guye, liiqana gakanaw gaaccidi haathara maadhidi, Isra7eele asay uyanaada oothis.<verse eid="EXO 32:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 32:21"/>Musey Aaronako, “Ha asay new ay oothin, enta haysa mela iita nagara banta bolla oothana mela oothadii?” yaagis.<verse eid="EXO 32:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 32:22"/>Aaroni zaaridi, “Ta godaw, tana hanqetofa. Ha asay iitaba oothanaw ay mela koyaako ne eraasa. <verse eid="EXO 32:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 32:23"/>Enti, ‘Nuna Gibxefe kessidi ehida, Musey waanidaako nu eroko. Hessa gisho, kaalethiya xoossata nuus ootha’ yaagidosona. <verse eid="EXO 32:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 32:24"/>Taani entako, ‘Hinte haythan de7iya worqaa kessidi, hammite’ yaagas. Enti taw immida worqaa taani taman yeggin, ha mara misiley keyis” yaagis.<verse eid="EXO 32:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 32:25"/>Aaroni asaa coo yeddi aggin, asay ba morketa sinthan kawuyidi, kadhetidaysa Musey be7is. <verse eid="EXO 32:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 32:26"/>Hessa gisho, Musey gutaa geliya pengiyan eqidi, “Godaa bagga gidiya asi oonika taako yo” yaagis. He wode Leeweti ubbay iyako shiiqidosona.<verse eid="EXO 32:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 32:27"/>I, entako, “Goday, Isra7eele Xoossay, hinte issoy issoy hinte mashshaa shoddidi, gutaas ha pengefe hini penge gakanaw bidi, hinte ishata, hinte laggetanne hinte shoorota wodhite” yaagis. <verse eid="EXO 32:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 32:28"/>Leeweti Musey kiitidaysada oothidi, he gallas heedzu mukulu gidiya asaa wodhidosona. <verse eid="EXO 32:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 32:29"/>Musey Leewetako, “Hachi hinte, hinte naytanne hinte ishata wodhanaw kiitetidi hintena Godaas dummayideta. Goday hintena anjis” yaagis.<verse eid="EXO 32:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 32:30"/>Wontetha gallas Musey asaako, “Hinte iita nagara oothideta; shin ha77i taani Godaako zuma bolla keyada, ooni eri hinte nagaras atotethi demmonna aggike” yaagis. <verse eid="EXO 32:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 32:31"/>Yaatin Musey Godaako simmidi bidi, “Ha asay iita nagaraa oothidosona; enti bantaw worqafe xoosse medhidosona. <verse eid="EXO 32:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 32:32"/>Shin hayyana, ha77i enta nagaraa atto yaaga. Hessi hanonnaba giiko, ne asaa ne xaafida mazgabiyape ta sunthaa qucha” yaagis.<verse eid="EXO 32:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 32:33"/>Goday zaaridi Museko, “Taani ta mazgabiyape quchana asaa sunthay, ta bolla nagara oothidaysata sunthaa. <verse eid="EXO 32:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 32:34"/>Ha77i bada, ha asaa taani new odida bessaa kaaletha. Ta kiitanchoyka nena kaalethanaysa akeeka, shin taani ha asaa enta nagara gisho seerana wodey yaanaysi attenna” yaagis.<verse eid="EXO 32:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 32:35"/>Aaroni worqafe mara misiliya medhanaada oothiday asaa gidiya gisho, Goday asaa bolla wolqaama gado yeddis.<verse eid="EXO 32:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 32"/>
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="EXO 33"/>
  <para style="s1">Isra7eele Asay Siina Zumaape Denduwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 33:1"/>Hessafe guye, Goday Museko, “Neeninne ne Gibxefe kessida asay ha bessaafe dendidi, taani Abrahaames, Yisaaqas, Yayqoobasinne enta sheeshatas immana yaagada caaqida biitta biite. <verse eid="EXO 33:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 33:2"/>Taani hinte sinthan kiitanchuwa kiittana. Kanaaneta, Amooreta, Hiteta, Parzeta, Hiwetanne Yaabuseta taani gooddada kessana. <verse eid="EXO 33:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 33:3"/>Maathinne eessi goggiya he biitta biite. Shin hinte, wozani muumida asi gidiya gisho ta hintena ogen dhaysona mela hintera biike” yaagis.<verse eid="EXO 33:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 33:4"/>Asay he yashshiya odaa si7idi yeekidosona. He wodepe doomidi ubbay banta alleequwa aathibokona. <verse eid="EXO 33:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 33:5"/>Goday Museko, Isra7eele asaas haysada yaagada oda yaagis; “Hinte wozana muume asi. Taani hintera hari attoshin guutha wodeska biiko, hinte taape dhayana. Ha77i hinte, hinte alleeqota kessite; taani hinte bolla oothanaba bessaana yaaga” yaagis. <verse eid="EXO 33:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 33:6"/>He wode Isra7eeleti Koreeba zumaa aggidi bidaape guye, banta alleeqota aathibokona.<verse eid="EXO 33:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Gahetetha Dunkaane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 33:7"/>Isra7eele asay bishe siiratiya guta ubban Musey dunkaaniya gutaape haassidi tokees. He dunkaaney, “Godaara gahetiya Dunkaane” geetetidi xeegetis. Godaa oychanaw koyiya ubbay yaa bees. <verse eid="EXO 33:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 33:8"/>Musey dunkaaniyako biya wode asa ubbay ba dunkaaniya pengen pengen eqidi, Musey yaa gelana gakanaw iya be7oosona. <verse eid="EXO 33:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 33:9"/>Musey yaa gelidaape guye, shaara tuussay wodhidi Dunkaaniya pengen eqees. Goday shaara giddon gididi Musera odetees. <verse eid="EXO 33:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 33:10"/>Asay shaara tuussa Dunkaaniya pengiyan be7ida wode ubban, ba pengen pengen gulbatidi Godaas goyinnoosona. <verse eid="EXO 33:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 33:11"/>Asi ba laggera odeteysada Goday Musera som7on odetees. Hessafe guye, Musey gutaa simmees. Shin iya maaddiya na7atethay, Nawe na7aa Iyyasuy, Godaara gahetiya Dunkaaniyape shaaketenna.<verse eid="EXO 33:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Goday Ba Asaas Gelida Qaala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 33:12"/>Musey Godaako, “Neeni tana, ha asaa ta gida biitta kaaletha yaagadasa. Shin taara baana mela neeni kiittey ooneko, tana erisabaaka. Neeni, tana ereysanne tanan ufayteysa taw qoncisadasa. <verse eid="EXO 33:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 33:13"/>Hessi tuma gidiko, ta nena haggaazana melanne guja ufaysana mela ne ogiya tana tamaarsa. Ha asay ne dere gideysa be7a” yaagis.<verse eid="EXO 33:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 33:14"/>Goday zaaridi, “Taani, neera baana melanne new saro immana mela koyay?” yaagis.<verse eid="EXO 33:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 33:15"/>Musey zaaridi, “Neeni nuura boonnaba gidiko, haysafe nuna kessofa. <verse eid="EXO 33:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 33:16"/>Neeni nuura boonnaba gidiko, tananinne ne asan ne ufaytidaysa asa ubbay waatidi eranee? Biitta ubban de7iya hara asa ubbaafe taaninne ne asay dummatey ne nuura de7eysan gidenneyee?” yaagis.<verse eid="EXO 33:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 33:17"/>Goday Museko, “Taani nena eriya gishonne nenan ufaytida gisho, ne tana oychidaysa ubbaa oothana” yaagis.<verse eid="EXO 33:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 33:18"/>Musey Godaako, “Hayyana ne kumetha bonchuwa tana bessa?” yaagis.<verse eid="EXO 33:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 33:19"/>Goday zaaridi, “Taani ta maarotanne ta lo77otetha ubbaa ne sinthara aathana. Ta geeshsha sunthaa ne matan awaajana. Taani Godaa; ta dooridaysata maarananne entaw qadhetana. <verse eid="EXO 33:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 33:20"/>Shin oonika ta som7uwa be7idi paxa doonna gisho, neeni ta som7uwa be7aka” yaagis.<verse eid="EXO 33:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 33:21"/>Shin, “Neeni zaalla bolla eqanaw haysan ta matan bessi de7ees. <verse eid="EXO 33:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 33:22"/>Ta bonchoy aadhiya wode taani za77ida zaalla giddon nena wothana. Ta aadhana gakanaw ta kushiyan nena kammana. <verse eid="EXO 33:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 33:23"/>Hessafe guye, taani ta kushiya denthana; neeni ta zokuwa be7ana, shin ta som7uwa be7aka” yaagis.<verse eid="EXO 33:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 33"/>
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="EXO 34"/>
  <para style="s1">Zaaridi Oosetida Loche Shuchata</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="DEU 10:1-5">Zaare 10:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 34:1"/>Goday Museko, “Koyroyisata daaniya nam7u loche shuchata massada giigisa. Taani he shuchata bolla kase neeni menthida shuchata bolla de7iya qaalata xaafana. <verse eid="EXO 34:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 34:2"/>Wonto wonta guura taara gahetanaw Siina Zumaa huuphiya keya. <verse eid="EXO 34:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 34:3"/>Neera oonika keyopo woyko zumaa bolla awunka bentofo. Hari attoshin dorsa woyko mehe wudey zumaa xaphon heemetofo woyko moopo” yaagis.<verse eid="EXO 34:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 34:4"/>Hessa gisho, Musey koyro shuchata daaniya nam7u shuchata massidi, Goday kiitidaysada, shuchata oykidi wonta guura Siina zuma bola keyis. <verse eid="EXO 34:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 34:5"/>Goday shaarara wodhidi, iyara yan eqidi, “Taani Godaa” yaagidi ba geeshsha sunthaa awaajis. <verse eid="EXO 34:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 34:6"/>Goday Muse sinthara aadhishe haysada yaagidi awaajis; “Taani Xoossaa, ta sunthay Godaa. Taani, qadheynne maarotay kumida Xoossaa. Taani danda7aninne merina siiqon kumidaysanne daro ammantheysa. <verse eid="EXO 34:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 34:7"/>Taani, ta asaas geliya qaala mukulu yeletethi gakanaw naageysanne iitatethaa, makallanne nagaraa atto geysa. Shin heedzanthonne oyddantho yeletethi gakanaw aawata nagara gisho nayta seeronna aggike” yaagis.<verse eid="EXO 34:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 34:8"/>Musey ellesidi biittan gufannidi goyinnis. <verse eid="EXO 34:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 34:9"/>I zaaridi, “Abeeti Godaw, neeni tanan ufaytiyaba gidiko, nuura issife yedha. Haysi asay si7onna asi; nu iitatethaanne nu nagaraa atto yaagada, nuna ne ase ootha” yaagis.<verse eid="EXO 34:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 34:10"/>Goday Museko, “Taani Isra7eele asaara caaqana. Haysafe kase biitta bolla awunka hani eronna malaalsiyaba ne asaa sinthan oothana. Taani Goday, ay mela malaalsiyaba oothiyako, neeni enta giddon de7iya asay be7ana. <verse eid="EXO 34:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 34:11"/>Hachi taani hintena kiittiya kiita naagite. Hinte sinthafe Amooreta, Kanaaneta, Hiteta, Parzeta, Hiwetanne Yaabuseta taani gooddana. <verse eid="EXO 34:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 34:12"/>Enti hintew xihe gidonna mela hinte geliya biittan de7iya asaara caaqofite. <verse eid="EXO 34:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 34:13"/>Enta yarsho bessata laallite; goyinno tuussata mentherethite. Asheera geetetiya macca xoosse misile tuussata qanxerethite. <verse eid="EXO 34:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 34:14"/>Taani Goday, ta bonchuwa hara xoossatara koxonna Xoosse gidiya gisho, taape hara xoossatas goyinnofite. <verse eid="EXO 34:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 34:15"/>He biittan de7iya asatara ayba caaqoka caaqofite. Enti banta xoossata goyinniya wodenne entaw yarshiya wode, enti hintena bantara issifana mela oychiko, hinte enti banta xoossatas yarshiya kathaa maanaw paacetidi, taw ammanetona ixana. <verse eid="EXO 34:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 34:16"/>Qassi hinte enta macca naytape hinte adde naytas immiko, he wode he macca nayti banta xoossata goyinnidi, hinte adde naytika taw ammanetona ixidi, banta xoossata goyinnana mela oothana.<verse eid="EXO 34:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 34:17"/>“Biratape qoxetidi, medhetida xoossata goyinnofite.<verse eid="EXO 34:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 34:18"/>“Uythaa Ba7aale bonchite. Hinte Gibxefe keyday, Abiiba ageenan gidiya gisho, taani hintena kiitidaysada, he ageenan, laapun gallas gakanaw uythi miite.<verse eid="EXO 34:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 34:19"/>“Bayra yeletiya adde na7i ubbaynne bayra yeletiya mehe adde ubbay tabaa. <verse eid="EXO 34:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 34:20"/>Koyro yeletida hare mari dorsa marara laammada woza. Wozonna ixiko, iya morgiya mentha. Bayra yeletida adde na7a ubbaa woza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 34:20">“Oonika immiyaba oykonna mela kushe ta sinthan shiiqopo.<verse eid="EXO 34:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 34:21"/>“Usupun gallas oothite, shin laapuntha gallasan shempite. Zeriya wode gidin woyko kathaa cakiya wode laapuntha gallasan shempite.<verse eid="EXO 34:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 34:22"/>“Koyro hinte gistiya cako doomiya wode, Katha Shiisho Ba7aale bonchite. Qassi laytha wursetha kathaa shiishiya wode, Shaqara Ba7aale bonchite. <verse eid="EXO 34:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 34:23"/>Laythan heedzu toho Isra7eele adde ubbay medhetetha Godaa, Isra7eele Xoossaa goyinnanaw yo. <verse eid="EXO 34:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 34:24"/>Kawotethata taani hinte sinthafe yedetha kessada hinte zawa aassana. Hinte tana goyinnanaw laythan heedzu toho yaa wode, oonika hinte biitta olidi ekanaw amottenna.<verse eid="EXO 34:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 34:25"/>“Hinte taw mehe yarshiya wode, irsho yeggidi uukida uythara shishopitte. Paasika bonchiya gallasas yarshida yarshuwafe wontas aybaka ashshofite.<verse eid="EXO 34:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 34:26"/>“Hinte gaden bayra kaxida kathaafe koyro ayfiya Godaa hinte Xoossaa keethi ehite.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 34:26">“Deesha mari iya aaye maathan doysopite” yaagis.<verse eid="EXO 34:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 34:27"/>Goday Museko, “Taani neeranne Isra7eele asaara caaqo geley ha qaalatan gidiya gisho, ha qaalata xaafa” yaagis. <verse eid="EXO 34:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 34:28"/>Musey moonnanne uyonna, oytamu gallasinne oytamu qamma Godaara zuma bolla gam7is. I, caaqo qaala gelida tammu kiitata loche shuchatan xaafis.<verse eid="EXO 34:28"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Musey Siina Zumaape Wodhetha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 34:29"/>Musey Godaara odetishe gam7idi, tammu kiitata oykida nam7u loche shuchata ekidi Siina Zumaape wodhiya wode iya som7oy phoolees, shin I hessa eribeenna. <verse eid="EXO 34:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 34:30"/>Aaroninne Isra7eele asa ubbay Muse xeellidi, iya som7oy phooleysa be7idi, iyako shiiqanaw yayyidosona. <verse eid="EXO 34:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 34:31"/>Shin Musey enta xeegis. Aaroninne Isra7eele halaqati ubbay iyako shiiqin, I enta odisis. <verse eid="EXO 34:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 34:32"/>Hessafe guye, Isra7eele asa ubbay iyako shiiqin, Goday iyaw Siina zuma bola immida kiita ubbaa I entaw immis.<verse eid="EXO 34:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 34:33"/>Musey entara odeteysa wursida wode ba som7uwa laxanan kammis. <verse eid="EXO 34:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 34:34"/>Shin Musey Godaa sinthe, iyara odetanaw geliya wode laxana ba som7uwafe qaarees. Yaape keyiya wode, Goday iya kiittidaba ubbaa Isra7eele asaas odees. <verse eid="EXO 34:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 34:35"/>He ubban enti iya som7oy phooleysa be7oosona. Hessa gisho, Musey Godaara odetanaw baana gakanaw, ba som7uwa laxanan kammees.<verse eid="EXO 34:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 34"/>
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="EXO 35"/>
  <para style="s1">Sambaata Boncho Woga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 35:1"/>Musey Isra7eele asaa ubbaa xeegidi, “Hinte oothana mela Goday kiittidabay haysa; <verse eid="EXO 35:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 35:2"/>Saaminta giddon usupun gallasa xalaalan ooso oothite; shin laapuntha gallasay hintew geeshsha gallas; Godaaska dummatida shempo Sambaata. He gallasan ooso oothiya oonika hayqanaw bessees. <verse eid="EXO 35:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 35:3"/>Sambaata gallas hinte son tama eethofite” yaagis.<verse eid="EXO 35:3"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Geeshsha Dunkaaniyas Imetida Imuwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 35:4"/>Musey Isra7eele asaako, “Goday haysada yaagidi hintena kiittis; <verse eid="EXO 35:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 35:5"/>Godaas hinte wozanay immo giyaba immanaw ehite. Hinte immanaw ehiyabati worqaa, bira, naase birata, <verse eid="EXO 35:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 35:6"/>kaalose qacina, ocha teera daaniya qacina, zo7o qacinanne al7o liino, deesha ikise, <verse eid="EXO 35:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 35:7"/>zo7o qalamen yeggi kessida dorsa ite, lo77o do7a ite, soqala mithi, <verse eid="EXO 35:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 35:8"/>xompes shamaho zayte, shuumatetha zayte, iyan yegetiya sawuwanne ixaane sawo, <verse eid="EXO 35:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 35:9"/>efuudiyasinne tiran ma7etiya ma7uwas haniya margide geetetiya shuchaanne hara alleeqota eho.<verse eid="EXO 35:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Geeshsha Dunkaanen Go7etiya Miisheta</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 39:32-43">Kessa 39:32-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 35:10"/>“Hinte giddon de7iya kushe hiillancho ubbay yidi, Goday kiitidaysa ubbaa ootho. <verse eid="EXO 35:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 35:11"/>Geeshsha Dunkaaniya, iya gaatha kamaanne kare kamaa, kaqota, tuuqeta, liyoota, tuussatanne enti eqiya tohota; <verse eid="EXO 35:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 35:12"/>Taabotiyanne iya tookiya kaso mithata, nagara atotetha kamaanne Taabotiya genthiya magarajuwa; <verse eid="EXO 35:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 35:13"/>xarpheezaa, iya tookiya kaso mithatanne, iya miisheta ubbaanne Godaa sinthan wothiya geeshsha uythaa; <verse eid="EXO 35:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 35:14"/>xompe wothiya kocaa, iya miisheta, xompiyanne xompe zaytiya; <verse eid="EXO 35:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 35:15"/>ixaane cuyisiya xarpheezanne iya tookiya kasota, shuumatetha zaytiyanne sawiya ixaane, Geeshsha Dunkaaniya penge magarajuwa; <verse eid="EXO 35:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 35:16"/>xuussa yarsho bessinne iya naase birata zarzariya, iya tookiya kasotanne iya miisheta ubbaa, naase biratape oosetida meecha keriyanne iya tohuwa; <verse eid="EXO 35:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 35:17"/>dabaaba godaa gesheta, tuussatanne enta tohota, dabaaba penge magarajuwa, <verse eid="EXO 35:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 35:18"/>Geeshsha Dunkaaniyanne dabaaba dunkaaniya tole dhishetanne enta wodorota; <verse eid="EXO 35:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 35:19"/>Aaroninne iya nayti Geeshsha bessan haggaazishe ma7anaw alleeqetidi oosetida boncho ma7ota ootho” yaagis.<verse eid="EXO 35:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Asay Ehida Imuwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 35:20"/>Hessafe guye, Isra7eele asa ubbay Muse sinthafe keyidosona. <verse eid="EXO 35:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 35:21"/>Asa ubbay ba wozanan immo immo gidaba Geeshsha Dunkaaniyas, iya giddon oosetiya ooso ubbaasinne boncho kahine ma7otas koshshiyaba ubbaa ehidosona. <verse eid="EXO 35:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 35:22"/>Immanaw koyida macci adde ubbay worqa alleeqota, siidhe worqata, migidota, qoodhe worqa ehidi, Godaas imo oothidi immidosona. <verse eid="EXO 35:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 35:23"/>Kaalose qacina, ocha teera daaniya qacina, zo7o qacina, al7o liino, woyko deesha ikise, woyko zo7o qalamen yeggi kessida dorsa ite woyko, lo77o do7a itey de7iya asi ubbay ehis. <verse eid="EXO 35:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 35:24"/>Bira woyko naase birata immanaw danda7iya ubbay banta imota Godaas immidosona. Qassi soqala mithi de7iya asi ubbay dumma dumma oosuwas ehis.<verse eid="EXO 35:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 35:25"/>Kushe hiilla maccasa ubbay banta kushen suqida kaalose qacina, ocha teera daaniya qacina, zo7o qacinanne al7o liino ehidosona. <verse eid="EXO 35:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 35:26"/>Qassika imota immanaw koyida maccasa ubbay deesha itepe dooqetida wodoro ehidosona. <verse eid="EXO 35:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 35:27"/>Halaqati efuudiyasinne tiran ma7etiya ma7uwas haniya margidenne hara lo77o shuchata, <verse eid="EXO 35:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 35:28"/>qassika enti ixaanen, shuumatethasinne xompes maaddiya shamaho zayten yegetiya sawo ehidosona. <verse eid="EXO 35:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 35:29"/>Isra7eele asa ubbay, oothana mela Goday Muse baggara kiitida oosuwas haniya imotata ubbaa banta dosan Godaas ehidosona.<verse eid="EXO 35:29"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kushe Hiillanchota</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 35:30"/>Musey Isra7eele asaako haysada yaagis; “Goday Yihuda sheeshape gidida Huura na7aa na7aa, Ure na7aa, Basili7eela dooris. <verse eid="EXO 35:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 35:31"/>Goday iya ba Ayyaanan, hiillan, akeekaninne ooso ubbaa oothiya eran kunthis. <verse eid="EXO 35:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 35:32"/>Hessika, hiillan oothana oosota halchidi worqafe, birapenne naase biratape dumma dummaba kessidi oothanaasa. <verse eid="EXO 35:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 35:33"/>Hessadaka, al7o shuchu massidi giigiso, mithi masethinne hara ooso ubbaa oothana mela cincatethi immis. <verse eid="EXO 35:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 35:34"/>Qassi iyasinne Daane sheeshi gidida Ahisamaaka na7aa Eliyaabas, banta hiilla harata tamaarsana mela eratethi immis <verse eid="EXO 35:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 35:35"/>Enti dumma dumma ooso oothana mela ooso halcho kessana mela, kaalosen, ocha teera daaneysaninne zo7o suufe qacinan al7o liino alleeqisidi, daddiya hiillatethi immis. Goday enta, eratethan kunthis. Enti ubbay dumma dumma ooson luxida hiillancho gididosona.<verse eid="EXO 35:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 35"/>
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="EXO 36"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 36:1"/>“Hessa gisho, Basili7eeli, Eliyaabinne Geeshsha Dunkaaniya keexana mela Goday hiillanne eratethi immida asa ubbay, Goday kiitidaysada ubbaba oothana” yaagis.<verse eid="EXO 36:1"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Imuwa Darotethaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 36:2"/>Musey Basili7eela, Eliyaaba, Goday dumma eratethi immidaysatanne ooso oothanaw koyiya ubbaa xeegidi, oosuwa doomana mela kiittis. <verse eid="EXO 36:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 36:3"/>Enti, Isra7eele asay Geeshsha Dunkaaniya oothanaw ehida imo ubbaa Muse kushepe ekidosona. Qassi asay ba dosan immiya imota wonta wonta ehuwa aggibokona. <verse eid="EXO 36:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 36:4"/>Yaatin, Geeshsha Dunkaaniya oothiya hiillanchoti banta oosuwa essidi, museko bidi, <verse eid="EXO 36:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 36:5"/>“Asay, Goday kiitida oosuwas koshsheysafe aathidi eho bolla de7oosona” yaagidosona.<verse eid="EXO 36:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 36:6"/>Musey, “Geeshsha Dunkaaniya keexanaw oonika immiyaba ehopo” yaagidi kiittin, asay eheysa aggaagidosona. <verse eid="EXO 36:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 36:7"/>Enti ehida imotay ooso ubbaa oothi polanaw gididi palahees.<verse eid="EXO 36:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Geeshsha Dunkaane Oosuwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 26:1-37">Kessa 26:1-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 36:8"/>Oosuwa ootheysatape hiillan aadheysati Geeshsha Dunkaaniya oothidosona. Enti iya al7o liinope, kaalosen ocha teera daaneysaninne zo7o qacinan alleeqisidi daddida tammu gesheta giigisidi, iya bolla kiruubeta misiliya sikidosona. <verse eid="EXO 36:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 36:9"/>Magarajoti ubbay issi gina gididi, adussatethay laatamanne oyddu wadha, gompay oyddu wadha. <verse eid="EXO 36:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 36:10"/>Ichashu gesheta issife gathidi sikidosona; qassi hanko attida ichashu geshetaka hessada oothidosona. <verse eid="EXO 36:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 36:11"/>Issife gathidi sikida geshetape issi magarajuwas wursetha gaxan kaalose afilape oosetida sagaayota medhidosona. Qassi issife gathidi sikida hanko geshetape issuwa gaxanka hessada oothidosona. <verse eid="EXO 36:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 36:12"/>Enti issife siketida koyro magarajuwa bolla koyro maaran kaalose afilape oosetida ishatamu sagaayota, hessadaka nam7antho magarajuwa bolla wursetha maaran, hanko sagaayota ginan, ishatamu sagaayota oothidosona. <verse eid="EXO 36:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 36:13"/>Enti nam7u baggan de7iya gesheta gasethidi issino oothanaw worqafe ishatamu oykiya bessata medhidosona.<verse eid="EXO 36:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 36:14"/>Geeshsha Dunkaaniya bollara kammanaw tammanne issi gesheta deesha ikisepe daddidosona. <verse eid="EXO 36:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 36:15"/>Tammanne issi gesheta adussatethaa laatamanne usupun wadha, gompaa oyddu wadha oothidi medhidosona. <verse eid="EXO 36:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 36:16"/>Ichashu gesheta issi baggara, qassi usupun gesheta hanko baggara gathidi sikidosona. <verse eid="EXO 36:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 36:17"/>Woli gathidi sikida geshetape wursetha magarajuwa macaran ishatamu sagaayota, qassi woli gathidi sikida hanko geshetape wursetha magarajuwa macaran ishatamu sagaayota medhidosona. <verse eid="EXO 36:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 36:18"/>Nam7u baggara de7iya gesheta gasethidi issi kama oothanaw naase biratape ishatamu oykiya bessata medhidosona. <verse eid="EXO 36:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 36:19"/>Dunkaaniya kammanaw zo7o qalamen yeggi kessida dorsa ite, qassi iya bollara kammanaw lo77o do7a ite giigisidosona.<verse eid="EXO 36:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 36:20"/>Geeshsha Dunkaaniya tuuqeta soqala mithafe kessidosona. <verse eid="EXO 36:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 36:21"/>Issi issi tuuqiya adussatethay tammu wadha, gompay issi wadhanne takadho. <verse eid="EXO 36:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 36:22"/>Issi tuuqiya issuwara gasethanaw nam7u luhoti de7oosona. Geeshsha Dunkaaniya tuuqeta ubbaa hessada oothidosona. <verse eid="EXO 36:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 36:23"/>Geeshsha Dunkaaniyas dugeha baggara laatamu tuuqeta medhidosona. <verse eid="EXO 36:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 36:24"/>Issi issi tuuqetas nam7u toho medhidi, he tohota oythanaw oytamu luhota biratape giigisidosona. <verse eid="EXO 36:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 36:25"/>Geeshsha Dunkaaniyas pudeha baggara laatamu tuuqeta medhidosona. <verse eid="EXO 36:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 36:26"/>Issi issi tuuqetas nam7u toho medhidi, he tohota oythanaw oytamu luhota biratape giigisidosona. <verse eid="EXO 36:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 36:27"/>Geeshsha Dunkaaniyas guye baggan, wuloha baggara usupun tuuqeta medhidosona. <verse eid="EXO 36:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 36:28"/>Geeshsha Dunkaaniya guye baggan de7iya maazanetas nam7u tuuqeta giigisidosona. <verse eid="EXO 36:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 36:29"/>He nam7u maazane tuuqeti xaphope xeera gakanaw oyketi bidosona. Nam7u maazaniyan de7iya nam7u tuuqeti hessada hanidi oosetidosona. <verse eid="EXO 36:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 36:30"/>Hessa gisho, issi issi tuuqiyas garsan nam7u nam7u tohoti de7oosona. Hospun tuuqetas biratape oosetida tammanne usupun tohoti de7oosona.<verse eid="EXO 36:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 36:31"/>Qassi enti soqala mithafe tammanne ichashu liyoota kessidosona. Ichashu liyooti Geeshsha Dunkaaniya issi bagga miyen, <verse eid="EXO 36:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 36:32"/>qassi ichashu liyoota hanko bagga miyen, hessadaka ichashu liyoota guye baggara wuloha baggan wothidosona. <verse eid="EXO 36:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 36:33"/>Tuuqetas miye baggara giddon de7iya liyoy, ha gaxape ya gaxa gakanaw kanthi keyana mela oothidosona. <verse eid="EXO 36:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 36:34"/>Tuuqetanne liyoota worqan lanxidosona. Liyooti enta giddora kanthi aadhana mela worqa sagaayota tuuqetara oysethidosona.<verse eid="EXO 36:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 36:35"/>Magarajuwa al7o liinope kaalosen, ocha teera daaneysaninne, zo7o qacinan alleeqisidi oothidosona. He magarajuwa bolla kiruube misileta sikidosona. <verse eid="EXO 36:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 36:36"/>Magarajuwa kaqanaw oyddu tuussata soqala mithafe giigisidi, worqan lanxidosona. Yaatidi worqa sagaayota entas giigisidosona. Qassi tuussata essiya oyddu tohota bira biratape medhidosona. <verse eid="EXO 36:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 36:37"/>Geeshsha Dunkaaniya pengiyas al7o liinope kaalosen, ocha teera daaneysafenne zo7o qacinan alleeqisid magarajo giigisidosona. <verse eid="EXO 36:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EXO 36:38"/>Qassi iyaw kocati de7iya ichashu tuussata medhidi, entaw xeeranne tohuwa worqan lanxidosona. Tuussatas naase biratappe oosetidi ichashu tohota giigisidosona.<verse eid="EXO 36:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 36"/>
  <chapter number="37" style="c" sid="EXO 37"/>
  <para style="s1">Taabote</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 25:10-22">Kessa 25:10-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 37:1"/>Basili7eeli Taabotiya soqala mithafe giigisis. Taabotiya adussatethay nam7u wadhanne bagga, gompaynne geesay issi wadhanne bagga. <verse eid="EXO 37:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 37:2"/>Taabotiya giigisidi, gaathaanne kariya walahi bayna worqan lanxis. Iya yuushuwa bollaka worqan lanxis. <verse eid="EXO 37:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 37:3"/>Oyddu worqa sagaayota Taabotiyas oyddu gedata bolla, issi baggara nam7u sagaayota, qassi hanko baggara nam7u sagaayota aathis. <verse eid="EXO 37:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 37:4"/>Yaatidi soqala mithafe oosetida kasota kessidi enta worqan lanxis. <verse eid="EXO 37:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 37:5"/>Taabotiya tookanaw, Taabotiyas miyiyan de7iya sagaayotan kasota aathis.<verse eid="EXO 37:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 37:6"/>Walahi bayna worqafe, adussatethay nam7u wadhanne bagga, gompay issi wadhanne bagga gidida nagara atotetha kamaa oothis. <verse eid="EXO 37:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 37:7"/>Qefey de7iya nam7u kiruubeta qoxetida worqafe oothidi, <verse eid="EXO 37:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 37:8"/>issi kiruubiya issi baggan, hanko kiruubiya hanko baggan wothidi, atotetha kamuwara issino oothidi medhis. <verse eid="EXO 37:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 37:9"/>Kiruubeti banta qefiya miccidi, atotetha kamuwa kammidi, issoy issuwa xeelloosona.<verse eid="EXO 37:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Daabbo Xarpheeza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 25:23-30">Kessa 25:23-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 37:10"/>Adussatethay nam7u wadha, gompay issi wadha, geesay issi wadhanne bagga gidida xarpheezaa soqala mithafe medhis. <verse eid="EXO 37:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 37:11"/>Walahi bayna worqan iya lanxidi, yuushuwaka worqan lanxis. <verse eid="EXO 37:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 37:12"/>Hessadaka, gompay takadho gidiya goosse oothidi, iya worqan yuushshi aathidi lanxis. <verse eid="EXO 37:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 37:13"/>Taabotiya tookanaw maaddiya oyddu worqa sagaayota medhidi, oyddu gedata oyddu maazaneta bolla wothis. <verse eid="EXO 37:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 37:14"/>Xarpheeza tookanaw kasota aathiya sagaayoti xarpheezaa goossa matan oosetidosona. <verse eid="EXO 37:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 37:15"/>Xarpheezaa tookiya kaso mithata soqala mithafe kessidi, worqan lanxis. <verse eid="EXO 37:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 37:16"/>Hessadaka, xarpheezaa bolla wothiya dumma dumma miisheta walahi bayna worqafe medhis. Hessatika saaneta, cilpata, kereta, woyne yarshsho tigiya xuu7ata.<verse eid="EXO 37:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Xompe Wothiya Kocaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 25:1-40">Kessa 25:1-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 37:17"/>Hessafe guye, Basili7eeli xompe wothiya kocaa walahi bayna worqafe oothis. Kocaa essiya tohuwanne tooma qoxetida worqafe giigisis. Alleeqos oosetiya, iya gambuthata, iya wallaxatanne iya ciishshata ubbaa iyara issife oythidi medhis. <verse eid="EXO 37:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 37:18"/>Issi baggara heedzu tasheti, qassi hanko baggara heedzu tasheti de7iya usupun tasheta iya miyiyan medhis. <verse eid="EXO 37:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 37:19"/>Usupun tashetas xeeran xeeran heedzu heedzu alleeqo gambuthatinne ciishshati de7iya lawuze mitha ciishshe daaniyaba medhis. <verse eid="EXO 37:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 37:20"/>Xompe wothiya kocaa giddon de7iya tooma xeeran oyddu alleeqo gambuthatinne ciishshati de7iya lawuze mitha ciishshe daaniyaba medhis. <verse eid="EXO 37:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 37:21"/>Waathan de7iya heedzu heedzu tashetape garsan issi issi gambuthi oosetis. <verse eid="EXO 37:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 37:22"/>Gambuthati, tashetinne xompe wothiya kocay issino gididi, walahi bayna worqafe qoxetidi oosetidosona.<verse eid="EXO 37:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 37:23"/>Xompe wothiya kocaas laapun xompeta, xompe toysiya qaphetanne enta wothiyabata walahi bayna worqafe oothis. <verse eid="EXO 37:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 37:24"/>Xompe wothiya kocaanne iyaw go7etiya miishe ubbaa oothanaw hastamanne ichashu kilo giraame gidiya, walahi bayna worqa ongis.<verse eid="EXO 37:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ixaane xarpheeza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 30:1-5">Kessa 30:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 37:25"/>Basili7eeli ixaane cuyisiya xarpheeza soqala mithafe giigisis. Iyaw oyddu maazaney de7ees. He xarpheezas adussatethaynne gompay issi wadha; qassi geesay nam7u wadha. Oyddu maazaniyan de7iya kaceti iyara issino gidi oyketidi oosetidosona. <verse eid="EXO 37:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 37:26"/>Iyaw bolla bagga, oyddu miyanne kaceta walahi bayna worqan lanxis, iya yuushuwaka worqan lanxidi yuushshi aathis. <verse eid="EXO 37:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 37:27"/>Iyaw gaxa bolla tookanaw maaddiya nam7u worqa sagaayota medhidi, nam7u bagga miyiyan wothis. Enti ixaane xarpheezaa tookiya wode kaso mithata aathanaw maaddeyisata. <verse eid="EXO 37:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 37:28"/>Kaso mithata soqala mithafe kessidi, worqan lanxis.<verse eid="EXO 37:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 37:29"/>Geeshsha shuumatetha zaytiyanne sawiya lo77o ixaane shittoda walakidi oothis.<verse eid="EXO 37:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 37"/>
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="EXO 38"/>
  <para style="s1">Xuussa Yarsho Bessi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 38:1"/>Soqala mithafe xuussa yarsho bessi oothis. He yarsho bessa adussatethaynne gompay, ichashu ichashu wadha, qassi geesay nam7u wadhanne takadho. Iyaw oyddu maazaney de7ees. <verse eid="EXO 38:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 38:2"/>Oyddu maazanetara oyketidi oosetida kaceta medhis. Yaatidi, he yarsho bessa naase biratan lanxis. <verse eid="EXO 38:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 38:3"/>He yarsho bessan go7etiya miisheta, disteta, baldeta, akaafata, ashuwa qaphiya qaphetanne tama cooceta ubbaa naase biratape medhis. <verse eid="EXO 38:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 38:4"/>Naase biratape gite daaniya teqe yarsho bessaas giigisidi, yarsho bessaas giddo zawa yuushshi aathidi wothis. <verse eid="EXO 38:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 38:5"/>Tookanaw maaddiya kasota aathanaw, oyddu sagaayota medhidi, oyddu maazaneta bolla wothis. <verse eid="EXO 38:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 38:6"/>Soqala mithafe yarsho bessa tookiya kaso mithata kessidi, naase biratan lanxis. <verse eid="EXO 38:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 38:7"/>Ha kasota nam7u miyen de7iya sagaayotan aathis. Yarsho bessaa xawulape giigisidi, gidduwa kaysi oothis.<verse eid="EXO 38:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Meecha Kere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 38:8"/>Naase biratape meecha kerenne iya wothiya toho medhis. He naase biratay, Geeshsha Dunkaaniya pengen oothiya maccasati ehida mastootiyape eketis.<verse eid="EXO 38:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Geeshsha Dunkaane Dabaaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 38:9"/>Geeshsha Dunkaaniyas dabaaba baggaa gechanaw al7o liinope magarajo oothis. Dugeha bagga geshetas adussatethay xeetu wadha. <verse eid="EXO 38:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 38:10"/>Geshetas kate gidana mela laatamu tuussatanne enti eqiya tohota naase biratape oothis. Enta xam7atanne kaceta bira biratape oothis. <verse eid="EXO 38:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 38:11"/>Pudeha bagga dabaabayka hessada hanidi oosetis. <verse eid="EXO 38:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 38:12"/>Wuloha bagga gesheta adussatethay ishatamu wadha. Entaw tammu tuussatinne tuussati eqiya tammu tohoti de7oosona. Tuussatas bira biratape oosetida xam7atinne kaceti de7oosona. <verse eid="EXO 38:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 38:13"/>Dabaaba geliya pengey de7iya, doloha bagga magarajuwa gompay ishatamu wadha. <verse eid="EXO 38:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 38:14"/>Issi baggara de7iya magarajuwa adussatethay tammanne ichashu wadha. Iyaw heedzu tuussatinne tuussati eqiya tohoti de7oosona. <verse eid="EXO 38:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 38:15"/>Hanko baggara de7iya magarajuwa adussatethay tammanne ichashu wadha. Iyaw heedzu tuussatinne tuussati eqiya tohoti de7oosona. <verse eid="EXO 38:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 38:16"/>Dabaaba yuushuwan de7iya gesheti ubbay al7o liinope oosetidosona. <verse eid="EXO 38:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 38:17"/>Tuussati eqiya tohoti naase biratape oosetidosona. Xam7ati, kacetinne tuussata xeera goossati bira biratape oosetidosona. Dabaaba yuushuwan de7iya tuussati ubbay bira xam7atan oyketidosona. <verse eid="EXO 38:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 38:18"/>Dabaaba pengiyan de7iya magarajuwa al7o liinope oothidi, kaalosen ocha teera daaneysaninne zo7o qacinan daddidi alleeqisis. Iyaw hanko dabaaba geshetada adussatethay laatamu wadha; qassi geesay ichashu wadha. <verse eid="EXO 38:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 38:19"/>Iya, oyddu tohoti de7iya oyddu tuussata bolla kaqis. Kaceti, xaara kammeysatinne xam7ati bira biratape oosetidosona. <verse eid="EXO 38:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 38:20"/>Geeshsha Dunkaaniya dhishetinne iya yuushuwan de7iya gesheta dhisheti ubbay naase biratape oosetidosona.<verse eid="EXO 38:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Geeshsha Dunkaanen Go7etiya Birata Miisheta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 38:21"/>Tammu kiitata oykida nam7u loche shuchati de7iya bessan, Geeshsha Dunkaaniyan, go7etiya miisheta mazgabey haysa. He miisheta mazgabana mela kahiniya Aarona na7a Itamaara aawatetha garsan de7iya Leeweta Musey kiittis.<verse eid="EXO 38:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 38:22"/>Yihuda sheeshape gidida Huura na7aa na7aa, Ure na7aa, Basili7eeli, Goday kiitidaysada ubbaba oothis. <verse eid="EXO 38:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 38:23"/>Daane sheeshape gidida Ahisamaaka na7aa Eliyaabi, kushe hiillanchoy, oothiyabas koyro halcho kessiya asi; I, kaalose, ocha teera daaneysanne zo7o qacinan al7o liino daddidi alleeqisiya asi. <verse eid="EXO 38:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 38:24"/>Geeshsha dunkaaniya oosuwas hanana mela Godaas imetida worqay geeshsha dunkaanen eretida mizaanen issi mukulu kilo giraame gidis. <verse eid="EXO 38:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 38:25"/>Taybon de7iya asaape eketida biray geeshsha dunkaanen eretida mizaanen, heedzu mukulunne oyddu xeetanne hastamu kilo giraame gidis. <verse eid="EXO 38:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 38:26"/>Hessika, taybon gelida adde asay, issoy issoy geeshsha dunkaanen eretida mizaaniya liken koyetiya ubbaa immidosona. Laatamu laythinne iyape bolla gidida, mazgaben gelida, adde asaa tayboy usupun xeetanne heedzu mukulunne ichashu xeetanne ishatama. <verse eid="EXO 38:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 38:27"/>Geeshsha Dunkaaniyanne magarajota essanaw maaddiya xeetu tohota oothanaw 3,400 kilo giraame bira birata ekidosona. Hessika, issi issi tohoy hastamanne oyddu kilo giraame bira birata ekis. <verse eid="EXO 38:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 38:28"/>Basili7eeli, attida hastamu kilo giraame bira biratan xam7ata, kacetanne tuussatas xeera goossata oothis. <verse eid="EXO 38:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 38:29"/>Asay Godaas immida naase biratay 2,425 kilo giraame. <verse eid="EXO 38:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 38:30"/>He naase biratan Geeshsha Dunkaaniya pengiya essiya tohota, gite daaniyabara naase birata yarsho bessaanne iya giddon go7etiya dumma dumma miisheta medhis. <verse eid="EXO 38:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 38:31"/>Qassi dabaaba yuushuwan de7iya dirsaa tohotinne pengiya bolla eqida tohoti, Geeshsha Dunkaaneynne iya yuushuwan de7iya dabaaba dirsaa dhisheti ubbay he naase biratape oosetidosona.<verse eid="EXO 38:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 38"/>
  <chapter number="39" style="c" sid="EXO 39"/>
  <para style="s1">Kahineta Ma7o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 28:1-14">Kessa 28:1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 39:1"/>Kahineti Geeshsha Dunkaaniyan oothiya wode ma7ana boncho ma7ota, kaalosen, ocha teera daaniya qacinapenne zo7o qacinan daddidosona. Aaroni ma7iya kahinetetha ma7uwa Goday Muse kiitidaysada oothidosona.<verse eid="EXO 39:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 39:2"/>Qassi efuudiya, worqafe, kaalosepe, ocha teera daaniya qacinape, zo7o qacinapenne al7o liinope daddidosona. <verse eid="EXO 39:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 39:3"/>Enti worqaa qoxidi, lee7isidi, iya qaraaridi, qacinada kessidosona. Yaatidi kaalosen, ocha teera daaneysan, zo7o qacinaninne al7o liinon alleeqisidi daddidosona. <verse eid="EXO 39:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 39:4"/>Enti nam7u hashiyara wodhidi, nam7u bagga woli gathidi oysethanaw maaddiya qangota efuudiyas oothidosona. <verse eid="EXO 39:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 39:5"/>Goday Muse kiitidaysada, hiillanchoy alleeqisida dancoyka efuudey oosetidaysatape oosetidi, worqan, kaalosen, ocha teera daaneysan, zo7o qacinaninne al7o liinon dadetis. <verse eid="EXO 39:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 39:6"/>Enti margide geetetiya shuchata giigisidi, worqafe oosetida kaquwa bolla wothidosona. Maatame bolla woocidi xaafeysada, he shuchata bolla Isra7eele nayta sunthaa woocidi xaafidosona. <verse eid="EXO 39:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 39:7"/>Goday Muse kiitidaysada, tammanne nam7u Isra7eele nayta qofisiyaba gidana mela enta, efuudiya qangotan wothidosona.<verse eid="EXO 39:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Tiran Ma7etiya Ma7o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 28:15-30">Kessa 28:15-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 39:8"/>Enti, tiran ma7etiya ma7uwa efuudey oosetidaysatape oothidi, efuudiyada alleeqisidosona. <verse eid="EXO 39:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 39:9"/>Iyaw oyddu maazaneti de7oosona; geesaynne gompay issi issi takadho gididi, dakoyetees. <verse eid="EXO 39:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 39:10"/>Iya bolla oyddu maaran inqo geetetiya al7o shuchata wothidosona. Koyro maaran sardiyoone, toophazenne phooliya al7o shuchata; <verse eid="EXO 39:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 39:11"/>nam7antho maaran baluure, sanparenne almaaze geetetiya al7o shuchata; <verse eid="EXO 39:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 39:12"/>heedzantho maaran yaakinte, kelqedoonenne ametesxinoosa geetetiya al7o shuchata; <verse eid="EXO 39:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 39:13"/>oyddantho maaran birille, margidenne yasphide geetetiya al7o shuchata wothidosona. Hessata ubbaa worqafe oosetida kaquwa bolla wothidosona. <verse eid="EXO 39:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 39:14"/>Tammanne nam7u shuchata bolla issi issi Isra7eele nayta sunthay woocetidi xaafetis.<verse eid="EXO 39:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 39:15"/>Tiran ma7etiya ma7uwas walahi bayna worqafe wodoroda dooqada santhalaata ootha. <verse eid="EXO 39:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 39:16"/>Nam7u worqa kaqotanne nam7u worqa sagaayota medhidi, nam7u worqa sagaayota tiran ma7etiya ma7uwas qommo baggan de7iya maazanetara gathidi oysethidosona. <verse eid="EXO 39:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 39:17"/>He nam7u worqa santhalaatata nam7u worqa sagaayotara gathidi oysethidosona. <verse eid="EXO 39:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 39:18"/>He santhalaatata, hanko bagga xeeraa, nam7u kaqotara gasethidosona. Yaatidi, efuudiyas sintha baggara, hashiyara wodhiya qangotara gathidi qachidosona. <verse eid="EXO 39:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 39:19"/>Qassi nam7u worqa sagaayota medhidi, efuudiyas sintha baggara de7iya tiran ma7etiya ma7uwas, gaatha baggara de7iya nam7u maazaneta xeeran aathidosona. <verse eid="EXO 39:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 39:20"/>Hessadaka, worqafe hara nam7u migiddota oothada, efuudiyas sintha bagga hashiyara wodhiya qanguwas garsa baggara, sikuwa matan dancuwaafe qommo baggara oysethidosona. <verse eid="EXO 39:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 39:21"/>Goday Muse kiitidaysada, tiran ma7etiya ma7uwa bolla de7iya migiddota efuudiyan de7iya migiddotara gathidi, kaalose qacina qachidosona. Tiran ma7etiya ma7oy xeessafe qommon pee7iya gisho qashoy dol7enna.<verse eid="EXO 39:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Hara Kahine Ma7ota</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 28:31-43">Kessa 28:31-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 39:22"/>Efuudiyape bollara ma7etiya adussa ma7oy kumethi kaalose afilape giigisidosona. <verse eid="EXO 39:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 39:23"/>He adussa ma7uwas huuphe aathiya luho medhidi, peedhetonna mela guye qalam7idi, yuushshi aathidi sikidosona. <verse eid="EXO 39:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 39:24"/>Adussa ma7uwas duge bagga macara yuushuwan kaalosen, ocha teera daaniya zo7o qacinaninne al7o liinon, oromaane teera misileta medhidosona. <verse eid="EXO 39:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 39:25"/>Enti walahi bayna worqafe daalata medhidi, adussa ma7uwas duge bagga gaxan, oromaane misileta giddon wothidosona. <verse eid="EXO 39:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 39:26"/>Goday Muse kiitidaysada, oromaane teera misileta, adussa ma7uwas duge bagga macaraa yuushuwan aathidosona.<verse eid="EXO 39:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 39:27"/>Enti, Goday Muse kiitidaysada, Aaronasinne iya naytas, shamizeta, <verse eid="EXO 39:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 39:28"/>huuphe qaceta, uketanne gaatha sureta al7o liinope daddidi giigisidosona. <verse eid="EXO 39:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 39:29"/>Qassi dancuwa kaalosen, ocha teera daaniya qacinan, zo7o qacinaninne al7o liinon alleeqisidi, giigisidosona.<verse eid="EXO 39:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 39:30"/>Enti, geeshsha kallacha misiliya walahi bayna worqafe medhidi, iya bolla, “Godaas Dummatis” giya qaala woocidi xaafidosona. <verse eid="EXO 39:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 39:31"/>Yaatidi, Goday Muse kiitidaysada, huuphe qaciya bolla kaalose qacinara qachidosona.<verse eid="EXO 39:31"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Oosoy Gaxa Gaketha</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 35:10-19">Kessa 35:10-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 39:32"/>Geeshsha Dunkaaniya ooso ubbay kumethi poletis. Isra7eele asay, Goday Muse kiitidaysada oothidosona. <verse eid="EXO 39:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 39:33"/>Hessafe guye, enti Geeshsha Dunkaaniyanne iya miisheta Museko ehidosona. Hessatika, kaceta, tuussata, liyoota, tuuqetanne enti eqiya tohota. <verse eid="EXO 39:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 39:34"/>Bolla kamaas, zo7o qalamen yeggidi kessida dorsa ite, haashetida do7a ite, magarajuwa, <verse eid="EXO 39:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 39:35"/>Tammu kiitata oykida Taabotiya, iya tookiya kaso mithatanne nagara atotetha kamaa, <verse eid="EXO 39:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 39:36"/>xarpheezanne iya miisheta ubbaa, Godaa sinthan de7iya geeshsha daabbuwa, <verse eid="EXO 39:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 39:37"/>walahi bayna worqafe oosetida xompe wothiya kocaa, iya bolla de7iya xompeta, iya miisheta ubbaanne xompe zayte, <verse eid="EXO 39:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EXO 39:38"/>worqafe oosetida yarsho bessi, shuumatetha zayte, sawiya ixaane, Geeshsha Dunkaaniya penge magarajuwa, <verse eid="EXO 39:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="EXO 39:39"/>naase biratape oosetida yarsho bessi, naase birata teqiya, tooho kaso mithatanne iya miisheta ubbaa, meecha kerenne iya wotheysa, <verse eid="EXO 39:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="EXO 39:40"/>dabaaba geliya penge magarajuwa, tuussatanne, enti eqiya tohota, dabaaba magarajuwa, tole wodorota, dhisheta, Geeshsha Dunkaaniyan go7etiya miisheta ubbaa, <verse eid="EXO 39:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="EXO 39:41"/>kahineti Geeshsha bessan ma7iya boncho ma7ota, Aaroninne iya nayti ma7iya kahinetetha ma7ota.<verse eid="EXO 39:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="EXO 39:42"/>Isra7eele asay ooso ubbaa, Goday Muse kiitidaysada oothidosona. <verse eid="EXO 39:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="EXO 39:43"/>Asay, ooso ubbaa, Goday kiitidaysada oothidaysa Musey be7is. Hessa gisho, Musey enta anjis.<verse eid="EXO 39:43"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 39"/>
  <chapter number="40" style="c" sid="EXO 40"/>
  <para style="s1">Geeshsha Dunkaane Tokethi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 40:1"/>Goday Museko haysada yaagis; <verse eid="EXO 40:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 40:2"/>“Koyro ageenan, koyro gallasan, Geeshsha Dunkaaniya toka. <verse eid="EXO 40:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 40:3"/>Tammu kiitata oykida Caaqo Taabotiya iya giddon wothada, iya sinthan magarajuwa kaqa. <verse eid="EXO 40:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 40:4"/>Xarpheezaa gaathi gelsada, koshshiya miisheta ubbaa iya bolla wotha. Xompe wothiya kocaa gelsada iya bolla xompeta wotha. <verse eid="EXO 40:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 40:5"/>Ixaane cuyisiya worqa xarpheezaa Caaqo Taabotiya sinthan wotha. Geeshsha Dunkaaniya penge magarajuwa kaqa. <verse eid="EXO 40:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 40:6"/>Xuugetiya yarsho bessi Geeshsha Dunkaaniya sinthan wotha. <verse eid="EXO 40:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 40:7"/>Meecha keriya Geeshsha Dunkaaniyapenne yarsho bessaafe giddon wothada, iyan haathe kuntha. <verse eid="EXO 40:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 40:8"/>Geeshsha Dunkaaniyape karera dabaaba yuushsha aatha giigisada, magarajuwa Dunkaaniya penge bolla kaqa.<verse eid="EXO 40:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 40:9"/>“Yaatada, geeshsha zaytiya ekada, Geeshsha Dunkaaniyanne iya giddon de7iya ubbaba tiyada, dummaya; I geeshshi gidana. <verse eid="EXO 40:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 40:10"/>Kaallada, xuussa yarsho bessinne iyan go7etiya miishe ubbaa tiyada, dummaya; I polo geeshshi gidana. <verse eid="EXO 40:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 40:11"/>Meecha keriyanne iya wothiya miisheta tiyada, dummaya.<verse eid="EXO 40:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 40:12"/>“Aaronanne iya nayta Geeshsha Dunkaaniya penge ehada haathan enta meecca. <verse eid="EXO 40:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 40:13"/>Kahine ma7uwa Aarona mayzada, I taw kahinetethan oothana mela iya tiyada, dummaya. <verse eid="EXO 40:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 40:14"/>Iya adde naytaka ehada shamize mayza. <verse eid="EXO 40:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 40:15"/>Enti taw kahinetethan oothana mela, enta aaway tiyetidaysada, entaka tiya. He tishsha gaason, yaana laytha ubban, enti taw kahine gididi oothana” yaagis.<verse eid="EXO 40:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 40:16"/>Musey, ubbaba Goday kiitidaysada oothis.<verse eid="EXO 40:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 40:17"/>Hessa gisho, enti Gibxefe keyida nam7antho laythan, koyro ageenan, koyro gallasan Geeshsha Dunkaaniya tokis. <verse eid="EXO 40:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 40:18"/>Musey, Dunkaaniya tohota essis, tuuqeta, liyootanne tuussata aathis. <verse eid="EXO 40:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 40:19"/>Goday kiitidaysada, Musey, garsa kamaanne bolla kamaa Dunkaaniya bolla kammis.<verse eid="EXO 40:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 40:20"/>Yaatidi, tammu kiitata oykida nam7u loche shuchata, Taabotiya giddon wothis. Tooho kaso mithata Taabotiya sagaayotan aathis; nagara atotetha kamaka Taabotiya bolla wothis. <verse eid="EXO 40:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 40:21"/>Taabotiya Geeshsha Dunkaaniya giddo gelsidi, geshe magarajuwa kaqis. Yaatidi, Goday kiitidaysada, Caaqo Taabotiya kammis.<verse eid="EXO 40:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 40:22"/>Musey, xarpheezaa Geeshsha Dunkaaniya giddo gelsidi, magarajuwafe karera, pudeha baggan wothis. <verse eid="EXO 40:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 40:23"/>Goday kiitidaysada, Godaa sinthan wothiya geeshsha daabbuwa iya bolla wothis.<verse eid="EXO 40:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 40:24"/>Xompe wothiya kocaa, Geeshsha Dunkaaniya giddo gelsidi, xarpheezape sintha baggara Geeshsha Dunkaaniyas dugeha baggan wothis. <verse eid="EXO 40:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 40:25"/>Goday kiitidaysada, Musey, Godaa sinthan xompeta oythis. <verse eid="EXO 40:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 40:26"/>Musey, worqa yarsho bessa Geeshsha Dunkaaniya giddo gelsidi, magarajuwafe sintha baggara wothis. <verse eid="EXO 40:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 40:27"/>Goday kiitidaysada, sawiya ixaane iya bolla cuyisis. <verse eid="EXO 40:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 40:28"/>Geeshsha Dunkaaniya pengen magarajuwa kaqis.<verse eid="EXO 40:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 40:29"/>Xuugetiya yarsho bessi, Geeshsha Dunkaaniya penge sinthan wothis. Goday kiitidaysada, iya bolla xuussa yarshonne katha yarsho yarshis.<verse eid="EXO 40:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 40:30"/>Meecha keriya Geeshsha Dunkaaniyapenne yarsho bessaafe giddon wothidi, iyan haathe kunthis. <verse eid="EXO 40:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 40:31"/>Musey, Aaroninne iya nayti banta kushiyanne tohuwa iyan meecetidosona. <verse eid="EXO 40:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 40:32"/>Goday kiitidaysada, enti Geeshsha Dunkaaniya geliya wode woyko yarsho bessi shiiqiya wode hessa oothosona.<verse eid="EXO 40:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 40:33"/>Geeshsha Dunkaaniyanne yarsho bessa yuushshi aathidi dabaaba giigisidi, he dabaaba pengen magarajo kaqis. Hessada oothidi, Musey oosuwa polis.<verse eid="EXO 40:33"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Godaa Bonchuwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="NUM 9:15-23">Taybo 9:15-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 40:34"/>Hessafe guye, shaaray Geeshsha Dunkaaniya kammis; Godaa bonchoyka iya kumis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 8:10-11">1 Kawo 8:10-11</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 6:4">Isa 6:4</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 43:4-5">Hiz 43:4-5</ref>; <ref loc="REV 15:8">Qon 15:8</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="EXO 40:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 40:35"/>Shaaray Geeshsha Dunkaaniya kammida gishonne Godaa bonchoy iyan kumida gisho, Musey iya giddo gelanaw danda7ibeenna.<verse eid="EXO 40:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 40:36"/>Isra7eeleti banta de7iya bessaa yeddidi, baanaw dendey, he shaaray Dunkaaniyape dendiya wodena. <verse eid="EXO 40:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 40:37"/>Shin shaaray dendonna ixiko, enti banta de7iya bessaa yeddidi bookona. <verse eid="EXO 40:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EXO 40:38"/>Godaa shaaray gallas gallas Geeshsha Dunkaaniya kammees, qamma qamma qassi shaara giddon tamay eexees. Isra7eele asay biya wode ubban he shaara be7oosona.<verse eid="EXO 40:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 40"/>
</usx>
